ght: 28.7pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.8pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 28.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">MY-355</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 28.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">5W</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 28.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">350L/H</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.2pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 28.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"132\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">0.80M</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">&nbsp;</span></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-25 10:59:03', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(25, NULL, 5, NULL, 27, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'SALIFERT CALCIUM', 'Salifert Calcium Test Kit provides accurate and reliable measurement of calcium levels in marine, freshwater, and pond aquariums. With a precision color-change system, 5 mg/L measurement steps, and accuracy of 10 mg/L, it helps maintain the optimal calcium range (420–450 mg/L) essential for healthy coral growth, coralline algae development, and overall aquatic health. Sufficient for 50–100 tests.', 'salifert-calcium', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Salifert-Calcium.webp', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Salifert-Calcium-v1.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Salifert-Calcium-v2.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SALIFERT', NULL, 95, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Calcium is a major constituent of coralline algae, the skeletal material of hard corals and the skeletal needles of soft/leather corals. In many cases too low a calcium concentration retards coral and coralline algae growth</p>\r\n<p>Calcium also&nbsp;fulfills many important biological functions</p>\r\n<p>In a healthy aquarium, the growth and multiplication of corals, calcareous algae and other organisms can result in calcium depletion. To maintain a stable environment it is important that the calcium content should not fluctuate by more than 15 mg/L from the optimum range of 420 &ndash; 450 mg/L so regular testing should be carried out.</p>\r\n<p>This means that any calcium test used should have an accuracy of significantly less than 15mg/L otherwise it will be difficult to monitor such fluctuations</p>\r\n<p>The&nbsp;Salifert test kit measures in steps of 5 mg/L and has an accuracy of 10 mg/L</p>\r\n<p>The color change is precise, detecting small but significant fluctuations in the concentration of calcium</p>\r\n<p>The test is not affected by magnesium</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Sufficient for 50-100 tests.</strong><br>Can be used for marine water, freshwater and garden pond water</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 08:52:58', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(26, NULL, 6, NULL, 26, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Brightwell Aquatics Code A', 'Brightwell Aquatics Code A is a highly concentrated marine alkalinity supplement designed to help maintain stable carbonate hardness (KH) levels in reef and marine aquariums. Proper alkalinity is essential for healthy coral growth, skeletal development, and maintaining stable pH levels in saltwater systems.\r\n\r\nThis advanced formula provides a balanced source of carbonate and bicarbonate ions to support the growth of hard corals, coralline algae, clams, and other calcifying invertebrates. Brightwell Aquatics Code A is formulated for easy dosing and rapid mixing without clouding aquarium water when used correctly.', 'brightwell-aquatics-code-a', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/JHGHGFYTF (1).jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/91kFiMtfLZL._AC_SX522_.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Brightwell Aquatics Code A is a highly concentrated marine alkalinity supplement designed to help maintain stable carbonate hardness (KH) levels in reef and marine aquariums. Proper alkalinity is essential for healthy coral growth, skeletal development, and maintaining stable pH levels in saltwater systems.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">This advanced formula provides a balanced source of carbonate and bicarbonate ions to support the growth of hard corals, coralline algae, clams, and other calcifying invertebrates. Brightwell Aquatics Code A is formulated for easy dosing and rapid mixing without clouding aquarium water when used correctly.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Key Features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Concentrated alkalinity supplement for marine and reef aquariums</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Helps maintain stable KH and pH levels</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Supports healthy coral and coralline algae growth</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Ideal for SPS, LPS, and mixed reef systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Fast-dissolving and easy-to-dose liquid formula</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Suitable for regular reef maintenance</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Can be used as part of a complete calcium and alkalinity system</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Regular monitoring of alkalinity is recommended to maintain a stable and healthy reef environment.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 08:58:58', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(27, NULL, 6, NULL, 25, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Brightwell Aquatics Fish Recover M', 'Brightwell Aquatics Fish Recover M is a specially formulated water conditioner designed to help reduce stress and support recovery in freshwater and marine aquarium fish after transport, handling, aggression, disease treatment, or environmental changes. The advanced formula promotes a healthier slime coat and helps fish regain normal activity levels more quickly during stressful situations.', 'brightwell-aquatics-fish-recover-m', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS FISH RECOVER M 250 ML.png', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong>Brightwell Aquatics Fish Recover M</strong> is a specially formulated water conditioner designed to help reduce stress and support recovery in freshwater and marine aquarium fish after transport, handling, aggression, disease treatment, or environmental changes. The advanced formula promotes a healthier slime coat and helps fish regain normal activity levels more quickly during stressful situations.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">This conditioner is ideal for use when introducing new fish, after water changes, during quarantine, or following medication treatments. Fish Recover helps create a more comfortable environment by supporting the fish&rsquo;s natural protective barrier and improving overall resilience without affecting biological filtration when used as directed.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Key Features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Helps reduce stress in aquarium fish</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Supports recovery after transport, illness, or handling</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Promotes healthy slime coat production</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Suitable for freshwater and marine aquariums</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Ideal for quarantine and acclimation use</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Safe for biological filtration</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Easy-to-dose liquid formula</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Helps improve overall fish well-being during stressful conditions</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong>Directions</strong>:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Add directly to the aquarium or quarantine tank according to the recommended dosage on the bottle. Can be used during acclimation, after water changes, or whenever fish show signs of stress.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 09:15:03', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(28, NULL, 6, NULL, 24, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Brightwell Aquatics NeoNitro', 'Brightwell Aquatics NeoNitro is a concentrated nitrogen supplement designed for planted freshwater aquariums to help maintain healthy nitrate levels and promote strong aquatic plant growth. It provides bioavailable nitrogen in a safe and effective form, helping plants develop vibrant color, stronger stems, and faster growth while preventing nutrient deficiencies commonly seen in heavily planted tanks.\r\n\r\nNeoNitro is especially useful in aquariums with low fish stock, high plant density, or aggressive nutrient export systems where nitrate levels can become too low for proper plant health. Maintaining balanced nitrate levels supports photosynthesis and helps reduce the chances of stunted growth or yellowing leaves.', 'brightwell-aquatics-neonitro', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Picsart_24-05-28_16-24-09-582.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong>Brightwell Aquatics NeoNitro </strong>is a concentrated nitrogen supplement designed for planted freshwater aquariums to help maintain healthy nitrate levels and promote strong aquatic plant growth. It provides bioavailable nitrogen in a safe and effective form, helping plants develop vibrant color, stronger stems, and faster growth while preventing nutrient deficiencies commonly seen in heavily planted tanks.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong>NeoNitro </strong>is especially useful in aquariums with low fish stock, high plant density, or aggressive nutrient export systems where nitrate levels can become too low for proper plant health. Maintaining balanced nitrate levels supports photosynthesis and helps reduce the chances of stunted growth or yellowing leaves.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">The formula is highly concentrated, making dosing simple and economical for both beginner and advanced aquascapers. It can be used alongside complete fertilization systems for balanced nutrient management.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Key Features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Concentrated nitrogen supplement for planted aquariums</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Helps maintain healthy nitrate levels</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Promotes lush growth and vibrant plant coloration</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Prevents nitrogen deficiency symptoms in aquatic plants</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Ideal for high-tech and heavily planted tanks</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Suitable for freshwater planted aquariums</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Easy and precise liquid dosing</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Safe for fish and invertebrates when used as directed</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Directions:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Dose according to aquarium size and desired nitrate level. Regular water testing is recommended to maintain balanced nutrient levels for optimal plant growth.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-06 09:18:53', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(29, NULL, 6, NULL, 23, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS RAZOR', 'Brightwell Aquatics Razor is an advanced aquarium cleaning solution specially formulated to help keep marine and freshwater aquariums cleaner, clearer, and more visually appealing. This powerful systemic cleaning formula targets unwanted organic buildup, debris, coatings, and waste accumulation on rocks, decorations, aquarium walls, and substrate surfaces, making maintenance easier and more effective.', 'brightwell-aquatics-razor', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS RAZOR 250 ML.png', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Brightwell Aquatics Razor is an advanced aquarium cleaning solution specially formulated to help keep marine and freshwater aquariums cleaner, clearer, and more visually appealing. This powerful systemic cleaning formula targets unwanted organic buildup, debris, coatings, and waste accumulation on rocks, decorations, aquarium walls, and substrate surfaces, making maintenance easier and more effective.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">The unique polymer-based formula gently loosens stubborn deposits and suspended particles, allowing them to be more easily removed through filtration, scraping, or siphoning. Razor also helps prevent waste particles from settling and accumulating over time, improving overall water clarity and reducing maintenance frequency.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Key Features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Advanced systemic aquarium cleaning solution</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Helps loosen debris, coatings, and organic buildup</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Improves water clarity and overall aquarium appearance</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Prevents particles from settling on rocks and decorations</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Makes scraping and cleaning easier</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Suitable for marine, reef, and freshwater aquariums</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Helps keep aquarium glass cleaner for longer</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Easy-to-dose liquid formula</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Ideal for use in aquariums experiencing excess buildup, cloudy appearance, or dirty surfaces, Razor supports a cleaner and healthier aquatic environment when used as directed.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 09:30:17', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(30, NULL, 6, NULL, 22, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS REPLENISH', 'Brightwell Aquatics Replenish is a premium freshwater remineralizer designed to restore essential minerals and electrolytes removed by reverse osmosis (RO), deionized (DI), or purified water filtration. It helps create a healthier and more stable aquatic environment by replenishing vital elements required for fish, shrimp, plants, and beneficial bacteria.', 'brightwell-aquatics-replenish', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/41HOQuph2L._AC_.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, 'BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS REPLENISH 250 ML', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Brightwell Aquatics Replenish is a premium freshwater remineralizer designed to restore essential minerals and electrolytes removed by reverse osmosis (RO), deionized (DI), or purified water filtration. It helps create a healthier and more stable aquatic environment by replenishing vital elements required for fish, shrimp, plants, and beneficial bacteria.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">This advanced formula restores general hardness (GH) without significantly affecting carbonate hardness (KH), making it ideal for planted aquariums, shrimp tanks, discus aquariums, and other soft-water setups. Replenish provides important minerals such as calcium, magnesium, potassium, and trace elements that support osmoregulation, proper growth, vibrant coloration, and overall aquatic health.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Key Features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Restores essential minerals to RO, DI, and purified water</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Increases general hardness (GH) without heavily raising KH</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Ideal for planted aquariums and freshwater shrimp tanks</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Supports healthy fish growth and vibrant coloration</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Provides calcium, magnesium, potassium, and trace minerals</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Helps maintain stable water chemistry</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Safe for freshwater fish, shrimp, snails, and aquatic plants</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Suitable for routine water preparation and water changes</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Directions:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Add the recommended dosage to purified water before introducing it into the aquarium. Adjust dosage according to the desired GH level and aquarium requirements.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 09:34:37', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(31, NULL, 6, NULL, 21, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Fauna Marin Ready to Reef', 'Fauna Marin Ready to Reef is a complete all-in-one liquid supplement designed to provide essential minerals, trace elements, and nutrients required for healthy coral growth and stable reef aquarium conditions. Specially formulated for marine and reef tanks, it helps maintain important water parameters while supporting vibrant coloration, skeletal growth, and overall coral health.', 'fauna-marin-ready-to-reef', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Untitled-1.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/FAUNA MARINE READY 2 REEF 1L.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'FAUNA MARIN', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Fauna Marin Ready to Reef is a complete all-in-one liquid supplement designed to provide essential minerals, trace elements, and nutrients required for healthy coral growth and stable reef aquarium conditions. Specially formulated for marine and reef tanks, it helps maintain important water parameters while supporting vibrant coloration, skeletal growth, and overall coral health.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">This balanced formula simplifies reef maintenance by combining multiple essential elements into a single easy-to-dose solution. It is ideal for soft corals, LPS, SPS corals, and other reef inhabitants, making it suitable for both beginner and advanced reef keepers looking for convenient daily supplementation.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Ready to Reef helps replenish elements consumed naturally by corals and biological processes, promoting long-term aquarium stability and improved reef vitality. The highly concentrated formula ensures efficient dosing without unnecessary additives.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Key Features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Complete all-in-one reef aquarium supplement</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Supplies essential minerals and trace elements</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Supports coral growth, coloration, and health</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Helps maintain stable reef water chemistry</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Suitable for SPS, LPS, and soft coral aquariums</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Easy daily dosing formula</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Highly concentrated and efficient</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Ideal for beginner and advanced reef hobbyists</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Directions:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Dose according to aquarium size and coral consumption. Regular water testing is recommended to maintain optimal reef parameters.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 09:40:11', 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
