(32, NULL, 9, '18%', 20, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'The Chihiros B Series', 'The Chihiros B Series LED Light is a premium RGB aquarium light designed to enhance the beauty of planted tanks. Featuring a combination of white and RGB LEDs, it promotes healthy plant growth while bringing out the vibrant colors of fish, shrimp, and aquatic plants. With app control, adjustable brightness, and a sleek aluminum body, it offers both performance and style for modern aquariums.', 'the-chihiros-b-series', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/07/WhatsAppImage2026-07-01at3.12.01PM.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-B-Series-LED-Lighting-System-chihiros-aquatic-studio-1680744336.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-B-Series-LED-Lighting-System-chihiros-aquatic-studio-1680744350.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-B-Series-LED-Lighting-System-chihiros-aquatic-studio-1680744378.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/chihiros b series.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/chihiros b series 1.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CHIHIROS', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"775\">The <strong data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"483\">Chihiros B Series LED Light</strong> is a high-performance lighting solution crafted for planted aquariums. Designed with a blend of powerful white LEDs and RGB 3-in-1 LEDs, it delivers bright, balanced illumination that supports aquatic plant growth while enhancing the natural colors of fish, shrimp, and aquascaping elements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"1145\">Its slim aluminum alloy construction provides excellent heat dissipation and a clean, modern appearance that complements any aquarium setup. The adjustable mounting system allows for easy installation, while brightness levels can be customized through manual controls or Bluetooth app connectivity, giving aquarists greater flexibility over their lighting environment.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1522\">Engineered for energy efficiency and long-lasting performance, the Chihiros B Series creates a vibrant and visually appealing underwater landscape while maintaining low power consumption. Whether you\'re growing lush aquatic plants or showcasing colorful aquatic life, this LED light provides the intensity, color rendition, and control needed for a thriving planted aquarium.</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-width: 3px; border-spacing: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 92.6599%; height: 522px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 12.2838%; border-width: 3px;\" height=\"59\"><strong>Product name</strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"et7\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 25.7469%; border-width: 3px; text-align: center;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; Tank size</strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"et7\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 34.3947%; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>LED quantity</strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"et7\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 14.8414%; border-width: 3px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Luminous Flux</strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"et7\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 12.7726%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>Power</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et5\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 12.2838%; border-width: 3px;\" height=\"59\">B20</td>\r\n<td class=\"et8\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 25.7469%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px;\">20-30CM TANK</td>\r\n<td class=\"et8\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 34.3947%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px;\">24pcs white+6pcs RGB 3in1</td>\r\n<td class=\"et8\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 14.8414%; border-width: 3px;\">813</td>\r\n<td class=\