=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 14.8414%; border-width: 3px;\">3256</td>\r\n<td class=\"et9\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 12.7726%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px;\">51.3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 09:51:04', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(33, NULL, 9, '18%', 19, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'CHIHIROS CII WHITE', 'Equipped with built-in Bluetooth connectivity, the C2 White can be controlled through the My Chihiros app, allowing users to adjust brightness levels, set timers, and create sunrise and sunset lighting effects for a more natural aquarium environment.', 'chihiros-cii-white', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-C-Series-II-LED-Light-Chihiros-Aquatic-Studio-476816333.webp', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-CII-White-_Built-in-Bluetooth_-Chihiros-1661132722.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-CII-White-_Built-in-Bluetooth_-Chihiros-1661132725.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-C-Series-II-LED-Light-Chihiros-Aquatic-Studio-476816239.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-C-Series-II-LED-Light-Chihiros-Aquatic-Studio-476816333.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-CII-White-_Built-in-Bluetooth_-Chihiros-1661132717.avif\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-CII-White-_Built-in-Bluetooth_-Chihiros-1661132712.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, 'CHIHIROS CII WHITE', '1 year', NULL, NULL, 'CHIHIROS', NULL, 99, 1, 0, 0, '<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Chihiros C II White</strong> is a compact and elegant LED lighting solution designed specifically for nano aquariums, desktop planted tanks, and Wabi-Kusa setups. Featuring powerful white LEDs, it delivers bright and natural illumination that enhances plant growth while showcasing the true colors of fish and aquascaping elements. Its minimalist modern design makes it ideal for rimless aquariums and decorative nano setups.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Equipped with built-in Bluetooth connectivity, the C2 White can be controlled through the My Chihiros app, allowing users to adjust brightness levels, set timers, and create sunrise and sunset lighting effects for a more natural aquarium environment. The lightweight body and adjustable mounting system provide easy installation on small aquariums with glass thickness up to 8 mm.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Chihiros C II&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Tank Size=</strong>20-30cm</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Lighting Size=</strong>W240*D45*H14MM</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Power Consumption=</strong>16W</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>LED quantity=</strong>60pcs</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Luminous flux=</strong>1500lm</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>LED colors=</strong>White</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Power input=</strong>AC100-240V, 50-60HZ</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>LED Iifetime=</strong>Over 30,000hrs</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Glass thickness=</strong>Max 8mm</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 09:57:53', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(34, NULL, 19, '18%', 18, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'CHIHIROS CII WHITE BASE STAND', 'This stand is perfect for aquascapers who want a minimalistic display setup with improved flexibility and viewing angles. Please note that the light unit is sold separately and the stand is specifically made for the Chihiros CII series.', 'chihiros-cii-white-base-stand', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-C2-LED-light-base-chihiros-aquatic-studio-1661133578.avif', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-C2-LED-light-base-chihiros-aquatic-studio-1661133576.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-C2-LED-light-base-chihiros-aquatic-studio-1661133573.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-C2-LED-light-base-chihiros-aquatic-studio-356023934.avif\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-C2-LED-light-base-chihiros-aquatic-studio-356023865.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-C2-LED-light-base-chihiros-aquatic-studio-1661133578.avif\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/CHIHIROS CII WHITE BASE STAND.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, 'CHIHIROS CII WHITE BASE STAND', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CHIHIROS', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Chihiros CII Stand</strong> is a premium metal base stand designed specifically for the Chihiros CII aquarium light. It allows the light to be used independently without mounting it directly onto the aquarium glass, making it ideal for nano aquariums, Wabi-Kusa setups, terrariums, and rimless display tanks. The sturdy metal construction provides excellent stability while maintaining a clean and modern aesthetic. Its adjustable design allows the light arm to rotate freely for better positioning and optimal illumination coverage.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">This stand is perfect for aquascapers who want a minimalistic display setup with improved flexibility and viewing angles. Please note that the light unit is sold separately and the stand is specifically made for the Chihiros CII series.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 10:05:33', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(35, NULL, 9, '18%', 17, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'CHIHIROS RGB VIVID 2 MATE', 'The Chihiros RGB VIVID 2 Mate is a premium WRGB LED lighting system designed for planted aquariums. Delivering powerful illumination with customizable RGB spectrum control, it enhances plant coloration, fish vibrancy, and aquascape depth. Featuring Bluetooth app control, sunrise and sunset simulation, and a sleek aluminum body, it offers professional-grade lighting performance for aquascaping enthusiasts.', 'chihiros-rgb-vivid-2-mate', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/40C89A51-9A0B-47E7-B242-A6D97F33ADC4.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-RGB-VIVID-II-Mate-LED-Light-Chihiros-Aquatic-Studio-578660046.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/IMG-5453.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/chihiros-vivid-2-mate-1.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, '1 year', NULL, NULL, 'CHIHIROS', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"875\">The <strong data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"495\">Chihiros RGB VIVID 2 Mate</strong> is a high-performance WRGB LED aquarium light engineered for aquascapers who demand exceptional color rendering, plant growth, and visual impact. Equipped with advanced 3-in-1 RGB LED technology, it produces intense, balanced illumination that highlights the rich colors of aquatic plants, fish, and hardscape elements while creating a natural and vibrant underwater environment.</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 73.6737%; height: 451px; border-width: 3px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 40.3003%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>Feature</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 59.761%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>Specification</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 40.3003%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>Model</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 59.761%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\">Chihiros RGB VIVID 2 MATE</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 44.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 40.3003%; height: 44.8px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>Power Consumption</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 59.761%; height: 44.8px; border-width: 3px;\">125W</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 40.3003%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>Luminous Flux</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 59.761%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\">~10,000 lm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 40.3003%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>LED Quantity</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 59.761%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\">140 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 40.3003%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>LED Type</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 59.761%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\">3-in-1 RGB</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 40.3003%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>Fixture Colors</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 59.761%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\">Matte Black</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 40.3003%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>Suitable Tank Size</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 59.761%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\">60cm &ndash; 90cm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 40.3003%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>Control</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 59.761%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\">Built-in Bluetooth (My Chihiros App)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 40.3003%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>Mounting</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 59.761%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\">Hanging Kit (Included)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 40.3003%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><strong>Cooling</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 59.761%; height: 22.4px; border-width: 3px;\">Active Fan (Built-in)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1286\">Designed with both performance and aesthetics in mind, the VIVID 2 Mate features a premium aluminum housing that provides efficient heat dissipation and a modern, minimalist appearance. Through the <strong data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1094\">My Chihiros App</strong>, users can fully customize brightness levels and RGB color channels, allowing precise control over lighting intensity and spectrum to suit different aquascaping styles and plant requirements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1641\">The integrated sunrise and sunset simulation functions help create a more natural lighting cycle, reducing stress on aquatic life while enhancing the overall viewing experience. Offering impressive brightness and professional-level control, the VIVID 2 Mate delivers the performance needed for demanding planted aquariums without unnecessary complexity.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1872\">Combining powerful WRGB technology, smart app connectivity, and elegant design, the Chihiros RGB VIVID 2 Mate is an excellent choice for hobbyists seeking vibrant colors, healthy plant growth, and stunning aquascape presentation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1872\"><strong>WARRANTY=1 YEAR</strong></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 10:09:13', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(36, NULL, 19, '18%', 16, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'The Chihiros RGB VIVID 2 Shades with Mirror', 'Designed with both functionality and aesthetics in mind, the shades provide a cleaner and more professional aquascaping setup while improving viewing comfort. They are easy to install and attach directly into the dedicated slots on the RGB VIVID 2 fixture without requiring any additional tools or mounting accessories.', 'the-chihiros-rgb-vivid-2-shades-with-mirror', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-RGB-vivid2-shade-with-mirror-chihiros-1661132807.webp', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-RGB-VIVID-II-Mate-Shades-Chihiros-Aquatic-Studio-578706031.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Chihiros-RGB-VIVID-II-Mate-Shades-Chihiros-Aquatic-Studio-578706130.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, 'The Chihiros RGB VIVID 2 Shades with Mirror', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CHIHIROS', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Chihiros RGB VIVID 2 Shades with Mirror are premium accessory shades specially designed for the Chihiros RGB VIVID II and RGB VIVID 2 Mate LED lights. These shades help reduce glare and light spill while enhancing light efficiency by reflecting emitted light back into the aquarium through the integrated mirror-finish inner surface.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Designed with both functionality and aesthetics in mind, the shades provide a cleaner and more professional aquascaping setup while improving viewing comfort. They are easy to install and attach directly into the dedicated slots on the RGB VIVID 2 fixture without requiring any additional tools or mounting accessories.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Perfect for high-end planted tanks and aquascapes, these mirror shades help maximize light penetration and improve overall visual presentation of the aquarium.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 10:12:03', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(37, NULL, 9, '18%', 15, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'The Chihiros WRGB II 60 is a premium RGB LED lighting system', 'The Chihiros WRGB II is a premium RGB LED lighting system designed for high-tech planted aquariums and professional aquascapes. Featuring advanced RGB 3-in-1 LED technology, it delivers powerful illumination, exceptional color rendition, and vibrant plant growth while enhancing the natural beauty of fish and hardscape. With Bluetooth app control, customizable lighting effects, and a sleek aluminum body, it is a top choice for serious aquascaping enthusiasts.', 'the-chihiros-wrgb-ii-60-is-a-premium-rgb-led-lighting-system', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 9, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/WRGB120II_12113_63fdc6534c33e2_10402652_WRGB120II_jpeg.webp', '[]', 'None', NULL, 'The Chihiros WRGB II 60 is a premium RGB LED lighting system', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 100, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"915\">The <strong data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"540\">Chihiros WRGB II</strong> is a high-performance RGB LED aquarium light engineered to meet the demands of advanced planted aquariums and professional aquascaping setups. Utilizing advanced RGB 3-in-1 LED technology, it produces intense, balanced illumination that promotes healthy plant growth while bringing out rich, natural colors in aquatic plants, fish, shrimp, and decorative hardscape elements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1261\">Designed for aquascapers seeking superior lighting performance, the WRGB II provides the intensity needed to support demanding aquatic plants, including carpeting species and colorful red plants that require strong, consistent light. Its advanced spectrum enhances plant coloration and creates a vibrant, visually striking underwater landscape.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1628\">The light features an ultra-slim aluminum alloy body that combines durability, efficient heat dissipation, and a modern minimalist appearance. Through the built-in Bluetooth controller and <strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1471\">My Chihiros App</strong>, users can easily adjust brightness levels, fine-tune RGB color channels, and create automated sunrise and sunset effects for a more natural lighting cycle.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1892\">With powerful light output, premium construction, and extensive customization options, the Chihiros WRGB II is widely regarded as one of the leading lighting solutions for planted aquariums, delivering both outstanding plant growth and exceptional visual appeal.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-06 10:16:19', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(38, NULL, 9, '18%', 14, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'The Chihiros Z TINY Light', 'The Chihiros Z Tiny Light is a premium nano aquarium spotlight designed to provide focused, customizable illumination for compact aquascapes. With adjustable beam angles, tunable color temperatures, and Bluetooth app control, it allows hobbyists to create stunning visual effects while highlighting plants, driftwood, and decorative elements. Its sleek aluminum construction and compact size make it an excellent choice for nano planted aquariums, shrimp tanks, and wabi-kusa displays.', 'the-chihiros-z-tiny-light', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/07/Chihiros-Z-Light-TINY---Advanced-Zoomable-Aquarium-Light-Chihiros-Aquatic-Studio-1685766812.avif', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/07/Chihiros-Z-Light-TINY---Advanced-Zoomable-Aquarium-Light-Chihiros-Aquatic-Studio-1685766815.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/Chihiros-Z-Light-TINY---Advanced-Zoomable-Aquarium-Light-Chihiros-Aquatic-Studio-1685766837.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/Chihiros-Z-Light-TINY-Advanced-Zoomable-Aquarium-Light-Chihiros-Aquatic-Studio-136749781.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, '1 year', NULL, NULL, 'CHIHIROS', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"821\">The <strong data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"487\">Chihiros Z Tiny Light</strong> is a high-quality nano aquarium spotlight engineered to provide focused illumination and complete lighting control for small aquariums and aquascaping projects. Designed for hobbyists who value both performance and aesthetics, it combines powerful lighting output with advanced customization features in an ultra-compact form factor.</p>\r\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2bae888 wd-width-100 elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_title\" data-id=\"2bae888\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_title.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<div class=\"title-wrapper wd-set-mb reset-last-child wd-title-color-default wd-title-style-default wd-title-size-default text-left\">\r\n<div class=\"liner-continer\">\r\n<h4 class=\"woodmart-title-container title wd-fontsize-l\"><strong>Description</strong></h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7955ff3 wd-single-content elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_single_product_content\" data-id=\"7955ff3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_single_product_content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>Power=6W<br>Luminous flux=400LM<br>Color temperature= 2800-8000K<br>Zoom angle= 15-60 degrees<br>Function= zoom, timing, brightness adjustment, color temperature adjustment<br>APP control</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"1280\">Powered by an energy-efficient <strong data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"871\">6W LED system</strong> producing up to <strong data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"902\">400 lumens</strong>, the Z Tiny delivers bright, vibrant lighting that enhances the colors of aquatic plants, shrimp, fish, driftwood, and decorative hardscape elements. Its innovative zoomable lens allows the beam angle to be adjusted from <strong data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1138\">15&deg; to 60&deg;</strong>, enabling users to switch between a concentrated spotlight effect and a wider light spread depending on the desired aquascaping presentation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1700\">Through Bluetooth connectivity and the <strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1340\">My Chihiros App</strong>, users can fully customize the lighting experience. The adjustable <strong data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1447\">2800K&ndash;8000K color temperature range</strong> makes it easy to create warm ambient tones, natural daylight effects, or customized lighting scenes. The app also supports automated sunrise and sunset simulations, providing a more natural lighting cycle while enhancing the overall viewing experience.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"2127\">Constructed from premium aluminum, the Z Tiny offers excellent durability, efficient heat dissipation, and a modern minimalist appearance that complements contemporary rimless aquariums. Its compact spotlight head measures just <strong data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1951\">35 mm in diameter</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1975\">40 mm in height</strong>, while the complete fixture stands <strong data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2026\">230 mm tall</strong>, allowing it to blend seamlessly into small aquarium layouts without distracting from the aquascape.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 10:28:11', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(39, NULL, 10, NULL, 13, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Hikari Marine A', 'Hikari Marine A is a premium daily floating pellet food formulated for marine and saltwater fish. Enriched with high-quality marine proteins, seaweed, spirulina, and stabilized Vitamin C, it supports healthy growth, vibrant coloration, strong immunity, and overall fish vitality while helping maintain excellent water quality through superior digestibility.', 'hikari-marine-a', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 5, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/tro_010_02.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hikari', NULL, 5, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"805\"><strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"432\">Hikari Marine A</strong> is a scientifically developed premium daily diet designed to meet the nutritional requirements of larger marine fish. Created using carefully selected ingredients, this advanced floating pellet formula provides balanced nutrition that supports healthy growth, vibrant coloration, strong immune function, and long-term overall health in a wide variety of saltwater species.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"1182\">The nutrient-rich formula contains high-quality marine proteins combined with natural ingredients such as seaweed and spirulina to help enhance the natural colors of marine fish while providing essential nutrients for daily health and vitality. The addition of stabilized Vitamin C further supports immune system function and helps fish better withstand environmental stress.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1531\">Designed for natural feeding behavior, the floating pellets soften quickly in water while maintaining their structure, allowing fish to consume them comfortably without excessive nutrient loss. The highly digestible formulation reduces waste production and minimizes water contamination, helping maintain cleaner and healthier aquarium conditions.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1910\">Suitable for many popular marine aquarium species including clownfish, angelfish, tangs, butterflyfish, wrasses, and other active saltwater fish, Hikari Marine A provides complete daily nutrition for thriving marine aquariums. Regular feeding helps promote vibrant coloration, strong growth, improved vitality, and overall fish well-being while supporting stable water quality.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 10:33:57', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(40, NULL, 10, NULL, 12, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Hikari Marine S', 'Hikari Marine S is a premium daily micro pellet food specially formulated for small marine fish and reef aquarium species. Enriched with marine proteins, spirulina, seaweed, and stabilized Vitamin C, it supports healthy growth, vibrant coloration, strong immunity, and long-term vitality while helping maintain clean aquarium water through superior digestibility.', 'hikari-marine-s', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/HIKARI MARINE S 50G.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hikari', NULL, 5, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"772\"><strong data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"438\">Hikari Marine S</strong> is a scientifically formulated daily diet developed specifically for the nutritional needs of small marine fish and reef aquarium inhabitants. This premium micro pellet food provides complete and balanced nutrition to support healthy growth, enhanced coloration, immune system strength, and overall fish wellness in marine aquariums.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"1120\">Made with high-quality marine proteins, spirulina, seaweed, and other carefully selected ingredients, Marine S delivers essential nutrients that closely match the natural dietary requirements of saltwater fish. The nutrient-rich formula helps bring out vibrant natural colors while supporting active behavior, energy levels, and long-term health.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1509\">The slowly floating micro pellets are perfectly sized for smaller marine species, making feeding easier and more efficient. The pellets soften gradually while maintaining their shape, allowing fish to feed naturally without excessive waste. Its highly digestible formulation reduces nutrient loss and waste production, helping maintain cleaner water and a healthier aquarium environment.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1820\">Enhanced with stabilized Vitamin C, Marine S provides additional immune support, helping fish better cope with stress and maintain optimal health. It is an excellent daily food choice for a wide variety of small marine fish, including clownfish, gobies, chromis, damsels, wrasses, and other reef-safe species.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-06 10:37:08', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(53, NULL, 5, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'SALIFERT MAGNESIUM', 'Magnesium is a key element in seawater at 1350-1500 mg/L. It’s essential for photosynthesis, chlorophyll production, and coral/algae growth. It also helps maintain the correct calcium and alkalinity balance by slowing calcium carbonate formation, which prevents trace element loss. Low Mg can stall coral and calcareous algae growth.\r\nKeep your reef tank in perfect balance with the Salifert Magnesium Profi-Test Kit - trusted by reefers for accuracy and ease of use.', 'salifert-magnesium', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Salifert-Magnesium.webp', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Salifert-Magnesium-v3_610462ef-c4a7-416a-8b67-1efc73408270.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SALIFERT', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Keep your reef tank in perfect balance with the Salifert Magnesium Profi-Test Kit - trusted by reefers for accuracy and ease of use.</p>\r\n<p>Magnesium is a key element in seawater at 1350-1500 mg/L. It&rsquo;s essential for photosynthesis, chlorophyll production, and coral/algae growth. It also helps maintain the correct calcium and alkalinity balance by slowing calcium carbonate formation, which prevents trace element loss. Low Mg can stall coral and calcareous algae growth.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>High Accuracy</strong>: Measures in clear 30 mg/L steps with sharp color changes for easy, no-guess readings</p>\r\n<p><strong>No Interference:</strong> Results are not affected by calcium or strontium when total concentration is 200-650 ppm</p>\r\n<p><strong>Marine Water Only:</strong> Designed specifically for saltwater/reef aquariums</p>\r\n<p><strong>Up to 50 Tests Per Kit</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Complete Kit: </strong>Includes acrylic test vial, 2 measuring syringes, Mg-1, Mg-2 powder, and Mg-3 reagent.</p>\r\n<p>Magnesium gets depleted by algae growth, excessive kalkwasser dosing, or when calcium/alkalinity/pH run too high. Regular testing helps you keep levels stable for fast, healthy coral growth.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-20 12:12:37', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(41, NULL, 10, NULL, 11, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'OCEAN NUTRITION BRINE SHRIMP PLUS FLAKES', 'Ocean Nutrition Brine Shrimp Plus Flakes is a premium high-protein flake food made with real brine shrimp and quality seafood ingredients. Suitable for both freshwater and marine fish, it promotes healthy growth, vibrant coloration, and overall vitality while providing excellent palatability and easy digestion for daily feeding.', 'ocean-nutrition-brine-shrimp-plus-flakes', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/1439550267.png', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/image-44.jpeg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/image-115.png\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'OCEAN NUTRITION', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"780\"><strong data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"430\">Ocean Nutrition Brine Shrimp Plus Flakes</strong> is a premium daily flake food developed to provide complete and balanced nutrition for a wide variety of freshwater and marine tropical fish. Made with real brine shrimp and carefully selected seafood ingredients, this highly palatable formula delivers essential nutrients that support healthy growth, enhanced coloration, and long-term fish health.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"1104\">The protein-rich composition provides the energy and nutrition needed for active fish while helping maintain strong body condition and overall vitality. Enriched with essential vitamins and minerals, the formula supports immune function and promotes the natural beauty of ornamental fish by enhancing their vibrant colors.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1455\">Designed for excellent digestibility, Brine Shrimp Plus Flakes help reduce waste production and minimize water pollution, contributing to a cleaner and healthier aquarium environment. The flakes maintain their structure in water for longer periods, allowing fish at various levels of the aquarium to feed comfortably without excessive nutrient loss.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1860\">Its irresistible taste and natural attractants encourage feeding even among selective or finicky fish species, making it an excellent choice for community aquariums as well as marine and reef-safe systems. Whether used as a primary daily diet or as part of a varied feeding program, Ocean Nutrition Brine Shrimp Plus Flakes provide reliable nutrition that supports fish health, coloration, and activity.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-06 10:40:31', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(42, NULL, 14, '18 %', 10, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Aquael FZN Pro 700', 'The Aquael FZN Pro 700 Hang-On Filter is a high-performance cascade filter designed for freshwater and marine aquariums. Featuring a powerful 700 L/H flow rate, ultra-quiet submerged motor, adjustable water flow, and customizable dual-chamber filtration, it provides efficient mechanical, biological, and chemical filtration while maintaining a compact space-saving design. Ideal for aquariums from 75–130 liters, it offers reliable performance, easy maintenance, and energy-efficient operation.', 'aquael-fzn-pro-700', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/fzn-22.webp', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/z.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/z2.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, '1 year', NULL, NULL, 'AQUAEL', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"606\">The <strong data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"63\">Aquael FZN Pro 700 Hang-On Filter</strong> is a compact yet powerful filtration system designed for freshwater and marine aquariums, delivering efficient water purification while maintaining a sleek external profile. Ideal for aquariums between <strong data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"287\">75 and 130 liters</strong>, this hang-on-back cascade filter provides a strong <strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"361\">700 L/H flow rate</strong> with adjustable flow control, allowing aquarists to create the perfect water movement for planted tanks, shrimp aquariums, and community fish setups. Its slim design saves valuable aquarium space while ensuring excellent filtration performance.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"1073\">Equipped with an advanced <strong data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"653\">submerged motor</strong>, the FZN Pro 700 operates with exceptional quietness, producing a noise level of only <strong data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"752\">31&ndash;32 dB</strong>. The innovative motor design enables instant startup without manual priming and automatically resumes operation after power outages, providing uninterrupted filtration and peace of mind. This reliable performance makes it suitable for both beginner and experienced aquarists looking for hassle-free aquarium maintenance.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1693\">The filter features a spacious <strong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1140\">dual-chamber filtration system</strong> that allows complete customization of filtration media according to aquarium requirements. Users can easily combine mechanical, biological, and chemical filtration materials to create a highly effective filtration setup tailored to their livestock and aquascaping needs. The removable media containers simplify routine maintenance, while the adjustable intake tube accommodates different aquarium heights for greater installation flexibility. The unit is also compatible with an optional surface skimmer for enhanced surface cleaning and water clarity.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"2226\">Built with durable, corrosion-resistant materials, the Aquael FZN Pro 700 is engineered for long-term reliability in both freshwater and marine environments. Measuring <strong data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1888\">17.8 &times; 18.6 &times; 28.4 cm</strong> and consuming only <strong data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1925\">6.2W of power</strong>, it offers an excellent balance of performance and energy efficiency. Combining powerful filtration, ultra-quiet operation, customizable media options, and easy maintenance, the FZN Pro 700 is an outstanding choice for aquarists seeking dependable water filtration in a compact hang-on filter system.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"2226\"><strong>WARRANTY= 1 YEAR</strong></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 10:48:06', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(43, NULL, 14, '18%', 9, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'The Aquael FZN Pro 1000', 'The Aquael FZN Pro 1000 Hang-On Filter is a premium cascade filtration system designed for freshwater and marine aquariums. Featuring a powerful 900 L/H flow rate, ultra-quiet submerged motor, adjustable water flow, and a spacious multi-stage filtration chamber, it delivers exceptional mechanical, biological, and chemical filtration while maintaining a compact, space-saving design. Ideal for aquariums between 130–200 liters, it combines strong performance, easy maintenance, and reliable operation for a healthier aquarium environment.', 'the-aquael-fzn-pro-1000', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/KBXSR_Aquael_AquaEL_FILTER_FZN_PRO_1000_1.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Qrnge_Aquael_AquaEL_FILTER_FZN_PRO_1000_1.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/w533h800 (1).webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/w533h800.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, '1 year', NULL, NULL, 'AQUAEL', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"1165\">The <strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"645\">Aquael FZN Pro 1000 Hang-On Filter</strong> is a high-performance cascade filter engineered for aquarists who require powerful filtration, quiet operation, and maximum flexibility in a compact external design. Suitable for both freshwater and marine aquariums, it is an excellent choice for planted tanks, shrimp aquariums, and community fish setups. With a strong <strong data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"988\">900 L/H flow rate</strong> and adjustable flow control, the filter provides efficient water circulation while allowing users to tailor water movement according to the needs of their aquarium inhabitants.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1642\">Designed with an advanced <strong data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1219\">submerged motor system</strong>, the FZN Pro 1000 starts instantly without the need for manual priming and automatically resumes operation after power interruptions. Its ultra-quiet performance, operating at approximately <strong data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1419\">32 dB</strong>, makes it ideal for living rooms, bedrooms, offices, and other environments where silent operation is important. The slim hang-on-back construction helps save space while maintaining a clean and modern aquarium appearance.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"2291\">The filter features a spacious multi-stage filtration system equipped with <strong data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1754\">four removable media containers</strong>, allowing complete customization of mechanical, biological, and chemical filtration media. This flexible design enables aquarists to optimize filtration performance according to the specific requirements of their aquarium. Maintenance is quick and convenient thanks to the easy-access media trays, while the adjustable telescopic intake tube ensures compatibility with different aquarium heights. The unit is also compatible with an optional surface skimmer, helping improve surface cleanliness, gas exchange, and overall water clarity.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2867\">Constructed from durable, corrosion-resistant materials, the Aquael FZN Pro 1000 is built for long-term reliability in both freshwater and marine environments. Measuring <strong data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2488\">25.2 &times; 18.6 &times; 28.4 cm</strong> and consuming only <strong data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2525\">7.1W of power</strong>, it offers an efficient balance of performance and energy savings. Recommended for aquariums ranging from <strong data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2653\">130 to 200 liters</strong>, the FZN Pro 1000 provides dependable filtration, customizable media capacity, and effortless maintenance, making it an excellent solution for aquarists seeking premium filtration in a sleek hang-on filter design.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2867\"><strong>WARRANTY= 1 YEAR</strong></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 10:50:43', 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `product_identity`, `category_id`, `tax`, `row_order`, `type`, `stock_type`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `asin`, `indicator`, `cod_allowed`, `download_allowed`, `download_type`, `download_link`, `minimum_order_quantity`, `quantity_step_size`, `total_allowed_quantity`, `is_prices_inclusive_tax`, `is_returnable`, `is_cancelable`, `cancelable_till`, `is_attachment_required`, `image`, `other_images`, `video_type`, `video`, `tags`, `warranty_period`, `guarantee_period`, `made_in`, `brand`, `sku`, `stock`, `availability`, `rating`, `no_of_ratings`, `description`, `deliverable_type`, `deliverable_zipcodes`, `deliverable_city_type`, `deliverable_cities`, `shipping_method`, `pickup_location`, `status`, `date_added`, `is_on_sale`, `sale_discount`, `sale_start_date`, `sale_end_date`) VALUES
(44, NULL, 17, '18 %', 8, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'The Aquael SAS 500 Surface Skimmer', 'The Aquael SAS 500 Surface Skimmer is a compact and efficient surface filtration device designed to remove oily film, dust, plant debris, and organic buildup from the aquarium water surface. With a 500 L/H flow rate, adjustable flow control, and an automatic floating intake system, it helps improve water clarity, oxygen exchange, and light penetration while maintaining a clean and healthy aquarium environment.', 'the-aquael-sas-500-surface-skimmer', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 6, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/398070.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/aquael-sas-filter-500-skimmer (1).jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/aquael-sas-filter-500-skimmer (2).jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/aquael-sas-filter-500-skimmer (3).jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/aquael-sas-filter-500-skimmer.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, 'The Aquael SAS 500 Surface Skimmer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'AQUAEL', NULL, 6, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"960\">The <strong data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"511\">Aquael SAS 500 Surface Skimmer</strong> is a highly effective surface filtration solution designed to keep aquarium water crystal clear by continuously removing surface contaminants such as oily films, dust, plant residue, proteins, and other organic waste. By cleaning the uppermost layer of water, it significantly improves oxygen exchange between the aquarium and surrounding air while enhancing light penetration, creating a healthier environment for fish, shrimp, and aquatic plants.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1378\">Designed for aquariums ranging from <strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1018\">20 to 500 litres</strong>, the SAS 500 delivers a powerful <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1073\">500 L/H flow rate</strong> while consuming only <strong data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1112\">4.4W of power</strong>, making it both efficient and economical for daily operation. The integrated adjustable flow control allows users to customize water intake according to aquarium size and livestock requirements, ensuring gentle yet effective surface cleaning in a variety of setups.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1816\">One of its key advantages is the innovative floating intake system, which automatically adapts to changing water levels to maintain consistent surface skimming performance. The included sponge pre-filter provides an additional layer of protection by preventing shrimp, fry, and small fish from entering the motor compartment, making it particularly suitable for shrimp tanks, planted aquariums, and other sensitive aquatic environments.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"2294\">The compact design allows the skimmer to blend discreetly into the aquarium while providing reliable performance. Installation is simple using the included suction cup mounting system, and routine maintenance can be performed quickly with minimal effort. Ideal for freshwater aquariums, planted tanks, and heavily stocked setups, the Aquael SAS 500 offers an easy and effective way to maintain a clean water surface, improved water quality, and a healthier aquarium ecosystem.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 10:53:42', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(45, NULL, 13, '18%', 7, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'The Aquael Ultramax 1000', 'The Aquael Ultramax 1000 Canister Filter is a premium external filtration system designed for freshwater and marine aquariums. Featuring a powerful 1000 L/H flow rate, built-in prefilter, adjustable flow control, and large multi-stage filtration capacity, it delivers exceptional water clarity and biological stability while maintaining ultra-quiet and energy-efficient operation.', 'the-aquael-ultramax-1000', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/aquael-ultramax-1000.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/aquael-ultramax-1000 (1).jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/aquael-ultramax-1000 (2).jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/aquael-ultramax-1000 (3).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, 'The Aquael Ultramax 1000 is a premium external canister filter', '2 year', NULL, NULL, 'AQUAEL', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"1042\">The <strong data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"468\">Aquael Ultramax 1000</strong> is a high-performance external canister filter engineered for aquarists seeking powerful filtration, low maintenance, and reliable long-term operation. Suitable for both freshwater and marine aquariums, it is an excellent choice for planted tanks, community aquariums, and heavily stocked setups where maintaining superior water quality is essential. Designed for aquariums ranging from <strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"877\">100 to 300 litres</strong>, the filter delivers a strong <strong data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"930\">1000 L/H flow rate</strong> while consuming only <strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"968\">15W of power</strong>, offering an excellent balance between performance and energy efficiency.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1573\">One of the standout features of the Ultramax 1000 is its large <strong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1137\">11-litre filtration volume</strong>, which provides ample space for mechanical, biological, and chemical filtration media. The filter includes <strong data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1277\">three spacious media baskets</strong>, each with a capacity of <strong data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1317\">1.9 litres</strong>, allowing aquarists to customize filtration according to the specific needs of their aquarium. The included mechanical and biological media provide effective filtration from the start, helping maintain crystal-clear water and a stable aquatic environment.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"2180\">The integrated <strong data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1619\">built-in prefilter system</strong> captures larger waste particles before they reach the main filtration chamber, significantly reducing maintenance frequency and extending the lifespan of the primary filter media. A convenient self-priming mechanism ensures quick and easy startup without manual siphoning, while the adjustable flow control allows users to fine-tune water circulation for different aquarium setups and livestock requirements. The filter also supports a maximum head height of <strong data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2089\">160 cm</strong>, providing flexible installation options for various aquarium cabinets and configurations.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2774\">Constructed with premium components, including an ultra-quiet <strong data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2268\">ceramic rotor system</strong>, the Aquael Ultramax 1000 delivers smooth, silent operation and outstanding durability. Measuring <strong data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2386\">27 &times; 29 &times; 40 cm</strong> and utilizing <strong data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2419\">16/22 mm hoses</strong>, it is built to handle demanding filtration tasks while remaining dependable and easy to maintain. Combining powerful multi-stage filtration, large media capacity, a built-in prefilter, and exceptionally quiet performance, the Aquael Ultramax 1000 is an ideal filtration solution for aquarists who demand professional-grade water quality and reliability.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2774\"><strong>WARRANTY= 2 YEAR</strong></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 10:56:10', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(46, NULL, 13, '18%', 6, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'The Aquael Ultramax 1500', 'The Aquael Ultramax 1500 Canister Filter is a premium external filtration system designed for medium to large freshwater and marine aquariums. Featuring a powerful 1500 L/H flow rate, integrated pre-filter, large media capacity, adjustable flow control, and ultra-quiet operation, it provides exceptional water clarity, biological stability, and low-maintenance performance for demanding aquarium setups.', 'the-aquael-ultramax-1500', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/15001-1.webp', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/AquaelUtramax15002-1.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/10004_e134721d-4c9c-4bdb-9eaf-c9ef1bd4cc81-1.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/10003_aca2d802-ce4e-42ac-9687-e1473a45b5b1-1.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, 'The Aquael Ultramax 1500 is a high-performance external canister filter', '2 year', NULL, NULL, 'AQUAEL', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"1104\">The <strong data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"492\">Aquael Ultramax 1500</strong> is a high-performance external canister filter engineered to provide powerful and reliable filtration for medium to large aquariums. Designed for both freshwater and marine environments, it combines advanced filtration technology with an energy-efficient motor to deliver excellent water circulation while maintaining exceptionally quiet operation. Suitable for aquariums ranging from <strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"899\">250 to 450 litres</strong>, the Ultramax 1500 offers a strong <strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"961\">1500 L/H pump capacity</strong>, making it ideal for planted aquariums, community fish tanks, cichlid setups, and heavily stocked systems that require superior water quality.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1781\">A key feature of the Ultramax 1500 is its <strong data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1185\">integrated easy-access pre-filter</strong>, which captures larger debris before it reaches the main filtration chamber. This design significantly reduces maintenance requirements and allows routine cleaning to be performed without opening the entire filter. The large <strong data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1439\">13.5-litre filter volume</strong> provides ample space for effective mechanical and biological filtration, while the included filter media ensures excellent performance from the moment the filter is installed. Its <strong data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1643\">four filter baskets</strong>, each with a capacity of <strong data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1683\">1.9 litres</strong>, allow aquarists to customize filtration media according to the specific needs of their aquarium.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"2361\">Designed for convenience and flexibility, the filter incorporates an adjustable flow control system that enables users to regulate water movement based on aquarium size and livestock requirements. The built-in self-priming mechanism ensures quick and effortless startup, while the rotating hose connectors simplify installation and hose routing within aquarium cabinets. With a maximum head height of <strong data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2198\">170&ndash;200 cm</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2229\">16/22 mm hose connections</strong>, and two included <strong data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2267\">1.5-meter hoses</strong>, the Ultramax 1500 offers versatile installation options for a wide range of aquarium setups.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2920\">Built for long-term durability, the Aquael Ultramax 1500 features high-quality construction and a ceramic rotor shaft that ensures smooth, reliable, and whisper-quiet operation. Measuring <strong data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2572\">27 &times; 29 &times; 45.5 cm</strong> and consuming only <strong data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2608\">16W of power</strong>, it combines powerful filtration performance with energy efficiency. Offering large media capacity, low-maintenance operation, advanced filtration technology, and silent performance, the Aquael Ultramax 1500 is an ideal solution for aquarists seeking professional-grade filtration and outstanding water quality.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2920\"><strong>WARRANTY= 2 YEAR</strong></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 10:59:08', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(52, NULL, 17, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Shiruba Surface skimmer SS-250', 'The Shiruba SS-250 Surface Skimmer is a compact, energy-efficient solution for removing unsightly oil films, dust, and organic debris from your aquarium surface. Designed in Taiwan, it boosts gas exchange, oxygen levels, and light penetration for healthier fish and thriving aquatic plants.', 'shiruba-surface-skimmer-ss-250', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Shiruba-surface-skimmer-ss-250 (1).jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Shiruba-surface-skimmer-ss-250.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Shiruba', NULL, 5, 1, 0, 0, '<p>The Shiruba SS-250 Surface Skimmer is a compact, energy-efficient solution for removing unsightly oil films, dust, and organic debris from your aquarium surface. Designed in Taiwan, it boosts gas exchange, oxygen levels, and light penetration for healthier fish and thriving aquatic plants.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Removes Surface Film Instantly</strong> - Eliminates protein/oil slicks caused by fish waste, food, and dirty air for spotless water surface</p>\r\n<p><strong>Auto-Adjusting Floating Intake </strong>- Self-leveling buoy adapts to water level changes. No manual adjustment needed</p>\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Flow Rate </strong>- Control water flow to suit tanks 30&ndash;180L. Submersible outlet reduces CO2 loss in planted tanks</p>\r\n<p><strong>Shrimp &amp; Fish Safe</strong> - Intake design prevents small livestock from being sucked in</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ultra-Quiet &amp; Energy Efficient</strong> - Only 3&ndash;3.5W power consumption. Perfect for 24/7 use in home/office aquariums</p>\r\n<p><strong>Freshwater &amp; Marine Compatible</strong> - Works in planted tanks, nano reefs, and shrimp setups</p>\r\n<p><strong>Installation</strong>: Mount 2&ndash;3cm below water level with suction cups. Float automatically tracks surface.Best For: Planted tanks, nano reefs, shrimp aquariums, and any setup with surface film issues 30&ndash;180L</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-17 14:03:37', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(48, NULL, 14, '18%', 4, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'The Shiruba XB-2060', 'The Shiruba XB-2060 Hang-On Filter is a compact and efficient hang-on-back filtration system designed for aquariums up to 60 litres. Featuring multi-stage mechanical, chemical, and biological filtration, adjustable flow control, and quiet operation, it provides excellent water clarity and healthy aquarium conditions while maintaining a space-saving design ideal for nano, planted, and shrimp tanks.', 'the-shiruba-xb-2060', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 5, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Shiruba-XB-2060 (1).jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Shiruba XB-2060.png\"]', 'None', NULL, 'The Shiruba XB-2060 Hang On Filter', '1 year', NULL, NULL, 'Shiruba', NULL, 5, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"1003\">The <strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"494\">Shiruba XB-2060 Hang-On Filter</strong> is a reliable and efficient hang-on-back filtration system designed to provide effective water purification for small freshwater aquariums. Engineered and manufactured in Taiwan, this compact filter combines durable construction with advanced filtration performance, making it an excellent choice for nano aquariums, planted tanks, shrimp setups, and small community aquariums. Its space-saving design allows it to fit neatly on the back of the aquarium while delivering consistent and dependable filtration.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1527\">Built with a high-quality <strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1051\">ABS plastic body</strong>, the XB-2060 is designed for long-term durability and daily use. Its specially engineered cartridge system ensures water passes thoroughly through the filtration media, maximizing mechanical, chemical, and biological filtration efficiency. This multi-stage filtration process helps remove suspended debris, dissolved impurities, and harmful waste compounds while supporting the growth of beneficial bacteria necessary for maintaining a stable and healthy aquatic environment.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"2139\">The filter delivers a maximum flow rate of <strong data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1595\">400 litres per hour</strong> while consuming only <strong data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1639\">4.5 watts of power</strong>, providing excellent filtration performance with low energy consumption. The integrated adjustable flow control allows users to customize water movement according to the needs of their aquarium inhabitants, making it suitable for delicate shrimp, small fish species, and planted aquariums where controlled water circulation is preferred. An automatic restart feature ensures the filter resumes operation after power interruptions without requiring manual priming, adding convenience and reliability.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2562\">Measuring <strong data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2173\">165 &times; 115 &times; 173 mm</strong>, the Shiruba XB-2060 is suitable for aquariums up to <strong data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2240\">60 litres</strong> and operates on <strong data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2282\">AC 110V/230V, 50/60Hz</strong> power supplies. Combining compact dimensions, quiet performance, efficient multi-stage filtration, and user-friendly operation, the Shiruba XB-2060 is an excellent filtration solution for aquarists seeking dependable water quality and easy maintenance in smaller aquarium</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Warranty= 1 year</span></strong></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 11:06:02', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(49, NULL, 12, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Jebao Doser 3.4', 'The Jebao Doser 3.4 WiFi Dosing Pump is a smart 4-channel automatic dosing system designed for marine, reef, and planted aquariums. Featuring WiFi smartphone control, programmable dosing schedules, and highly accurate peristaltic pumps, it automates the delivery of calcium, magnesium, alkalinity supplements, fertilizers, and trace elements to help maintain stable water parameters with minimal effort.', 'jebao-doser-34', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 11, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/IMG_3189.jpeg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/IMG_3186.webp\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/IMG_3187.jpeg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/IMG_3188.jpeg\"]', 'None', NULL, 'Jebao Doser 3.4 is', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jebao', NULL, 100, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"948\">The <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"482\">Jebao Doser 3.4</strong> is a compact and intelligent automatic dosing pump designed to simplify aquarium maintenance by delivering precise and consistent supplementation. Suitable for marine, reef, and planted aquariums, this advanced <strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"721\">4-channel dosing system</strong> allows aquarists to automate the addition of calcium, magnesium, alkalinity buffers, trace elements, fertilizers, and other liquid supplements that are essential for maintaining stable water chemistry and healthy aquatic life.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1514\">Equipped with built-in <strong data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"994\">WiFi connectivity</strong>, the Doser 3.4 can be programmed and monitored directly from a smartphone, providing convenient control without the need for manual adjustments. Each of the four dosing heads can be configured independently and programmed for up to <strong data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1255\">24 dosing cycles per day</strong>, allowing highly customized dosing schedules tailored to the specific requirements of the aquarium. This level of precision helps prevent fluctuations in water parameters and promotes healthier coral growth, plant development, and overall aquarium stability.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"2187\">Designed with reliability and convenience in mind, the unit utilizes high-precision peristaltic pumps that deliver accurate and consistent dosing while operating quietly and efficiently. The compact body measures approximately <strong data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1810\">22.5&ndash;22.8 cm in length, 8.2&ndash;8.5 cm in width, and 6 cm in height</strong>, making it easy to install even in limited cabinet spaces. Operating on <strong data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1896\">12V power</strong> with a low power consumption of approximately <strong data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1953\">6&ndash;7.5W</strong>, the system offers energy-efficient performance while supporting a maximum dosing flow rate of <strong data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2069\">50 ml per minute</strong> and a maximum head height of <strong data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2113\">1.5 meters</strong>. The unit utilizes <strong data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2157\">4/6 mm dosing tubing</strong> for reliable liquid delivery.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2617\">The package includes the <strong data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2238\">Jebao Doser 3.4 unit</strong>, power adapter, extra pump head, and user manual, allowing quick setup and operation. Combining WiFi control, programmable multi-channel dosing, precise supplementation, and compact design, the Jebao Doser 3.4 is an excellent solution for aquarists seeking a dependable automated dosing system for maintaining optimal water chemistry and reducing daily maintenance requirements.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 11:10:17', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(50, NULL, 12, NULL, 1, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Jebao  Smat Wave Maker', 'dfghjk', 'jebao-smat-wave-maker', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/jebaomow3.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/jebaomow51.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/jebaomow3.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, 'Jebao MOW-9 Wave Maker', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jebao', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p>dfghjkl;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-06 11:12:35', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(67, NULL, 12, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'JECOD DMP', 'Jecod DMP Series Bluetooth Wave MakerHigh-performance wave maker with Bluetooth + manual control and external drive for longer life. Ultra-quiet 4-pole motor, strong flow, and energy-saving design. Suitable for both marine & freshwater aquariums.', 'jecod-dmp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/jecoddmp40.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/jecoddmp10.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/jecoddmp201.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/jecoddmp30.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'JECOD', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Jecod DMP Series:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Jecod DMP Series Bluetooth Wave MakerHigh-performance wave maker with Bluetooth + manual control and external drive for longer life. Ultra-quiet 4-pole motor, strong flow, and energy-saving design. Suitable for both marine &amp; freshwater aquariums.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Jecod DMP-10 Bluetooth Wave Maker</strong></span><br>Compact 10W Bluetooth wave maker with max 5000L/H flow. Super quiet 4-pole motor, external controller, and Bluetooth + manual control. Mini size with strong power. Perfect for small marine &amp; freshwater aquariums.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong> Bluetooth control, 10W, 5000L/H, External drive, Ultra-quiet, Safe</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Jecod DMP-20 Bluetooth Wave Maker</strong></span><br>Energy-saving 15W wave maker with strong 9000L/H flow. Bluetooth and manual control with external driver for longer life. Ultra-quiet, safe, and reliable. Ideal for medium aquariums.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong> Bluetooth control, 15W, 9000L/H, Strong flow, Ultra-quiet, Energy saving</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Jecod DMP-30 Bluetooth Wave Maker</strong></span><br>Powerful 12W wave maker with max 15000L/H flow. Features Bluetooth wireless control, external motor, and 4-pole super quiet operation. Great for large aquariums needing high circulation.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features</strong>: Bluetooth control, 12W, 15000L/H, External controller, Master/Slave wireless, Mini size</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Jecod DMP-40 Bluetooth Wave Maker</strong></span><br>High-power 30W wave maker with massive 20000L/H flow. Bluetooth control, external drive, and ultra-quiet 4-pole motor. Designed for very large marine &amp; freshwater aquariums and reef tanks.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong> Bluetooth control, 30W, 20000L/H, External driver, Safety isolation, Long life</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Common Features for DMP Series:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bluetooth + Manual control</li>\r\n<li>External drive controller - no electronics inside pump</li>\r\n<li>4-pole super quiet motorMaster and slave wireless control</li>\r\n<li>Suitable for marine &amp; freshwater aquariums</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-21 14:09:29', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(54, NULL, 5, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'SALIFERT NITRATE', 'High nitrate builds up when denitrification is incomplete or bioload is too high. It fuels unwanted algae growth, irritates corals, and slows coral growth. In a healthy reef tank, nitrate should stay below 1 mg/L. Fish-only tanks typically run higher.\r\nMost nitrate kits suffer from amine interference, giving readings lower than reality. Salifert’s unique formula eliminates amine interference for fast, reliable results in under 3 minutes.', 'salifert-nitrate', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/shopping-2.webp', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/659c2395b1aebc731824e4b3-salifert-nitrate-test-kit.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SALIFERT', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Monitor and control nitrate levels with the Salifert Nitrate Profi-Test Kit - a go-to for reef and fish-only aquariums that demand accuracy.</p>\r\n<p>High nitrate builds up when denitrification is incomplete or bioload is too high. It fuels unwanted algae growth, irritates corals, and slows coral growth. In a healthy reef tank, nitrate should stay below 1 mg/L. Fish-only tanks typically run higher.</p>\r\n<p>Most nitrate kits suffer from amine interference, giving readings lower than reality. Salifert&rsquo;s unique formula eliminates amine interference for fast, reliable results in under 3 minutes.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dual Range Testing:</strong> Low range 0.2-10 ppm for reefs | Medium range 2-100 ppm for fish-only tanks</p>\r\n<p><strong>High Sensitivity: </strong>Detects nitrate as low as 0.2 ppm</p>\r\n<p><strong>No Amine Interference:</strong> Accurate even in tanks with amino acids and other organics</p>\r\n<p><strong>Fast &amp; Easy:</strong> Simple liquid test with clear color chart. Results in less than 3 minutes.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Long Lasting: </strong>Enough reagents for &sim;50-60 testsSaltwater Use Only&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>What&rsquo;s Included:</strong><br>Acrylic test vial, 2 mL syringe, measuring spoon, NO3 Reagent 1, NO3 Reagent 2 powder, instruction manual, and color chart</p>\r\n<p><strong>Why It Matters:</strong><br>Accurate nitrate testing helps you prevent algae outbreaks and protect sensitive corals and invertebrates. Ideal for both beginner hobbyists and advanced reef keepers.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-20 12:15:14', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(55, NULL, 5, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'SALIFERT PHOSPHATE', 'Keep algae in check and protect coral growth with the Salifert Phosphate Profi-Test Kit — trusted by reefers for fast, accurate, low-range phosphate detection.\r\nHigh phosphate fuels unwanted algae blooms and can reduce coral and calcareous algae growth by up to 90% when levels exceed 0.04 mg/L. The Salifert kit detects even trace amounts in less than 5 seconds.', 'salifert-phosphate', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Salifert-Phosphate.webp', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Salifert-Phosphate-v2_a8933292-7f67-4e99-8898-a8ec8d8b3dd0.webp\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SALIFERT', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Keep algae in check and protect coral growth with the Salifert Phosphate Profi-Test Kit &mdash; trusted by reefers for fast, accurate, low-range phosphate detection.</p>\r\n<p>High phosphate fuels unwanted algae blooms and can reduce coral and calcareous algae growth by up to 90% when levels exceed 0.04 mg/L. The Salifert kit detects even trace amounts in less than 5 seconds.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Dual Range Testing: </strong>Low range 0.01&ndash;1 mg/L for reef tanks | Medium range 0.02&ndash;2 mg/L for general use</p>\r\n<p><strong>Fast Results:</strong> Color change develops in under 5 seconds</p>\r\n<p><strong>High Accuracy</strong>: Sensitive colorimetric method with sharp, easy-to-read color chart</p>\r\n<p><strong>Versatile: </strong>Works for marine, freshwater, and garden pond water</p>\r\n<p><strong>60 Tests Per Kit&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>What&rsquo;s Included:<br></strong>Test vial, PO4-1 reagent, PO4-2 reagent, color comparison chart, measuring syringe, and instruction leaflet.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Why It Matters:</strong><br>Phosphate comes from fish food, waste, and tap water. Regular testing helps you catch spikes early and maintain the ideal reef range of 0.02&ndash;0.08 ppm.&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-20 12:17:14', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(51, NULL, 14, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'The Shiruba XB-2100 Hang On Filter', 'The Shiruba XB2100 Hang-On Filter is a Taiwanese-made, premium HOB filter engineered for crystal-clear water with minimal water bypass. Perfect for aquariums 40–80L, it delivers powerful 560L/H flow while running at just 6W -quiet, efficient, and reliable.', 'the-shiruba-xb-2100-hang-on-filter', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Shiruba-XB-2100.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Shiruba-XB-2100 (1).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, '1 year', NULL, NULL, 'Shiruba', NULL, 5, 1, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Shiruba XB2100 Hang-On Filter is a Taiwanese-made, premium HOB filter engineered for crystal-clear water with minimal water bypass. Perfect for aquariums 40&ndash;80L, it delivers powerful 560L/H flow while running at just 6W &mdash; quiet, efficient, and reliable.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>1. 3-Stage Filtration - Mechanical, chemical &amp; biological in one hermetical cartridge. Water flows through media completely with no bypass<br>2. Auto-Restart Function - Patented design restarts automatically after power outages. No need to add water or re-prime<br>3. Adjustable Flow Control - Built-in flow switch lets you fine-tune circulation for bettas, shrimp, or high-flow fish<br>4. Super Quiet 6W Motor - Powerful yet silent operation. Energy-efficient for 24/7 use<br>5. Freshwater &amp; Saltwater Safe - High-quality plastic construction, ideal for planted tanks, nano reefs, and quarantine setups</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Specifications</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Model= XB2100<br>Tank Size= 40&ndash;80 L / 10&ndash;20 gallons<br>Flow Rate= Approx. 560 L/H<br>Power= 6W, AC 110V/230V 50/60Hz<br>Dimensions= 200 &times; 115 &times; 178 mm<br>Media= Cartridge with porous ceramic bio rings included<br>Origin= Designed &amp; Made in Taiwan</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Warranty= 1 year</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>How to Use:</strong><br>1. Insert sponge/chemical/bio media into chamber<br>2. Hang securely on tank rim &amp; prime with water<br>3. Adjust flow valve &amp; power on &mdash; auto-restart handles outages 7f9a</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Best For: Nano tanks, planted aquariums, betta tanks, shrimp setups, office aquariums 40&ndash;80L</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-17 13:43:01', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(56, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'OCEAN NUTRITION FORMULA ONE FLAKES', 'Ocean Nutrition Formula One Flakes are a gourmet, all-in-one food designed for carnivorous and omnivorous marine fish. Made with fresh seafood ingredients and formulated by aquaculture biologists, these flakes deliver high protein and essential nutrients for health, color, and growth.', 'ocean-nutrition-formula-one-flakes', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/OCEAN NUTRITION FORMULA ONE FLAKES 34GM.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'OCEAN NUTRITION', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Ocean Nutrition Formula One Flakes</strong> are a gourmet, all-in-one food designed for carnivorous and omnivorous marine fish. Made with fresh seafood ingredients and formulated by aquaculture biologists, these flakes deliver high protein and essential nutrients for health, color, and growth.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>High Protein 55%:</strong> Supports fast growth in juveniles and daily energy for adultsEnhances Color &amp; Vitality: Rich in carotenoids, vitamins, and Spirulina for brighter coloration</p>\r\n<p><strong>Immune Support: </strong>Contains garlic and immunostimulants to help fish resist diseaseHighly Palatable: Made with fresh fish, squid, plankton, and brine shrimp fish love.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Clean Water Formula: </strong>Does not cloud water when fed correctlyIngredients: Fish fillets, Euphasia Pacifica plankton, squid, mussels, brine shrimp, Spirulina, garlic, vitamins, minerals, and carotenoid pigments.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Feeding Guide:&nbsp;</strong>Feed only what fish consume in 2-3 minutes, 3-4 times daily.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Guaranteed Analysis:</strong> Protein 55% min, Fat 15.8% min, Fiber 0.8% max, Moisture 8%</p>\r\n<p><strong>maxSize</strong>: 34g pack</p>\r\n<p><strong>Perfect for clowns, angels, wrasses, anthias, and other marine tropicals.</strong></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-20 12:21:08', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(57, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'OCEAN NUTRITION FORMULA TWO FLAKES', 'OCEAN NUTRITION FORMULA TWO FLAKES are a gourmet, algae-boosted diet made for herbivorous and omnivorous tropical fish that need extra vegetable matter. Formulated by aquaculture biologists, they mimic a natural diet with fresh seafood, marine algae, Spirulina, and garlic.', 'ocean-nutrition-formula-two-flakes', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/OCEAN NUTRITION FORMULA TWO FLAKES 34GM.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'OCEAN NUTRITION', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>OCEAN NUTRITION FORMULA TWO FLAKES </strong>are a gourmet, algae-boosted diet made for herbivorous and omnivorous tropical fish that need extra vegetable matter. Formulated by aquaculture biologists, they mimic a natural diet with fresh seafood, marine algae, Spirulina, and garlic.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Algae-Rich Formula: High inclusion of marine algae, kelp, and Spirulina for tangs, angels, rabbitfish, and other grazersSupports Color &amp; Health: Packed with carotenoids, vitamins, and minerals to enhance coloration and vitality.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Immune Boost: </strong>Garlic and natural immunostimulants help fish resist stress and disease.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Highly Digestible: </strong>Premium ingredients produce less waste and keep water clearer.</p>\r\n<p><strong>No Artificial Colors/Preservatives:</strong> Clean formula that doesn&rsquo;t cloud water.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For</strong>: Tangs, Marine Angels, Batfish, Clowns, Chromis, Damsels, Parrots, Pygmy Angels, Rabbitfish, plus algae-eating invertebrates like sea stars, urchins, shrimp, and crabs.</p>\r\n<p>Feeding Guide: Feed 1-3 times daily. <strong>Only offer what fish consume in 5 minutes</strong>. Remove uneaten food.</p>\r\n<p>Ingredients: Marine algae, Spirulina, fish fillets, krill, squid, kelp, garlic, brine shrimp, vitamins, minerals, carotenoids.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-20 12:22:25', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(58, NULL, 6, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Brightwell Aquatics Code B', 'Brightwell Aquatics Reef Code B is a premium alkalinity and buffering supplement specially formulated for marine and reef aquariums. It is the carbonate component of a balanced two-part calcium and alkalinity system, designed to maintain stable pH and proper buffering capacity for healthy coral growth and reef stability. When used together with Reef Code A, it helps replicate the natural ionic balance found in seawater.', 'brightwell-aquatics-code-b', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/HFGYHYG.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/91kFiMtfLZL._AC_SX522_.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Brightwell Aquatics Reef Code B is a premium alkalinity and buffering supplement specially formulated for marine and reef aquariums. It is the carbonate component of a balanced two-part calcium and alkalinity system, designed to maintain stable pH and proper buffering capacity for healthy coral growth and reef stability. When used together with Reef Code A, it helps replicate the natural ionic balance found in seawater.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Unlike standard single-component alkalinity products, Reef Code B contains a multi-component buffering system that improves pH stability while also supplying essential major, minor, and trace minerals beneficial for corals, clams, and calcareous algae. The advanced formula contains no phosphate, silicate, or unwanted organic compounds, making it safe for sensitive reef systems.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Key Features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Advanced alkalinity and buffering supplement for reef aquariums</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Helps maintain stable pH and carbonate hardness (KH)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Supports healthy coral skeleton and calcareous algae growth</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Designed for use with Reef Code A for balanced dosing</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Contains essential major, minor, and trace minerals</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Stronger and more stable than many conventional KH supplements</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Free from phosphate, silicate, and organic impurities</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Suitable for all marine fish and reef aquariums</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Directions:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Shake well before use. Dose according to aquarium alkalinity requirements and monitor KH regularly for best results. For optimal ionic balance, use together with Reef Code A in equal amounts unless water testing indicates otherwise</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-20 13:03:48', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(59, NULL, 6, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Brightwell Aquatics  NeoPhos', 'Brightwell Aquatics NeoPhos is a high-purity liquid phosphate supplement designed for reef and marine aquariums. It is used to safely increase phosphate levels in ultra-low nutrient systems where phosphate deficiency can negatively affect coral coloration, growth, and overall biological balance. Maintaining stable phosphate levels is essential for healthy coral metabolism and proper nutrient availability in reef aquariums.', 'brightwell-aquatics-neophos', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Picsart_24-05-28_16-36-18-657.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BRIGHTWELL AQUATICS', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Brightwell Aquatics NeoPhos is a high-purity liquid phosphate supplement designed for reef and marine aquariums. It is used to safely increase phosphate levels in ultra-low nutrient systems where phosphate deficiency can negatively affect coral coloration, growth, and overall biological balance. Maintaining stable phosphate levels is essential for healthy coral metabolism and proper nutrient availability in reef aquariums.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">NeoPhos provides a controlled and efficient source of phosphorus without introducing unwanted organic material. The concentrated formula allows aquarists to make precise phosphate adjustments while helping prevent sudden nutrient swings. It is especially beneficial for SPS-dominated reef tanks, heavily skimmed systems, and aquariums using aggressive nutrient-removal methods.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Key Features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* High-purity phosphate supplement for marine and reef aquariums</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Helps raise and maintain phosphate levels safely</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Supports healthy coral growth and coloration</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Ideal for ultra-low nutrient reef systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Concentrated formula for precise dosing</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Does not add unwanted organic compounds</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Suitable for SPS, LPS, and mixed reef aquariums</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">* Easy-to-dose liquid solution</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Directions:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">Dose according to aquarium phosphate levels and desired nutrient targets. Regular phosphate testing is recommended to maintain stable reef conditions and avoid overcorrection.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-20 13:07:58', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(60, NULL, 16, '5 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'BLUE TRESURE SEA SALT', 'Blue Treasure Reef Sea Salt is a premium marine salt mix specially formulated for reef and marine aquariums.\r\nIts fast-dissolving formula makes saltwater preparation quick, easy, and convenient.\r\nThe phosphate-free and nitrate-free formulation helps support clean and stable aquarium water.\r\nIdeal for reef tanks, marine fish aquariums, and regular water-change routines.\r\nThe 20 kg pack can prepare approximately 570 liters of saltwater, depending on the required salinity.\r\nA reliable choice for both aquarium hobbyists and professional marine aquarium setups.', 'blue-tresure-sea-salt', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/BLUE TRESURE SEA SALT 20KG.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Blue Treasure Reef Sea Salt &ndash; 20 kg</strong></p>\r\n<p>Blue Treasure Reef Sea Salt is a specially formulated marine aquarium salt mix designed for reef aquariums and saltwater aquarium systems. It provides a convenient and reliable way to prepare artificial seawater for maintaining marine fish, invertebrates, corals, and other reef aquarium inhabitants.</p>\r\n<p>Formulated with the needs of marine aquarium keepers in mind, this reef sea salt is designed to dissolve quickly and efficiently, making water preparation easier during regular aquarium maintenance and water changes. Its fast-dissolving formulation helps save preparation time while supporting consistent water quality when used according to the recommended mixing instructions.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features &amp; Benefits</strong></p>\r\n<p>* Fast-Dissolving Formula: Designed to dissolve quickly in water, making it convenient for routine water changes and aquarium setup.<br>* Phosphate-Free: Formulated without added phosphates to help maintain suitable water conditions for marine aquariums.<br>* Nitrate-Free: Contains no added nitrates, supporting better control of aquarium water parameters.<br>* Suitable for Reef Aquariums: Designed for use in reef and marine aquarium environments.<br>* Convenient Water Preparation: Makes it easy to prepare saltwater for regular aquarium maintenance.<br>* Large 20 kg Pack: The generous pack size is suitable for aquarium hobbyists, professional aquarists, and frequent marine aquarium maintenance.<br>* Approximate Coverage: One 20 kg pack can prepare approximately 570 liters of saltwater, depending on the required salinity and mixing conditions.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ideal for Marine &amp; Reef Aquariums</strong></p>\r\n<p>Blue Treasure Reef Sea Salt can be used for preparing saltwater for a wide range of marine aquarium applications. It is suitable for routine water changes, new aquarium setups, quarantine systems, fish-only marine aquariums, and reef aquarium systems.</p>\r\n<p>Maintaining consistent salinity and water quality is an important part of successful marine aquarium care. Using a dedicated marine salt mix allows aquarium keepers to prepare fresh saltwater as required and maintain their aquarium through regular water-change routines.</p>\r\n<p>Suitable Applications</p>\r\n<p><strong>Blue Treasure Reef Sea Salt is suitable for:</strong></p>\r\n<p>* Reef aquariums<br>* Marine fish aquariums<br>* Saltwater aquarium systems<br>* New marine aquarium setups<br>* Routine aquarium water changes<br>* Fish-only marine systems<br>* Reef maintenance and water preparation<br>* Professional and hobbyist aquarium applications</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Highlights</strong></p>\r\n<p>Product Type: Reef Sea Salt Mix<br>Pack Size: 20 kg<br>Approximate Water Preparation: Up to 570 liters<br>Formulation: Fast dissolving<br>Phosphate: Phosphate-free<br>Nitrate: Nitrate-free<br>Application: Marine &amp; Reef Aquariums</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-21 12:21:13', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(61, NULL, 15, '5 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'AQUATIC REMEDIES CHLOR AWAY', 'Aquatic Remedies Chlor Away is a fast-acting aquarium water conditioner that makes tap water instantly safe for fish. It instantly removes chlorine, chloramines, and neutralizes heavy metals that are lethal to fish, shrimp, and aquatic plants.', 'aquatic-remedies-chlor-away', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/513LflQ3XML._SL1260_.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'AQUATIC REMEDIES', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Aquatic Remedies Chlor Away</strong> is a fast-acting aquarium water conditioner that makes tap water instantly safe for fish. It instantly removes chlorine, chloramines, and neutralizes heavy metals that are lethal to fish, shrimp, and aquatic plants.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Instant Chlorine &amp; Chloramine Removal - Detoxifies tap water on contact. Protects fish from lethal chlorine residue.</p>\r\n<p>Heavy Metal Detox - Neutralizes toxic heavy metals lurking in tap water to safeguard aquatic life.</p>\r\n<p>General Purpose Water Conditioner - Ideal when adding new water, introducing fish, spring startup, or winter shutdown.</p>\r\n<p>Freshwater &amp; Saltwater Safe - Universally formulated for community tanks, planted aquariums, goldfish, betta, shrimp, and marine/reef setups.</p>\r\n<p>Easy &amp; Precise Dosing - Simple 10ml per 100L dosage. No overdosing risk.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosage Instructions:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Standard Dose: 10ml per 100 liters of tap water</strong><br>Add directly to new water before introducing to tank. Use a chlorine test kit to confirm complete removal before adding fish.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For:</strong> Water changes, new tank setup, fish transport, and any time tap water is added to freshwater or marine aquariums.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-21 12:28:56', 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `product_identity`, `category_id`, `tax`, `row_order`, `type`, `stock_type`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `asin`, `indicator`, `cod_allowed`, `download_allowed`, `download_type`, `download_link`, `minimum_order_quantity`, `quantity_step_size`, `total_allowed_quantity`, `is_prices_inclusive_tax`, `is_returnable`, `is_cancelable`, `cancelable_till`, `is_attachment_required`, `image`, `other_images`, `video_type`, `video`, `tags`, `warranty_period`, `guarantee_period`, `made_in`, `brand`, `sku`, `stock`, `availability`, `rating`, `no_of_ratings`, `description`, `deliverable_type`, `deliverable_zipcodes`, `deliverable_city_type`, `deliverable_cities`, `shipping_method`, `pickup_location`, `status`, `date_added`, `is_on_sale`, `sale_discount`, `sale_start_date`, `sale_end_date`) VALUES
(62, NULL, 15, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'AQUATIC REMEDIES MICROLIFE-S2', 'Aquatic Remedies MicroLife S2 is a high-performance liquid bacterial suspension that rapidly establishes the nitrogen cycle in freshwater & marine aquariums. Powered by live Nitrosomonas and Nitrobacter bacteria, it converts toxic ammonia → nitrite → nitrate while biologically degrading uneaten food, fish waste, and organic sludge.', 'aquatic-remedies-microlife-s2', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/711qsaqdoiL._SX522_.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'AQUATIC REMEDIES', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Aquatic Remedies MicroLife S2</strong> is a high-performance liquid bacterial suspension that rapidly establishes the nitrogen cycle in freshwater &amp; marine aquariums. Powered by live Nitrosomonas and Nitrobacter bacteria, it converts toxic ammonia &rarr; nitrite &rarr; nitrate while biologically degrading uneaten food, fish waste, and organic sludge.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Instant Aquarium Maturation - Eliminates &ldquo;new tank syndrome.&rdquo; Add fish immediately by dosing daily for 5 days.</p>\r\n<p>Powerful Ammonia &amp; Nitrite Removal - Nitrosomonas oxidizes ammonia to nitrite; Nitrobacter converts nitrite to non-toxic nitrate.</p>\r\n<p>Biodegrades Organic Waste - Breaks down uneaten food, fish waste, and nitrogen compounds for crystal-clear water.</p>\r\n<p>Freshwater &amp; Marine Safe - Works in planted tanks, nano reefs, shrimp setups, and community aquariums.</p>\r\n<p>Reduces Sludge &amp; Odors - Maintains water clarity and supports biological balance.</p>\r\n<p>Dosage Instructions:</p>\r\n<p>New Tank Setup: 10ml per 100L daily for 5 days.</p>\r\n<p>Weekly Maintenance: 10ml per 100L once a week.</p>\r\n<p>Shake well before use. Distribute evenly across tank.</p>\r\n<p>Important: Turn off UV sterilizers &amp; ozone during use. Ensure good aeration.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;New aquarium cycling, preventing ammonia spikes, filter crashes, cloudy water, and maintaining biological stability in planted, community, and marine tanks.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-21 12:30:39', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(63, NULL, 15, '18 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Mydilab BACTO CLEAN', 'MydiLab BactoClean is a biological water conditioner that instantly establishes a bio-active habitat in your aquarium. Packed with live beneficial bacteria, it prevents “new tank syndrome,” breaks down waste, and keeps water crystal clear in both freshwater & saltwater tanks.', 'mydilab-bacto-clean', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/mydilabbactoclean180ml.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/08/file_000000007520820b9acbfde9f3a3e9e6 (1).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mydilab', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p>MydiLab BactoClean is a biological water conditioner that instantly establishes a bio-active habitat in your aquarium. Packed with live beneficial bacteria, it prevents &ldquo;new tank syndrome,&rdquo; breaks down waste, and keeps water crystal clear in both freshwater &amp; saltwater tanks.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Add Fish Instantly - <strong>Prevents new tank syndrome </strong>by immediately establishing biological filtration. No more 4-week cycling.</p>\r\n<p>Breaks Down Waste - Actively digests protein, ammonia, nitrite, excrement &amp; leftover food for superior water quality</p>\r\n<p>Reduces Fish Loss - Supports biological balance, outcompetes harmful bacteria, and keeps parameters in optimal range.</p>\r\n<p>Crystal Clear Water - Eliminates cloudiness and odors by consuming organic waste that causes poor water quality.</p>\r\n<p>Multi-Purpose Use - Perfect for initial setup, after medication, water changes, and routine maintenance.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosage Guide:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Initial Setup: 10ml per 40L of water</p>\r\n<p>After Medication: 10ml per 40L</p>\r\n<p>Water Change: 10ml per 300L or as needed for cloudy water/odors.</p>\r\n<p>Saltwater Startup: 10ml per 20L | Maintenance: 10ml per 150L</p>\r\n<p>Note: Turn UV sterilizer off during dosing</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For: </strong></p>\r\n<p>New aquarium setup, quick cycling, recovering from filter crashes, cloudy water issues, and maintaining biological balance in planted, community, and marine tanks</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-21 12:41:34', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(64, NULL, 15, '18 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Mydilab Tensiongon', 'MydiLab TensionGon is an all-in-one aquarium water conditioner that makes tap water instantly safe for fish. It removes chlorine & chloramine, neutralizes ammonia and heavy metals, and adds Vitamin B + natural plant extracts to reduce stress and protect your fish\'s slime coat.', 'mydilab-tensiongon', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/C585D2F2-84BB-4A4F-9219-C3A8B05A0BBD (1).jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mydilab', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>MydiLab TensionGon </strong>is an all-in-one aquarium water conditioner that makes tap water instantly safe for fish. It removes chlorine &amp; chloramine, neutralizes ammonia and heavy metals, and adds Vitamin B + natural plant extracts to reduce stress and protect your fish\'s slime coat.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Instant Tap Water Safety - Removes chlorine &amp; chloramine, neutralizes ammonia and heavy metals in one stepStress &amp; Disease Protection - Vitamin B reduces fish stress &amp; mortality. Natural plant extracts repair damaged slime coat to prevent bacterial infection.</p>\r\n<p>Stabilizes Water Chemistry - Inhibits nitrite accumulation and increases carbonate hardness to stabilize pH without affecting dissolved oxygen.</p>\r\n<p>Multi-Purpose Use - Ideal for new tank setup, water changes, fish transport, acclimatization, and handling.</p>\r\n<p>Reduces Water Change Frequency - Keeps water stable longer between maintenance.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosage Guide:</strong></p>\r\n<p>New tanks: 10ml per 100L before adding fish/plants</p>\r\n<p>Water changes under 50%: 10ml per 200L</p>\r\n<p>Water changes over 50%: 10ml per 150L</p>\r\n<p>Fish introduction: 10ml per 200L tank water</p>\r\n<p>Transport/handling: 1ml per 2L of water</p>\r\n<p>Best For: All aquariums -community tanks, planted setups, discus, goldfish, bettas, marine tanks, and breeding systems. A must-have for every water change.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-21 12:44:03', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(65, NULL, 15, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'mydilab clear 10', 'MydiLab Clear 10 instantly restores crystal-clear water by clumping micro-fine particles, floating algae, and debris that regular filters can\'t catch. Its gentle, phosphate-free formula is 100% safe for fish, shrimp, plants, and biofilters in both freshwater & saltwater tanks.', 'mydilab-clear-10', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 5, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/mydilabclear10500ml.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mydilab', NULL, 10, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>MydiLab Clear 10 </strong>instantly restores crystal-clear water by clumping micro-fine particles, floating algae, and debris that regular filters can\'t catch. Its gentle, phosphate-free formula is 100% safe for fish, shrimp, plants, and biofilters in both freshwater &amp; saltwater tanks.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Works Immediately - Clears cloudy water within hours by aggregating suspended particles.</p>\r\n<p>Phosphate-Free &amp; Safe - Won\'t harm fish, invertebrates, plants, or beneficial bacteria.</p>\r\n<p>Removes What Filters Miss - Targets micro-fine particles &amp; floating algae too small for mechanical filtration.</p>\r\n<p>Easy to Use - Just pour near water flow. Clumped particles sink for easy gravel vacuuming or filter removal</p>\r\n<p><strong>How to Use: Dosage: 10ml per 60L of tank water (15ml per 100L)</strong></p>\r\n<p>Application: Add near water flow, or pre-mix with tank water and pour evenly</p>\r\n<p>Effect: Cloudiness disappears after several hours as particles clump &amp; sink. Remove with gravel cleaner or filter.</p>\r\n<p>When to Use: After water changes, tank cleanups, or whenever cloudiness returns.</p>\r\n<p>Best For: New tank setups, post-cleaning cloudiness, algae blooms, and maintaining crystal-clear water in community, planted, and reef aquariums.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-21 12:46:39', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(66, NULL, 17, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Red Starfish mini protein skimmer', 'Red Starfish Mini Protein Skimmer SQ Series Compact protein skimmer specially designed for nano to medium saltwater aquariums. Effectively removes organic waste, increases oxygen, and improves water quality with adjustable water level and easy maintenance.', 'red-starfish-mini-protein-skimmer', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Red-Starfish-mini-protein-skimmer-SQ-90-PLUS.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Red-Starfish-mini-protein-skimmer-SQ-90-PLUS.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Red-Starfish-mini-protein-skimmer-SQ-70.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Red-Starfish-mini-protein-skimmer-SQ-90-PLUS (2).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Red Starfish', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Red Starfish SQ-70 Mini Protein Skimmer</strong></span><br>Compact mini protein skimmer designed for nano saltwater tanks. Features adjustable water level, fully disassembled body, and compact design with excellent performance. Helps separate organic waste and improve water quality.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Nano Tank Special - Designed for small saltwater aquariums</p>\r\n<p>Easy Maintenance - Fully disassemble body for cleaning</p>\r\n<p>Adjustable - Rotate to adjust water level</p>\r\n<p>Compact &amp; Efficient - Small size, strong performance</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Red Starfish SQ-70 PLUS Mini Protein Skimmer</strong></span><br>Delicate but powerful mini skimmer for marine aquariums. Effectively separates organic matter, increases oxygen content, and improves water quality. Compact design with strong power for crystal clear water.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Delicate but Powerful - Small size, strong performance</p>\r\n<p>Water Quality - Removes organics + increases oxygen</p>\r\n<p>Easy Use - Simple setup for marine aquariums</p>\r\n<p>Reliable Brand - Red Starfish quality</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Red Starfish SQ-90PLUS Mini Protein Skimmer</strong></span><br>High-efficiency mini protein skimmer for aquariums 90-140L. Equipped with HP-1000 7W pump, 250L/H air intake, and 75mm reaction chamber. Removes organic waste and keeps water clean and oxygen-rich.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Technical Specs:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Tank Size: 90-140L</p>\r\n<p>Pump: HP-1000 / 7W</p>\r\n<p>Air Inflow: 250 L/H</p>\r\n<p>Work Level: 180-190mm</p>\r\n<p>Size: 80x100x385mm</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Strong Skimming - 250L/H air intake for better foam</p>\r\n<p>Energy Efficient - Only 7W power consumption</p>\r\n<p>Clear Water - Separates organics &amp; improves oxygen</p>\r\n<p>Compact Body - Fits easily in sump or hang-on</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-21 13:05:52', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(68, NULL, 9, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'WEEK AQUA Z SERIES Z250S', 'Week Aqua Z250S Sea is a 60W professional full spectrum LED engineered for saltwater coral and marine fish tanks. With Bluetooth 3.0 APP control and a coral-specific spectrum, it promotes SPS/LPS coral growth, coloration, and vivid fish color while creating natural sunrise/sunset cycles.', 'week-aqua-z-series-z250s', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/WEEKAQUAZ-SERIESZ250SEA-Z (2).jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/WEEKAQUAZ-SERIESZ250SEA-Z1.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/WEEKAQUAZ-SERIESZ250SEA-Z (1).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'WEEK AQUA', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Week Aqua Z250S Sea </strong>is a 60W professional full spectrum LED engineered for saltwater coral and marine fish tanks. With Bluetooth 3.0 APP control and a coral-specific spectrum, it promotes SPS/LPS coral growth, coloration, and vivid fish color while creating natural sunrise/sunset cycles.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Coral-Specific Sea Spectrum - 60x 5054 LEDs with wavelengths tailored for reef tanks. Spectrum covers 395-470nm blue/violet peaks + 520nm + 660nm + White to enhance coral fluorescence, coralline algae, and marine fish color.</p>\r\n<p>Bluetooth APP Control - Week Aqua A8SE APP with 12 preset modes + 12 custom modes. Stepless dimming, sunrise/sunset simulation, and multi-timer scheduling. No WiFi or hub needed.</p>\r\n<p>Slim Aluminum Housing - 250&times;140&times;30mm black metal body with aluminum heat sink for silent, passive cooling.</p>\r\n<p>Two Mounting Options - Z250Sea-D: hanging kit with lifting rope. Z250Sea-Z: adjustable light stand shown in your image. Both included options for rimless or braced tanks.</p>\r\n<p>Full Kit Included - Light fixture, power adapter, light stand/bracket, screws, and waterproof connectors as shown.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Better Coral Growth &amp; Color Pop - Blue/violet spectrum targets zooxanthellae photosynthesis and brings out coral fluorescence.</p>\r\n<p>Smart Light Cycles - Sunrise/sunset + weather modes reduce stress for fish and inverts.</p>\r\n<p>Clean Modern Look - Ultra-slim black housing suits rimless reef tanks.</p>\r\n<p>Plug &amp; Play - Direct Bluetooth to phone. No gateway needed.</p>\r\n<p>Best For: 45-60cm nano reef tanks, frag tanks, LPS/SPS mixed reefs, FOWLR tanks wanting better coloration.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-25 10:00:02', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(69, NULL, 12, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'JEBAO ECO PUMP', 'Professional submersible pump for aquarium & pond. Features a high-performance energy-saving motor up to 65%, super quiet operation, and smart protection. Works in both fresh and marine water with a durable ceramic shaft for longer life.', 'jebao-eco-pump', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/JebaoAc12000.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/jebaoac3500 (1).jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Jebaoac120001.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jebao', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>1.Jebao ECO PUMP AC3500&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><br>Compact AC3500 submersible pump with energy-saving motor up to 65%. Super quiet with IC dry-run protection and ceramic shaft. Ideal for small to medium aquariums. Works in both fresh and marine water.Professional submersible pump for aquarium &amp; pond. Features a high-performance energy-saving motor up to 65%, super quiet operation, and smart protection. Works in both fresh and marine water with a durable ceramic shaft for longer life.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Energy Efficient - Saves up to 65% power.</p>\r\n<p>Super Quiet Operation - Perfect for home aquariums.</p>\r\n<p>Smart Protection - Auto shut-off with no water + rotor block protection.</p>\r\n<p>Long Life - Wear-resistant ceramic shaft, copper-free.</p>\r\n<p>Dual Use - For marine and fresh water aquariums</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>2.Jebao ECO PUMP AC12000&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>High-performance AC12000 submersible pump with energy-saving motor up to 65%. Super quiet operation, smart IC protection, and wear-resistant ceramic shaft. Works in fresh &amp; marine water. Built for large aquariums, ponds, and filtration systems.Professional submersible pump for aquarium &amp; pond. Features a high-performance energy-saving motor up to 65%, super quiet operation, and smart protection. Works in both fresh and marine water with a durable ceramic shaft for longer life.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Energy Saving - Up to 65% energy reduction with smart electronics.</p>\r\n<p>Super Quiet - Low noise operation.</p>\r\n<p>Safety Protection - Auto power-off when dry + motor protection if rotor blocked.</p>\r\n<p>Durable Build - Ceramic shaft, no copper element, longer life.</p>\r\n<p>Versatile Use - Suitable for marine water and fresh water</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-25 10:14:41', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(70, NULL, 12, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'KEYRSIN SUBMERSIBLE PUMP KS-SC1500', 'KEYRSIN KS-SC1500 is an ultra-quiet, energy-saving submersible pump designed for aquariums, fountains, ponds, and water features. With a ceramic shaft and pure copper motor, it delivers reliable circulation, filtration, and water flow for fish tanks, turtle tanks, and aquascaping setups.', 'keyrsin-submersible-pump-ks-sc1500', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Keysinsubmersiblepump_.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Keysinsubmersiblepump.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Keysinsubmersiblepump (2).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'KEYRSIN', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>KEYRSIN KS-SC1500</strong> is an ultra-quiet, energy-saving submersible pump designed for aquariums, fountains, ponds, and water features. With a ceramic shaft and pure copper motor, it delivers reliable circulation, filtration, and water flow for fish tanks, turtle tanks, and aquascaping setups.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Ceramic Shaft - </strong>Wear-resistant ceramic shaft ensures smooth, quiet operation and longer service life. Anti-corrosion for freshwater and saltwater use.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Pure Copper Motor</strong> - High-quality pure copper winding motor provides stable performance, strong power, and better heat dissipation.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ultra Quiet</strong> - Silent operation won&rsquo;t disturb fish or your living space. Ideal for bedroom aquariums and indoor fountains.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Energy Saving </strong>- Low power consumption design reduces electricity costs while maintaining strong flow.</p>\r\n<p>Model=KEYRSIN KS-SC1500</p>\r\n<p>Type=Submersible Multifunctional Pump</p>\r\n<p>Flow Rate=Approx. 1500 L/H typical for SC1500 series</p>\r\n<p>Max Head=Approx. 1.5-2.0m typical</p>\r\n<p>Power=Energy saving, low wattage</p>\r\n<p>Shaft=Ceramic shaft</p>\r\n<p>Motor=Pure copper motor</p>\r\n<p>Noise Level=Ultra quiet</p>\r\n<p>Use=Aquariums, fountains, ponds, turtle tanks, hydroponics.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Applications:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Aquariums - Power canister filter return, circulation pump, or sump return.</p>\r\n<p>Fountains &amp; Water Features - Create waterfalls and spouts in indoor/outdoor setups &nbsp;Ponds - Water circulation and aeration for small garden ponds</p>\r\n<p>Hydroponics &amp; Aquaponics - Nutrient solution circulation.</p>\r\n<p>Benefits:</p>\r\n<p>Multi-Purpose - Use submerged or inline for filtration, drainage, and water circulation</p>\r\n<p>Durable Build - Ceramic shaft resists wear. Pure copper motor handles continuous operation</p>\r\n<p>Quiet Environment - Ultra-silent tech perfect for living rooms and bedrooms</p>\r\n<p>Energy Efficient - Low power design lowers running costs for 24/7 use</p>\r\n<p>Best For: Planted aquariums, fish tanks, shrimp tanks, turtle tanks, tabletop fountains, and small pond features needing 1500 L/H flow.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-25 10:28:10', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(72, NULL, 12, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'ATMAN AQUARIUM PUMP', 'Atman AT-302S and AT-303S are designed to provide dependable performance, quiet operation, and efficient water circulation, making them excellent choices for maintaining a clean and healthy aquatic environment.', 'atman-aquarium-pump', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 3, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Atmanat303S1 (1).jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Atmanat303S (1) (1).jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Atmanat302S (2).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ATMAN', NULL, 6, 1, 0, 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Atman AT-302S Aquarium Water Pump</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>The Atman AT-302S Aquarium Water Pump is a compact and energy-efficient submersible pump designed to provide reliable water circulation for aquariums, fountains, and filtration systems. With its adjustable flow control and quiet operation, it helps maintain clean, oxygen-rich water for a healthy aquatic environment.</p>\r\n<p>Built with durable, corrosion-resistant materials, the AT-302S delivers consistent performance while consuming less power. Its compact design allows for easy installation and maintenance, making it suitable for both freshwater and marine aquariums.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features</strong></p>\r\n<p>*Model: AT-302S<br>* Adjustable water flow control<br>* Low-noise operation<br>* Energy-saving motor<br>* Enhances water circulation and oxygenation<br>* Durable and corrosion-resistant construction<br>* Easy to install and maintain<br>* Suitable for aquariums, fountains, ponds, and hydroponic systems</p>\r\n<p><strong>Parameter</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Model=AT-302S</li>\r\n<li>Power=5W</li>\r\n<li>Voltage=220-240V</li>\r\n<li>Q.Max(L/Hr)=450(L/Hr)</li>\r\n<li>H.Max=0.7M</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Atman AT-303S Aquarium Water Pump</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>The Atman AT-303S Aquarium Water Pump is a high-performance submersible pump engineered for efficient water movement in aquariums and aquatic systems. Designed for continuous operation, it delivers powerful water circulation while maintaining low noise levels and energy-efficient performance.</p>\r\n<p>Featuring a durable motor and compact construction, the AT-303S improves water quality by increasing oxygen levels and supporting effective filtration. It is ideal for medium to large aquariums, decorative fountains, ponds, and other water circulation applications.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features</strong></p>\r\n<p>* Model: AT-303S<br>* High-efficiency water circulation<br>* Low-noise operation<br>* Energy-saving design<br>* Improves oxygen levels in the aquarium<br>* Reliable and durable construction<br>* Compact, submersible design<br>* Easy installation and maintenance</p>\r\n<p><strong>Parameter</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Model=AT-303S</li>\r\n<li>Power=6W</li>\r\n<li>Voltage=220-240V</li>\r\n<li>Q.Max(L/Hr)=600(L/Hr)</li>\r\n<li>H.Max=0.9M</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Both Atman AT-302S and AT-303S are designed to provide dependable performance, quiet operation, and efficient water circulation, making them excellent choices for maintaining a clean and healthy aquatic environment.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-25 11:24:42', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(73, NULL, 12, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'QUIET AIR PUMP QY-601A', 'QY-601A Quiet Air Pump Ultra-silent single outlet air pump with adjustable airflow. Works with fresh & salt water. Bedroom-quiet, low vibration. Perfect for small to medium aquariums.', 'quiet-air-pump-qy-601a', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Quietairpumpqy-601A1.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Quietairpumpqy-601A.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 1, 0, 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>QY-601A Quiet Air Pump</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Ultra-Silent Single Outlet Air Pump,&nbsp;Ultra-silent electric air pump with adjustable airflow. Designed for bedroom-quiet operation. Works with fresh &amp; salt water aquariums. Single outlet, low vibration, and energy efficient. Perfect for small to medium tanks where quiet performance matters.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Ultra-Silent -</strong> Bedroom-level mute, low noise &amp; vibration.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Flow -</strong> Control air output as needed.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Single Outlet -</strong> Model QY-601A</p>\r\n<p><strong>Fresh &amp; Salt Water Use </strong>- Suitable for all aquariums.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Compact Design - </strong>Small, sleek red body for easy placement</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-25 11:34:50', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(74, NULL, 12, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'QIANYU LITHIUM BATTERY AIR PUMP', 'QY-1000 Lithium Battery Air PumpRechargeable dual-outlet air pump with high-capacity lithium battery. USB powered, works for fresh & salt water. Ideal for nano to medium aquariums, fishing, and power backup. Compact and portable.\r\n\r\nQY-2000 Lithium Battery Air PumpHigh-capacity rechargeable dual-outlet air pump. USB powered, for fresh & salt water. Designed for large tanks, multiple airstones, and long runtime. Perfect for aquariums and emergency oxygen supply.', 'qianyu-lithium-battery-air-pump', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Lithiumbatteryairpumpqy-2000 (2).jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Lithiumbatteryairpumpqy-20001.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Lithiumbatteryairpumpqy-2000 (1).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>1.QY-1000 Lithium Battery Air Pump</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Rechargeable Portable Air Pump for Fresh &amp; Salt Water<br>Compact USB rechargeable air pump with high-capacity lithium battery for long standby. Dual outlet design for strong oxygen supply. Perfect for aquariums, bait tanks, and emergencies. Works with fresh &amp; salt water. Quiet, portable, and energy efficient.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Dual Outlets - Two discharge ports for more oxygen flow.</p>\r\n<p>Rechargeable - USB interface + high-capacity lithium battery.</p>\r\n<p>Long Battery Life - Extended standby time for travel and power cuts.</p>\r\n<p>Fresh &amp; Salt Water Use - Suitable for all aquarium types.</p>\r\n<p>Portable Design - Lightweight red body for fishing, transport, and backup.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>2.QY-2000 Lithium Battery Air Pump</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>High-Capacity Rechargeable Air Pump for Large Tanks&nbsp;Powerful USB rechargeable air pump with larger battery capacity than QY-1000. Dual outlet provides high oxygen output for bigger aquariums, fish transport, and bait buckets. Works with fresh &amp; salt water. Reliable backup during power outages.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Dual Outlets - Strong air flow for multiple airstones.</p>\r\n<p>High-Capacity Battery - Longer run time than QY-1000.</p>\r\n<p>USB Rechargeable - Lithium battery with USB charging port.</p>\r\n<p>Fresh &amp; Salt Water Compatible - For aquariums, ponds, and fishing.</p>\r\n<p>Emergency Backup - Keeps fish safe during power cuts.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Quick Difference:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>QY-1000: Best for small-medium tanks, nano tanks, travel.</p>\r\n<p>QY-2000: Best for large tanks, multiple tanks, longer runtime</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-25 11:49:51', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(75, NULL, 18, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'FZONE CO2 REGULATOR', 'fghjk,', 'fzone-co2-regulator', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Fzoneco2regulator_1.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Fzoneco2regulator_ (2).jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Fzoneco2regulator_ (1).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'FZONE', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>cvbnm,</strong></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-25 12:02:35', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(76, NULL, 9, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'CLAMP LAMP', '1. YC-P001S Clamp LampCompact LED Clamp Light for Nano Tanks\r\nCompact clamp LED with white, red & RGB LEDs. Flexible gooseneck + strong clamp for easy mounting. Perfect for nano, shrimp, and betta tanks up to 40cm. Enhances plant growth and fish colors.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n2. YC-P002L Clamp LampHigh-Power LED Clamp Light for Planted Tanks\r\nHigh-output clamp LED with dense LED array for medium aquariums 40-60cm. Full spectrum white, red & RGB light promotes plant growth and vibrant colors. Flexible arm and secure clamp for easy positioning.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n3. YC-P003L Clamp LampRectangular Panel LED for Wide Tanks\r\nWide-panel clamp LED with 42 bright white LEDs for even coverage. Ideal for 60-90cm planted tanks. Slim design, low heat, and strong clamp mount. Provides natural 6500K light for healthy plant growth.', 'clamp-lamp', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Clamplampyc-P001S.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Clamplampyc-P002L.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>1.YC-P001S Clamp Lamp</strong></span><br>Compact LED Clamp Light for Nano &amp; Small AquariumsProduct DescriptionThe YC-P001S Clamp Lamp is a compact, flexible LED light designed for nano and small planted aquariums. With a mix of white, red, and RGB LEDs and a 360&deg; flexible gooseneck, it delivers focused lighting to make plants and fish colors pop. The strong clamp mount fits easily on tank rims for hassle-free setup.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Full Spectrum LEDs </strong>- Mix of white, red, and RGB LEDs enhances plant growth and fish coloration.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Flexible Gooseneck</strong> - 360&deg; adjustable arm to target light exactly where you need it.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Clamp Mount </strong>- Secure screw clamp fits most tank rims and glass thicknessEnergy Efficient - Low power LED design, minimal heat output.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Compact Size</strong> - Perfect for 20-40cm / 8-16 inch tanks.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Specifications:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Model=YC-P001S</p>\r\n<p>Type=Clamp LED Lamp</p>\r\n<p>LEDs=White + Red + RGB</p>\r\n<p>Mount=Adjustable clamp + flexible arm</p>\r\n<p>Use=Nano planted tanks, shrimp tanks, betta tanks.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>2.YC-P002L Clamp Lamp</strong></span><br>High-Power LED Clamp Light for Medium Planted TanksProduct DescriptionThe YC-P002L Clamp Lamp is a high-output clamp LED for medium-sized aquariums and high-tech planted setups. Packed with more LEDs than the S model, it provides higher PAR and wider spread to support carpet plants, red plants, and vibrant aquascapes. The flexible arm + clamp makes positioning effortless.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>High LED Count</strong> - Denser LED array for stronger light output and better coverage.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Full Spectrum Growth</strong> - White, red, and RGB LEDs promote photosynthesis and vivid colors.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Flexible &amp; Secure </strong>- Heavy-duty gooseneck with strong clamp for stable mounting.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Low Heat, High Efficiency</strong> - LED tech keeps tank temperature stable.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ideal for Aquascaping </strong>- Great for 40-60cm / 16-24 inch tanks.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Specifications:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Model=YC-P002L</p>\r\n<p>Type=Clamp LED Lamp</p>\r\n<p>LEDs=White + Red + RGB</p>\r\n<p>Mount=Adjustable clamp + flexible arm</p>\r\n<p>Use=Medium planted tanks, aquascapes, community tanks.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>3.YC-P003L Clamp Lamp</strong></span><br>Rectangular Panel LED Clamp Light for Wide TanksProduct DescriptionThe YC-P003L Clamp Lamp is a wide-panel LED clamp light built for larger or wide aquariums. With a 42-LED rectangular panel, it provides even, bright coverage across the entire tank surface. Perfect for planted tanks that need uniform light without dark spots. Clamp design makes installation tool-free.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Wide Panel Design -</strong> 42 LED panel gives even light distribution for wide tanks.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Bright White Output </strong>- Clean 6500K-7000K light for natural plant growth and viewing.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Strong Clamp Base</strong> - Fits securely to tank edges, easy to install and remove.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Slim Profile </strong>- Low-profile panel keeps setup clean and modern.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Cool Running</strong> - Energy-saving LEDs with low heat for 24/7 use.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Specifications:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Model=YC-P003L</p>\r\n<p>Type=Rectangular Panel Clamp Lamp</p>\r\n<p>LEDs=42x Bright White LEDs</p>\r\n<p>Mount=Clamp mount</p>\r\n<p>Use=60-90cm / 24-36 inch planted tanks, wide aquariums.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-25 12:13:38', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(77, NULL, 19, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'QANVEE ROTATABLE ALGAE SCRAPER', 'QANVEE X-3 Rotatable Algae Scraper is a professional-grade cleaning tool for planted tanks and reef aquariums. With a 66cm magnesium alloy handle and adjustable rotating head, it removes stubborn algae from glass without getting your hands wet — plus flattens substrate for clean aquascape lines.', 'qanvee-rotatable-algae-scraper', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Qanveerotatablealgaescraper_.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Qanveerotatablealgaescraper_ (1).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>QANVEE X-3 Rotatable Algae Scraper</strong> is a professional-grade cleaning tool for planted tanks and reef aquariums. With a 66cm magnesium alloy handle and adjustable rotating head, it removes stubborn algae from glass without getting your hands wet &mdash; plus flattens substrate for clean aquascape lines.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Rotatable &amp; Adjustable Head</strong> - 67mm wide scraper head with flexible joint. Quickly lock the angle to match tank walls, corners, and hard-to-reach spots.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ultra-Strong Magnesium Alloy</strong> - Corrosion-resistant aluminium-magnesium alloy handle. Suitable for both freshwater planted tanks and saltwater marine/reef aquariums</p>\r\n<p><strong>66cm Extended Reach</strong> - 25.9 inch total length keeps hands dry in deep tanks. Easy to disassemble for storage after use.</p>\r\n<p><strong>10x Ultra-Sharp Blades Included - </strong>Double-sided stainless steel blades included. Replaceable with included hex key. Sharp enough for green spot algae and coralline.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dual-Purpose Too</strong>l - Use the flat edge to scrape glass, or flip it to level and smooth substrate for crisp aquascape lines.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features from Box:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Universal for fresh &amp; saltwater.</p>\r\n<p>Adjustable angle algae scraper blade10 X BLADES - 10 replacement blades included.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>No More Wet Arms - Clean deep tanks without reaching in</p>\r\n<p>Flexible Angles - Rotating joint adapts to curved glass, corners, and overflows</p>\r\n<p>Long Service Life - Corrosion-proof build + 10 blades = years of use</p>\r\n<p>Crystal Clear Glass - Removes diatoms, green dust, and spot algae in seconds</p>\r\n<p>Best For: Large planted tanks, reef tanks, and deep aquariums 24\" or taller. Essential aquascaping tool for maintenance day.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-25 12:27:09', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(78, NULL, 19, '18 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'ISTA 3 WAY WATER CHANGER', 'The ISTA IF-994 (12 mm) is a convenient 3-way water changer designed for quick and mess-free aquarium maintenance. It provides smooth water flow control with a secure, leak-resistant connection for 12 mm hoses.\r\n\r\nThe ISTA IF-993 (16 mm) is a durable 3-way water changer that simplifies aquarium water changes and maintenance. Designed for 16 mm hoses, it offers reliable flow control and a secure, leak-resistant fit.', 'ista-3-way-water-changer', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Ista3waywaterchangerif-99316mm.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Ista3waywaterchangerif-99412mm (1).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ISTA', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>ISTA 3-Way Water Changer IF-994 (12 mm)</strong></p>\r\n<p>The ISTA 3-Way Water Changer IF-994 (12 mm) is a practical aquarium maintenance accessory designed for quick and hassle-free water changes. Its 3-way valve allows you to easily switch between draining, filling, and normal water flow without disconnecting your filter. Compatible with 12 mm hoses, it offers a secure, leak-resistant connection for smooth and efficient maintenance. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Key Features:</p>\r\n<p>* Compatible with 12 mm hoses<br>* 3-way valve for easy water flow control<br>* Quick-connect design<br>* Leak-resistant construction<br>* Durable, aquarium-safe materials<br>* Ideal for canister filter systems and routine water changes</p>\r\n<p>⸻</p>\r\n<p><strong>ISTA 3-Way Water Changer IF-993 (16 mm)</strong></p>\r\n<p>The ISTA 3-Way Water Changer IF-993 (16 mm) makes aquarium water changes simple and convenient. Designed for 16 mm hoses, it features a 3-way control valve that allows you to drain, refill, or resume normal filtration with ease. Its durable construction and secure fittings ensure reliable, leak-free performance for regular aquarium maintenance. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Key Features:</p>\r\n<p>* Compatible with 16 mm hoses<br>* 3-way valve for drain, fill, and normal flow<br>* Quick and easy installation<br>* Leak-resistant, secure connection<br>* Durable and long-lasting design<br>* Perfect for canister filter maintenance and water changes</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-26 07:15:02', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(79, NULL, 19, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'W MIST MAKER', 'Mist Maker W is a compact ultrasonic mist maker that creates a mystical fog effect with 7-color LED lighting. Featuring auto shut-off protection and a delicate design, it’s perfect for adding ambiance to aquariums, terrariums, fountains, ponds, and indoor water features.', 'w-mist-maker', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/wmistmaker1.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/wmistmaker (1).jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/wmistmaker.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'W', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Mist Maker W</strong> is a compact ultrasonic mist maker that creates a mystical fog effect with 7-color LED lighting. Featuring auto shut-off protection and a delicate design, it&rsquo;s perfect for adding ambiance to aquariums, terrariums, fountains, ponds, and indoor water features.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Ultrasonic Cool Mist Technology - Uses 2.4MHz ultrasonic vibration to create ultra-fine cool mist instantly. Increases humidity and creates dramatic fog effects for aquariums and water gardens.</p>\r\n<p>Seven Color Allochroism LED Light - Built-in color-changing LEDs cycle through 7 colors, creating a soothing night light effect. Enhances visual appeal of fountains and paludariums.</p>\r\n<p>Auto Shut-Off Safety - Stops automatically when water level is too low to prevent damage and dry burning. Good insulation properties for safe submerged operation.</p>\r\n<p>Vogue Performance, Delicate Design - Compact black housing with elegant appearance. High-quality adapter ensures stable performance and long service life.</p>\r\n<p>Versatile Applications - Ideal for aquariums, turtle tanks, fountains, birdbaths, ponds, rockeries, terrariums, and indoor aromatherapy humidification.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Characteristics from Box:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Vogue performance, delicate designSeven color allochroism LED light</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Stop automatically if work without water</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Good performance and good insulation properties</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>High quality adapter, long service life</strong></p>\r\n<p>Best For: Aquarium aquascapes, paludariums, terrariums, tabletop fountains, pond features, Halloween effects, and indoor humidity. Creates dense fog for visual impact.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-26 07:22:46', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(80, NULL, 19, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'JECOD RF-20 AUTOMATIC FEEDER', 'Jecod RF-20 is a reliable automatic fish feeder with digital timer control and large 140ml capacity. Featuring 20 individual 7ml feeding cells, it delivers precise portions of pellets, flakes, or granules on a schedule — ideal for vacations, busy workdays, or maintaining consistent feeding routines without Bluetooth.', 'jecod-rf-20-automatic-feeder', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/jecodrf-20.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'JECOD', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Jecod RF-20</strong> is a reliable automatic fish feeder with digital timer control and large 140ml capacity. Featuring 20 individual 7ml feeding cells, it delivers precise portions of pellets, flakes, or granules on a schedule &mdash; ideal for vacations, busy workdays, or maintaining consistent feeding routines without Bluetooth.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Digital Timer Control </strong>- Built-in LCD display with clock. Set up to 6 feeding times per day and choose 1-9 servings per feeding. Manual feed button included.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Large 140ml Capacity </strong>- 20 cells &times; 7ml each = 140ml total. Holds 2-3 weeks of food for most community tanks. Suitable for pellets, granules, and flakes &le;10mm.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Portion-Controlled Dispensing</strong> - Each cell holds exactly 7ml to prevent overfeeding and water pollution. Rotating drum keeps food sealed and dry between feedings.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy LCD Programming</strong> - Visible clock, feeding parameters, and battery level on LCD screen. Sync with local time for accurate schedules.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Universal Tank Mount</strong> - Adjustable clamp fits glass up to 18mm thick. Works on open tanks and tanks with hood openings. Stable power by 3&times; AA batteries.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For: </strong></p>\r\n<p>Community aquariums, goldfish tanks, cichlid tanks, and vacation feeding. Perfect for users who prefer simple button programming over smartphone apps.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-26 07:29:25', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(81, NULL, 19, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'JECOD DRF-20 AUTOMATIC FEEDER', 'Jecod DRF-20 is a Bluetooth-enabled automatic fish feeder designed for worry-free feeding. With 20 individual 7ml cells and app + button control, it precisely dispenses pellets, flakes, or granules up to 6 times per day — perfect for vacations, busy schedules, or consistent feeding routines.', 'jecod-drf-20-automatic-feeder', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/jecoddrf-20.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'JECOD', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Jecod DRF-20</strong> is a Bluetooth-enabled automatic fish feeder designed for worry-free feeding. With 20 individual 7ml cells and app + button control, it precisely dispenses pellets, flakes, or granules up to 6 times per day &mdash; perfect for vacations, busy schedules, or consistent feeding routines.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Bluetooth APP Control -</strong> Connect via Bluetooth to set feeding schedules, portion sizes, and sync clock with local time. No WiFi or account registration needed</p>\r\n<p><strong>Large 140ml Capacity </strong>- 20 cells &times; 7ml each = 140ml total. Suitable for various particle shapes up to 10mm</p>\r\n<p><strong>Flexible Feeding Program -</strong> Auto feed maximum 6 times per day. Set volume freely up to 9 servings per feeding. Manual feed button for instant dispensing</p>\r\n<p><strong>LCD Display &amp; Battery Powered </strong>- Clear LCD shows clock, feeding parameters, and battery level. Stable power supply by 3&times;1.5V AA batteries (not included). Operates silently.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Tank Mounting - </strong>Dual-purpose stand with adjustable clamp fits glass up to 18mm thick. Fits open and closed aquarium lids.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>No Overfeeding - Portion-controlled 7ml cells prevent food waste and water fouling.</p>\r\n<p>Vacation Ready - 140ml holds 2-3 weeks of food for most community tanks.</p>\r\n<p>Moisture Protection - Sealed rotating drum keeps food dry and fresh between feedings</p>\r\n<p>Quiet Operation - Silent motor won&rsquo;t stress fish or disturb your home/office.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For:</strong> Community tanks, goldfish, cichlids, and any aquarium using pellet or granule foods. Ideal for travelers, office tanks, and maintaining consistent feeding schedules.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-26 07:32:24', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(82, NULL, 19, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'FLOATING FLIPPER EDGE', 'Floating Flipper Edge\r\nA compact magnetic algae cleaner designed for small to medium aquariums. Its floating design prevents sinking, making cleaning quick, easy, and scratch-free.\r\n\r\nFloating Flipper Edge Max\r\nA heavy-duty magnetic algae cleaner for medium to large aquariums. Features a floating design, strong magnetic grip, and efficient algae removal while protecting glass from scratches.', 'floating-flipper-edge', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/floatingflipperedge.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/floatingflipperedgemax.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Floating Flipper Edge</strong><br>The Floating Flipper Edge is a premium <strong>magnetic algae cleaner </strong>designed for small to medium aquariums. Its floating design keeps the cleaner from sinking, making it easy to retrieve. It effectively removes algae from glass while helping prevent scratches, ensuring quick and effortless tank maintenance.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Floating Flipper Edge Max</strong><br>The Floating Flipper Edge Max is a powerful magnetic algae cleaner built for medium to large aquariums. With a stronger magnetic grip and floating design, it stays within easy reach and provides efficient algae removal without scratching the glass. Perfect for keeping larger tanks crystal clear with minimal effort.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-26 07:41:57', 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `product_identity`, `category_id`, `tax`, `row_order`, `type`, `stock_type`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `asin`, `indicator`, `cod_allowed`, `download_allowed`, `download_type`, `download_link`, `minimum_order_quantity`, `quantity_step_size`, `total_allowed_quantity`, `is_prices_inclusive_tax`, `is_returnable`, `is_cancelable`, `cancelable_till`, `is_attachment_required`, `image`, `other_images`, `video_type`, `video`, `tags`, `warranty_period`, `guarantee_period`, `made_in`, `brand`, `sku`, `stock`, `availability`, `rating`, `no_of_ratings`, `description`, `deliverable_type`, `deliverable_zipcodes`, `deliverable_city_type`, `deliverable_cities`, `shipping_method`, `pickup_location`, `status`, `date_added`, `is_on_sale`, `sale_discount`, `sale_start_date`, `sale_end_date`) VALUES
(83, '', 19, '', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'KAMOER ATO One 2', 'Kamoer ATO One is a plug-and-play auto top-off system that automatically replenishes water lost to evaporation in nano to medium aquariums. It combines an accurate optical level sensor with an emergency float sensor to maintain stable salinity and prevent overflow — no programming required.', 'kamoer-ato-one-2', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/kamoeratoone2.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/kamoeratoone21.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Kamoer ATO One </strong>is a plug-and-play <strong>auto top-off system </strong>that automatically replenishes water lost to evaporation in nano to medium aquariums. It combines an accurate optical level sensor with an emergency float sensor to maintain stable salinity and prevent overflow-no programming required.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Dual-Sensor Safety </strong>- Optical sensor triggers refill when water drops. Float sensor cuts power if water gets too high, preventing floods.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Plug &amp; Play Setup</strong> - No parameter setting. Install sensors with magnetic brackets, connect the DC pump, power on, and it works.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Compact &amp; Silent -</strong> Mini controller + low-voltage 12V DC anti-dry submersible pump. Ideal for sumps, AIO, and nano reef tanks.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Smart Alerts -</strong> LED status lights + audible alarms warn of timeout, overflow, or pump failure.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Complete Kit Included </strong>- Controller, optical sensor, float sensor, magnetic mounts, DC pump, tube holder, siphon break, and 1-2m PVC tubing.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Product=</strong>Kamoer ATO One / ATO One SE 2</p>\r\n<p><strong>Sensors=</strong>Optical level sensor + Float overflow sensor</p>\r\n<p><strong>Pump=</strong>12V DC anti-dry submersible, Max 500 L/H</p>\r\n<p><strong>Max Head Height</strong>=2m</p>\r\n<p><strong>Glass Thickness=</strong>Up to 10mm for magnetic mounts</p>\r\n<p><strong>Power=</strong>230-240V input, 12V 1A output</p>\r\n<p><strong>How It Works:</strong><br>The optical sensor monitors your sump/tank water level 24/7. When evaporation drops the level, it auto-activates the pump to top off with RO/DI water. If the level rises too high, the float sensor stops the pump instantly. Timeout protection prevents continuous running if sensors fail.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For: </strong></p>\r\n<p>Reef tanks, planted aquariums, AIO systems, and any setup where stable salinity and water level are critical. Prevents salinity swings, pump damage, and salt creep.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Note: </strong></p>\r\n<p>Keep optical sensor clean. Max height difference between reservoir and tank: 1.5m. Reservoir should not be higher than tank level.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-06-26 08:00:28', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(84, NULL, 19, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'FZONE GLASS FILTER PIPE', 'FZONE Glass Filter Pipe brings professional aquascaping elegance to your planted tank. This hand-blown borosilicate glass lily pipe set features a self-adjusting surface skimmer inflow and classic lily outflow, delivering crystal-clear flow and removing biofilm for rimless aquariums using 16/22mm canister filter hoses.', 'fzone-glass-filter-pipe', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Fzoneglassfilterpipe13mm1 (2).jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Fzoneglassfilterpipe13mm1 (2).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'FZONE', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p>FZONE Glass Filter Pipe brings professional aquascaping elegance to your planted tank. This hand-blown borosilicate glass lily pipe set features a self-adjusting surface skimmer inflow and classic lily outflow, delivering crystal-clear flow and removing biofilm for rimless aquariums using 16/22mm canister filter hoses.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Hand-Blown Borosilicate Glass </strong>- Laboratory-grade borosilicate glass offers superior clarity, heat resistance, and durability. Nearly invisible in water for a seamless Nature Aquarium look</p>\r\n<p><strong>Built-in Surface Skimmer </strong>- Inflow pipe features an auto-adjusting skimmer that rises/falls with water level. Removes oily protein film and debris from the surface for better gas exchange</p>\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Flow Control </strong>- Rotate the bottom section of the inflow to customize surface vs bottom intake ratio. Lily outflow creates gentle, wide dispersion that won&rsquo;t uproot plants</p>\r\n<p><strong>Complete Installation Kit </strong>- Includes glass skimmer inflow pipe, lily outflow pipe, spring cleaning brush, and 4 suction cups.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>For Fresh &amp; Marine</strong> - Safe for freshwater planted tanks, shrimp tanks, and marine reef aquariums. Lab-grade glass resists algae etching.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Size Options Available:</strong></p>\r\n<p>13mm - For 12/16mm hose / 1/2\" tubing</p>\r\n<p>17mm - For 16/22mm hose / 5/8\" tubing This model</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Benefits</span>:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Surface Film Removal - Auto-adjusting skimmer eliminates biofilm for better O2/CO2 exchange</p>\r\n<p>Gentle Flow Pattern - Lily outflow spreads return water to prevent substrate disturbance</p>\r\n<p>Aquascape Aesthetics - Crystal clear glass disappears in rimless tanks vs bulky plastic pipes</p>\r\n<p>Easy Maintenance - Included spring brush cleans pipes. Adjust flow without removing from tank</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For:</strong> High-end planted tanks, Nature Aquarium/Iwagumi layouts, shrimp tanks, and aquascapers wanting ADA-style glassware aesthetics with surface skimming function.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Care Note</strong>: Fragile - handle with care. Use suction cups to secure. Clean with included brush regularly to maintain flow and clarity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-26 08:26:56', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(85, NULL, 19, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'FZONE STAINLESS STEEL LILY PIPE SET', 'FZONE Stainless Steel Lily Pipe Set upgrades your canister filter with elegant, unbreakable 316 stainless steel pipes. Designed for rimless aquariums, this 16mm set delivers gentle, adjustable flow while protecting shrimp and fish — combining professional aquascaping aesthetics with bulletproof durability.', 'fzone-stainless-steel-lily-pipe-set', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Fzonestainlesssteellilypipeset.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Fzonestainlesssteellilypipeset (1).jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Fzonestainlesssteellilypipeset1.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'FZONE', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>FZONE Stainless Steel Lily Pipe </strong>Set upgrades your canister filter with elegant, unbreakable 316 stainless steel pipes. Designed for rimless aquariums, this 16mm set delivers gentle, adjustable flow while protecting shrimp and fish &mdash; combining professional aquascaping aesthetics with bulletproof durability.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Premium 316 Stainless Steel </strong>- Surgical-grade stainless steel construction. Rust-proof, corrosion-resistant, and built to last. Won&rsquo;t break like glass lily pipes.</p>\r\n<p><strong>360&deg; Swivel Flow Control -</strong> Outflow rotates 360&deg; to direct water exactly where plants need it. Create gentle circulation without stressing fish or disturbing substrate.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Smart Thin-Gap Inlet -</strong> Inflow pipe features thin gaps that filter debris while preventing shrimp, fry, and small fish from being sucked in. Fish-safe design.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Elegant Curved Design - </strong>Sleek lily pipe shape enhances rimless tanks. Minimalist look perfect for Nature Aquarium and Iwagumi aquascapes.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Complete Installation Kit </strong>- Includes 1x stainless steel inflow, 1x outflow, and acrylic pipe fixers. Fits glass thickness up to 16mm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Benefits vs Glass Lily Pipes:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Won&rsquo;t Break</strong> - More durable than borosilicate glass pipes</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy to Clean</strong> - Algae buildup is invisible; clean only when flow reduces</p>\r\n<p><strong>Consistent Flow -</strong> Stainless steel provides stable water distribution to all areas</p>\r\n<p>Best For:</p>\r\n<p>High-end planted tanks, rimless aquascapes, shrimp tanks, and aquarists who want the look of lily pipes without the fragility of glass.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-26 08:36:22', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(86, NULL, 20, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'SERA AQUARIUM HEATER THERMOSTAT', 'Sera aquarium heater thermostats are designed to maintain a consistent and stable temperature in your fish tank. They are submersible heaters with built-in thermostats that automatically turn the heater on and off to keep the water at the desired temperature.', 'sera-aquarium-heater-thermostat', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Seraheater50W1.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Seraheater100W1.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Seraheater200W1.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, '2 year', NULL, NULL, 'SERA', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Sera aquarium heater thermostats are designed to maintain a consistent and stable temperature in your fish tank.&nbsp;<span class=\"citation-0 recitation citation-end-0\">They are submersible heaters with built-in thermostats that automatically turn the heater on and off to keep the water at the desired temperature.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span class=\"citation-0 recitation citation-end-0\">Available in 50W , 100W, 200W</span></strong></p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:17\"><strong>Key features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong><span class=\"citation-1 recitation\">Accurate temperature control:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1 recitation citation-end-1\">&nbsp;The thermostat ensures precise temperature regulation, creating a comfortable and healthy environment for your fish.</span></li>\r\n<li><strong><span class=\"citation-2 recitation\">Submersible design:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-2 recitation citation-end-2\">&nbsp;The compact and sleek design allows for easy placement within the tank.</span></li>\r\n<li><strong>Safety features:</strong>&nbsp;Most Sera heaters have safety features like automatic shut-off in case of overheating or low water levels.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Easy to use:</strong>&nbsp;The simple control knob makes it easy to adjust the desired temperature.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Various wattage options:</strong>&nbsp;<span class=\"citation-3 recitation citation-end-3\">Sera offers heaters with different wattage options to suit different tank sizes and heating requirements.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong><span class=\"citation-3 recitation citation-end-3\">WARRANTY = 2 YEAR</span></strong></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-26 09:29:19', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 15, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'MICROBE-LIFT SPECIAL BLEND', 'Microbe-Lift Special Blend is a highly concentrated blend of beneficial live bacteria formulated to improve water quality and maintain a healthy biological balance in both freshwater and saltwater aquariums. It naturally breaks down organic waste, reduces sludge buildup, and helps eliminate unpleasant odors while supporting a cleaner, healthier environment for fish, plants, and corals.', 'microbe-lift-special-blend', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/microbeliftspecialblend473ml.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/microbeliftspecialblend118ml.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Microbelifespecialblend251ml.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MICROBE-LIFT', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Microbe-Lift Special Blend </strong>is a natural, chemical-free water care treatment that creates a complete biological ecosystem in your aquarium. This unique blend of 100% live bacteria breaks down organic waste, reduces maintenance, and promotes crystal-clear water in both freshwater and saltwater tanks.</p>\r\n<p>Microbe-Lift Special Blend is a highly concentrated blend of beneficial live bacteria formulated to improve water quality and maintain a healthy biological balance in both freshwater and saltwater aquariums. It naturally breaks down organic waste, reduces sludge buildup, and helps eliminate unpleasant odors while supporting a cleaner, healthier environment for fish, plants, and corals.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Complete Bio-System -</strong> A living bacterial ecosystem that degrades organic waste, uneaten food, fish waste, plant residues, and sludge.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Reduces Maintenance - </strong></span>Dramatically cuts down water changes and cleaning frequency. Breaks down residue on gravel, plants, rocks &amp; glass.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Controls Waste &amp; Odor -</strong> Lowers ammonia &amp; nitrite levels, biologically reduces nitrates, eliminates odors, and clears cloudy water.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Reef Safe &amp; Plant Friendly -</strong> Safe for fish, corals, inverts, shrimp, and live plants. Naturally stimulates plant growth and coral nutrient uptake.</p>\r\n<p><strong>New Tank &amp; Established Tank -</strong> Works as a biological starter for new tank cycling and as a maintainer for established aquariums.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosage Instructions:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Start-Up Dose: Day 1: 25ml per 100L | Days 8, 15, 22, 29: 15ml per 100L<br>Maintenance: 7.5ml per 100L every 14 days<br>Shake well before use. Add directly to tank during light phase. Turn off UV/ozone for 48-72 hours after dosing.</p>\r\n<p>Best For: New tank cycling, cloudy water, odor control, reducing sludge, reef tanks, planted aquariums, and routine biological maintenance.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-26 09:38:47', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, 21, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'ISTA MINI COOLING FAN', 'ISTA USB Mini Cooling Fan is a sleek, USB-powered solution to prevent overheating in nano aquariums. Designed for tanks up to 45L, it lowers water temperature by 2-4°C while running whisper-quiet, keeping fish and plants stress-free in hot weather.', 'ista-mini-cooling-fan', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/IstaminicoolingfanI-C9891.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/IstaminicoolingfanI-C9901.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ISTA', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>ISTA USB Mini Cooling Fan </strong>is a sleek, USB-powered solution to prevent overheating in nano aquariums. Designed for tanks up to 45L, it lowers water temperature by 2-4&deg;C while running whisper-quiet, keeping fish and plants stress-free in hot weather.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Effective Cooling - Reduces aquarium water temperature by 2-4&deg;C, preventing protein film buildup and protecting livestock from heat stress.</p>\r\n<p>USB Powered &amp; Safe - DC 5V, 0.3W low power consumption. Fan motor positioned away from tank surface to eliminate short circuit or electrical hazards.</p>\r\n<p>Ultra-Quiet Operation - Noise level below 38dB for peaceful bedrooms, offices, and living rooms. Won&rsquo;t disturb fish or hobbyists.</p>\r\n<p>Easy Clamp Installation - Securely clamps to glass up to 6mm thick. Sturdy ABS plastic construction. 85cm USB wire for flexible placement.</p>\r\n<p>Compact &amp; Stylish - Space-saving design complements any aquarium aesthetic. Perfect for planted tanks, shrimp setups, and betta aquariums.</p>\r\n<p>Specifications:</p>\r\n<p>Model=ISTA USB Mini Cooling Fan</p>\r\n<p>Tank Size=Up to 45L</p>\r\n<p>Voltage / Power=DC 5V / 0.3W</p>\r\n<p>Noise Level=&lt;38dBGlass</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Thickness=Clamps to &lt;6mm</p>\r\n<p>Wire Length=85cm USB</p>\r\n<p>Material=Durable ABS Plastic</p>\r\n<p>Cooling Effect=Lowers temp by 2-4&deg;C</p>\r\n<p>Origin=Made in Taiwan</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For</strong>: Nano tanks, planted aquariums, shrimp tanks, betta setups, and small marine systems up to 45L. Ideal for summer months or tanks with heat-generating lights.</p>\r\n<p>Safety Note: USB-powered for safe, low-voltage operation. Motor is elevated away from water to prevent electrical contact. Stylish design prevents short circuits.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-26 10:40:54', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(89, NULL, 19, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'KEYRSIN STAINLESS STEEL WAVE SCISSORS', 'The Keyrsin Stainless Steel Wave Scissors are precision aquascaping scissors designed for trimming and shaping aquatic plants with ease. Featuring a curved (wave) blade, these scissors provide better access to hard-to-reach areas, making them ideal for maintaining carpets, stem plants, and aquascapes in both freshwater and marine aquariums.', 'keyrsin-stainless-steel-wave-scissors', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/keyrsin (1) (1).jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'KEYRSIN', NULL, 4, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>KEYRSIN Wave Scissors KS-Z003-WB </strong>are premium stainless steel aquascaping scissors designed for precise trimming of carpeting plants, foreground plants, and hard-to-reach areas. The unique curved wave blade lets you trim at a higher angle without awkward hand positions, making aquascape maintenance faster and more comfortable.</p>\r\n<p>The Keyrsin Stainless Steel Wave Scissors are precision aquascaping scissors designed for trimming and shaping aquatic plants with ease. Featuring a curved (wave) blade, these scissors provide better access to hard-to-reach areas, making them ideal for maintaining carpets, stem plants, and aquascapes in both freshwater and marine aquariums.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Ergonomic Wave Design: </strong>Curved wave blade shape allows higher angle cuts with natural wrist position. Perfect for trimming ground cover plants without strain</p>\r\n<p><strong>Precision Cutting: </strong>Sharp, pointed tips and excellent sharpness ensure clean cuts that minimize plant damage. Ideal for carpeting plants like Monte Carlo, Glosso, Dwarf Hair Grass, and Hemianthus Cuba.</p>\r\n<p><strong>High-Quality Stainless Steel:</strong> Made of special high-quality stainless steel material. Anti-rust, anti-corrosion, and durable for freshwater use.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Human Body Mechanics Design:</strong> Streamlined appearance with comfortable grip. Flexible use for detailed aquascaping work.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Extra Long Reach:</strong> Approx 24-25cm / 10\" length reaches deep tanks without soaking your arm.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Specifications:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Product=KEYRSIN Stainless Steel Wave Scissors.</p>\r\n<p>Model=KS-Z003-WB</p>\r\n<p>Material=Stainless Steel</p>\r\n<p>Color=Black</p>\r\n<p>Total Length=Approx 24-25cm / 10 inches</p>\r\n<p>Blade Type=Wave curved blade</p>\r\n<p>Use=Freshwater &amp; Saltwater aquariums, Terrariums</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Better than standard scissors - Wave type makes cutting aquarium plants a lot easier.</p>\r\n<p>Minimal tank disturbance - Trim plants without lowering water level or disturbing hardscape and nearby decor.</p>\r\n<p>Professional aquascaping - Essential tool for Iwagumi, Nature-style, and nano aquascapes. Great for foreground plants and dense growth.</p>\r\n<p>Safe for plants - Clean cuts prevent chewing damage and promote healthy regrowth.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For: </strong></p>\r\n<p>Trimming carpeting plants, foreground pruning, detailed aquascaping, propagating stem plants, Anubias, Bucephalandra, ferns, and mosses .</p>\r\n<p>Care Tips:&nbsp; Rinse and dry after each use to maintain longevity. Keep away from children - sharp tips and edges&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-26 12:24:40', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(90, NULL, 15, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'MICROBE-LIFT NITE-OUT II STARTER BACTERIA', 'Microbe-Lift Nite-Out II is a premium live nitrifying bacteria solution designed to rapidly establish the biological filtration in new freshwater and marine aquariums. It helps break down harmful ammonia and nitrite, creating a healthier environment for fish and aquatic life while reducing the time required for tank cycling.', 'microbe-lift-nite-out-ii-starter-bacteria', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/microbeliftnightoutII236ml.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/microbeliftniteoutII473ml.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MICROBE-LIFT', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Microbe-Lift Nite-Out II</strong> is a highly concentrated blend of live nitrifying bacteria that jump-starts biological filtration in freshwater and saltwater aquariums. It rapidly establishes the nitrogen cycle so you can add fish on Day 1 and prevent toxic ammonia &amp; nitrite spikes that cause fish loss.</p>\r\n<p>Microbe-Lift Nite-Out II is a premium live nitrifying bacteria solution designed to rapidly establish the biological filtration in new freshwater and marine aquariums. It helps break down harmful ammonia and nitrite, creating a healthier environment for fish and aquatic life while reducing the time required for tank cycling.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Instant Cycling:</strong>&nbsp;Seeds your biofilter with live Nitrosomonas, Nitrobacter, and Nitrospira bacteria to immediately convert toxic ammonia &rarr; nitrite &rarr; nitrate.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Rapid Ammonia &amp; Nitrite Removal: </strong>Eliminates the toxic effects of ammonium/ammonia and nitrite. Minimizes the biological start-up phase.</p>\r\n<p><strong>New Tank Safe Start-Up: </strong>Perfect for new aquariums, water changes, adding livestock, after medications, or filter cleanings.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Reef Safe &amp; Biodegradable:</strong>Non-toxic formula safe for fish, corals, plants, shrimp, inverts, and all aquatic life. Suitable for community, planted, and reef tanks.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Prevents Fish Stress &amp; Loss:</strong> Stops ammonia spikes that stress fish. Reduces failures due to high ammonia levels.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosage Instructions:</strong></p>\r\n<p>New Aquariums: Add 5ml per 40L every other day until ammonia and nitrite read 0 ppm<br>Maintenance: Add 5ml per 40L when changing water or adding new animals<br>Alternative: 10ml per 100L daily until ammonia/nitrite are 0, then weekly</p>\r\n<p>Shake well before use. For best results, use with Microbe-Lift Special Blend.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Best For: Cycling new tanks, fish-in cycles, recovering biofilter after meds, adding new fish, and reducing new tank syndrome.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-26 12:38:35', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(91, NULL, 15, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'MICROBE-LIFT ALGAWAY 5.4', 'Microbe-Lift Algaway 5.4 is a highly effective liquid algae control solution designed to eliminate and prevent unwanted algae growth in both freshwater and saltwater aquariums. Its advanced formula targets common algae types, including green water algae, string algae, blanket weed, and other nuisance algae, helping restore crystal-clear water without harming fish, plants, or aquarium inhabitants when used as directed.', 'microbe-lift-algaway-54', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/microbe lift algaway 54 236ml.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MICROBE-LIFT', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Microbe-Lift Algaway 5.4 </strong>is a fast-acting, EPA-registered algaecide that eliminates green water, string algae, hair algae, and suspended algae blooms in aquariums, ponds, and fountains. It restores crystal-clear water and improves oxygen levels without harming fish or plants.</p>\r\n<p>Microbe-Lift Algaway 5.4 is a highly effective liquid algae control solution designed to eliminate and prevent unwanted algae growth in both freshwater and saltwater aquariums. Its advanced formula targets common algae types, including green water algae, string algae, blanket weed, and other nuisance algae, helping restore crystal-clear water without harming fish, plants, or aquarium inhabitants when used as directed.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Powerful Algae Control - </strong>Targets green water, hair algae, string algae &amp; suspended algae. Visible results in as little as 48 hours.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Fish &amp; Plant Safe - </strong>100% safe for all freshwater &amp; saltwater aquarium fish, koi, goldfish, and live ornamental plants.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Reef &amp; Marine Safe -</strong> Will not harm corals, coralline algae, anemones, or marine invertebrates in saltwater/reef tanks.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Improves Water Quality -</strong> Enhances oxygen levels, reduces odor, and helps maintain a balanced aquatic ecosystem.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Concentrated Formula - </strong>8 oz treats up to 2,839 gallons (10,745 L). Economical for tanks and small ponds.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosage Instructions:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Aquariums: Add near filter outflow. 3 drops per 5 gallons, 18 drops per 30 gallons, or 1/2 tsp per 30 gallons<br>Heavy Algae: Clean excess algae off glass/decor first. Repeat dose every 3 days until controlled, then weekly for maintenance.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For</strong>: Green water outbreaks, hair/string algae, cloudy aquariums, ornamental ponds, and fountains without outflow.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Important</strong>:&nbsp; Not safe for snails, shrimp, clams, crustaceans, or mollusks in freshwater.</p>\r\n<p>Ponds: Ensure continuous aeration via waterfall/fountain to prevent fish loss.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-27 08:31:22', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(92, NULL, 15, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'MICROBE-LIFT XTREME WATER CONDITIONER', 'Microbe-Lift Xtreme Water Conditioner is a premium all-in-one water treatment formulated to make tap water safe for aquarium fish and aquatic life. Designed for both freshwater and saltwater aquariums, this advanced conditioner instantly neutralizes harmful chlorine and chloramines while detoxifying ammonia and binding heavy metals, creating a safe and stable environment for fish, plants, corals, and invertebrates.', 'microbe-lift-xtreme-water-conditioner', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/microbe lift xtreme 118ml.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MICROBE-LIFT', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Microbe-Lift Xtreme</strong> is a complete, all-in-one water conditioner that instantly makes tap water safe for fish, corals, plants, and invertebrates. Scientifically formulated for both aquariums and ponds, it goes beyond basic dechlorinators to neutralize every common tap water threat in a single dose.</p>\r\n<p>Ideal for new aquarium setups, water changes, and routine maintenance, Microbe-Lift Xtreme helps reduce stress caused by poor water quality and supports the natural slime coat that protects fish from disease and environmental damage. Its concentrated formula works quickly, making it an essential product for every aquarium hobbyist.</p>\r\n<p>Reef-safe and highly effective, Microbe-Lift Xtreme is trusted by aquarists worldwide to maintain crystal-clear water and promote a healthy aquatic ecosystem.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Removes &amp; Detoxifies Everything -</strong> Instantly removes chlorine, destroys chloramines, neutralizes ammonia, detoxifies nitrite, and binds heavy metals like copper, lead &amp; zinc.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Reef Safe &amp; Buffered - </strong>Works in saltwater &amp; freshwater. Reef safe for corals and marine fish. Added buffers stabilize pH and boost alkalinity to prevent swings.</p>\r\n<p><strong>3-Part Slime Coat Replacer -</strong> Adds essential electrolytes and a multi-part skin-slime replacer to reduce stress during water changes, fish transport, or new additions.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Instantly Ages Water - </strong>No waiting period. Conditions new water on contact so it&rsquo;s immediately safe for all aquatic life.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Chloramine Specialist -</strong> Unlike basic dechlorinators, Xtreme detoxifies both the chlorine and the ammonia released when chloramines break down.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosage Instructions:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Standard Dose: 1 tsp per 10 gallons or 1 fl oz per 60 gallons<br>Use when: Setting up new tanks/ponds, water changes, adding new fish/plants, or transporting livestock</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For: </strong>Reef tanks, planted aquariums, koi ponds, goldfish, betta tanks, and any setup using chlorinated or chloramine-treated tap water.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-27 08:48:14', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(93, NULL, 15, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'MICROBE -LIFT THERA P FISH CARE', 'Microbe-Lift Thera P Fish Care is a premium probiotic bacterial supplement designed to improve aquarium water quality while supporting the overall health and well-being of your fish. Formulated with beneficial live bacteria, Thera P helps maintain a balanced biological ecosystem, naturally reducing organic waste and creating a cleaner, healthier environment for both freshwater and saltwater aquariums.', 'microbe-lift-thera-p-fish-care', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/microbelifttherap118ml (1).jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/08/microbelifttherap251ml.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/08/microbelifttherap473ml.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MICROBE-LIFT', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Microbe-Lift TheraP Fish Care is a premium probiotic bacterial supplement designed to improve aquarium water quality while supporting the overall health and well-being of your fish. Formulated with beneficial live bacteria, TheraP helps maintain a balanced biological ecosystem, naturally reducing organic waste and creating a cleaner, healthier environment for both freshwater and saltwater aquariums.</p>\r\n<p>Microbe-Lift TheraP is a natural, chemical-free water treatment that uses beneficial bacteria to support fish health and create a balanced aquarium ecosystem. Formulated for both freshwater and saltwater tanks, it reduces stress, boosts immunity, and improves water quality without antibiotics or harsh chemicals.</p>\r\n<p>Safe for fish, corals, invertebrates, aquatic plants, and beneficial bacteria, Microbe-Lift TheraP is trusted by hobbyists and professionals alike for maintaining vibrant, thriving aquariums.</p>\r\n<p>Key Features:</p>\r\n<p>Boosts Fish Immunity - Biologically supports the fish\'s immune system. Ideal during stress, new fish introduction, overcrowding, or poor water conditions.</p>\r\n<p>Cleaner Tanks, Less Odor - Live bacteria digest organic waste, uneaten food, and sludge. Breaks down suspended particles for crystal-clear water.</p>\r\n<p>Stable Ecosystem - Maintains mineral balance &amp; oxygen levels. Promotes healthy biological filtration and reduces ammonia/nitrite buildup.</p>\r\n<p>Supports Breeding &amp; Growth - Creates ideal water conditions for reproduction and promotes rapid, healthy fish growth.</p>\r\n<p>100% Safe &amp; Natural - Non-toxic, non-pathogenic. Safe for all fish, invertebrates, corals, plants, pets, and wildlife. NOT genetically engineered.</p>\r\n<p>Dosage Instructions:</p>\r\n<p>Aquariums: 10ml per 20L weekly.<br>Shake well before use. Turn off UV clarifiers and ozone for 48 hours after dosing. Use consistently for best results, especially after adding fish or treatments. <strong>Best For:</strong> New tank syndrome, disease prevention, high bio-load tanks, recovery after medications, breeding tanks, and year-round ecosystem support.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-27 09:00:05', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(94, NULL, 15, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'EASY-LIFE BIO-EXIT SILICATE', 'Easy-Life Bio-Exit Silicate is a professional water treatment designed to neutralize excess silicates in freshwater aquariums. High silicate levels are one of the primary causes of brown algae (diatoms) and unsightly brown deposits on aquarium glass, substrate, decorations, and plant leaves. By reducing available silicates, Bio-Exit Silicate helps create a cleaner, healthier, and more balanced aquatic environment.', 'easy-life-bio-exit-silicate', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/easylifebioexitsilicate250ml.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'EASY-LIFE', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Easy-Life Bio-Exit Silicate </strong>is a professional water treatment designed to neutralize excess silicates in freshwater aquariums. High silicate levels are one of the primary causes of brown algae (diatoms) and unsightly brown deposits on aquarium glass, substrate, decorations, and plant leaves. By reducing available silicates, Bio-Exit Silicate helps create a cleaner, healthier, and more balanced aquatic environment.</p>\r\n<p>Suitable for both <strong>planted and community aquariums,</strong> this advanced formula works to improve water quality while supporting the natural balance of your aquarium. Regular use helps prevent the recurrence of brown algae, allowing aquatic plants to thrive and enhancing the overall appearance of your tank.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you&rsquo;re setting up a new aquarium or maintaining an established one, Easy-Life Bio-Exit Silicate provides an effective solution for controlling silicate-related issues and maintaining crystal-clear water.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p>* Neutralizes excess silicates in freshwater aquariums<br>* Helps prevent brown algae (diatoms) and brown deposits<br>* Improves overall water quality<br>* Supports a healthier aquatic environment<br>* Safe for fish, aquatic plants, and beneficial bacteria when used as directed<br>* Ideal for planted, community, and ornamental freshwater aquariums<br>* Easy-to-dose liquid formula<br>* Professional-grade aquarium care solution</p>\r\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>* Reduces the cause of brown algae outbreaks<br>* Keeps aquarium glass and decorations cleaner<br>* Encourages healthy plant growth by minimizing algae competition<br>* Promotes a balanced aquarium ecosystem<br>* Helps maintain clear, attractive water</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Product Name: Easy-Life Bio-Exit Silicate<br>* Product Type: Silicate Neutralizer<br>* Suitable For: Freshwater Aquariums<br>* Purpose: Reduces silicates and helps prevent brown algae (diatoms)<br>* Volume: 250 ml (8.4 fl. oz.)<br>* Application: Professional Aquarium Water Treatment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Dosage Instructions:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Standard Dose: 10ml per 20 liters on Day 1 and Day 3<br>Important: Do not change water for 7 days after the first dose. Shake well before use</p>\r\n<p>Easy-Life Bio-Exit Silicate is the ideal choice for aquarists looking to eliminate silicate-related problems, prevent brown algae, and maintain a clean, healthy, and beautifully balanced freshwater aquarium.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-27 09:11:43', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(95, NULL, 22, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'TROPICA SPECIALISED NUTRITION', 'Tropica Specialised Nutrition is a complete liquid fertilizer specially formulated for heavily planted freshwater aquariums. Designed for aquascapers and planted tank enthusiasts, it provides essential macro and micronutrients that aquatic plants need for healthy growth, vibrant colors, and long-term vitality.', 'tropica-specialised-nutrition', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/tropicaspecialisednutrition300ml.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'TROPICA', NULL, 5, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Tropica Specialised Nutrition</strong> is a professional-grade liquid fertilizer formulated for heavily planted aquariums with few fish. It delivers all essential macro and micronutrients, including nitrogen (N) and phosphorus (P), to fuel fast growth, intense color, and lush carpet plants in high-tech setups.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Tropica Specialised Nutrition</strong> is a complete liquid fertilizer specially formulated for heavily planted freshwater aquariums. Designed for aquascapers and planted tank enthusiasts, it provides essential macro and micronutrients that aquatic plants need for healthy growth, vibrant colors, and long-term vitality.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Complete Macro + Micro Formula -</strong> Contains N 1.3%, P 0.1%, K 1.0%, Mg 0.4% plus iron, manganese, boron, copper, zinc &amp; molybdenum.</p>\r\n<p><strong>For Demanding Planted Tanks -</strong> Ideal where fish load is low and plants can&rsquo;t rely on fish waste for nutrients. Perfect for CO₂ injected, high-light aquascapes.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Fast-Growing Plant Support - </strong>Nitrogen &amp; phosphorus boost rapid growth of stems, carpet, and foreground plants that absorb nutrients through leaves.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Precision Pump Dosing</strong> - Bottle includes pump dispenser: <strong>1 push = 2ml</strong>. No measuring caps or syringes needed.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Safe for Livestock -</strong> Suitable for tanks with fish, shrimp &amp; sensitive species when dosed as directed.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosage Instructions:</strong>Standard Dose: 6ml (3 pumps) per 50L weekly during water change<br>Adjust based on plant mass and growth. If algae appears, reduce dose by 50% and increase water change frequency by 50%<br>Maintenance: Change 25%+ water weekly to prevent nutrient buildup.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For: </strong>Dutch-style aquascapes, Iwagumi, carpet plants like Monte Carlo &amp; HC Cuba, stem plants, and any tank where plants show deficiency despite good light &amp; CO₂.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-27 09:13:46', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(96, NULL, 14, '18 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Shiruba  PF-120', 'Shiruba PF-120 is a compact, ultra-quiet hang-on-back filter designed for nano aquariums, shrimp tanks, and bettas up to 20L. With adjustable flow and patented auto-restart, it delivers reliable 3-stage filtration while saving space inside your tank.', 'shiruba-pf-120', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/SHIRUBAPF-1201.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/SHIRUBAPF-120.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, '1 year', NULL, NULL, 'Shiruba', NULL, 4, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Shiruba PF-120</strong> is a compact, ultra-quiet hang-on-back filter designed for nano aquariums, shrimp tanks, and bettas up to 20L. With adjustable flow and patented auto-restart, it delivers reliable 3-stage filtration while saving space inside your tank.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>3-Stage Filtration System -</strong> Physical, chemical, and biological filtration removes impurities, decolors, deodorizes, and dissolves water toxins for crystal-clear water.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Flow Control - </strong>120L/H flow rate with adjustable valve. Customize flow for delicate species like shrimp, bettas, and fry.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Self-Priming &amp; Auto-Restart </strong>- No need to refill water after power interruptions. Restarts automatically with multinational patented technology.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ultra-Quiet 4W Motor </strong>- Super quiet submersible motor ideal for bedrooms and offices. Low energy consumption for 24/7 operation.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Shrimp &amp; Fry Safe - </strong>Includes anti-suction strainer sponge to prevent small fish and shrimp from being drawn in. Telescopic inlet pipe prevents dirt buildup at tank base.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For: </strong></p>\r\n<p>Nano tanks, shrimp tanks, betta aquariums, planted setups, and small community tanks up to 20L. Perfect for desktops and bedrooms due to silent operation.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Note</strong>: Filter comes with sponge only. Use Shiruba special-purpose filter cartridges for optimized mechanical, chemical, and biological filtration. Hang on tank rim, fill chamber with tank water to prime, and plug in.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Specifications:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Model=Shiruba PF-120</p>\r\n<p>Tank Size=Up to 20L / 5 Gallons</p>\r\n<p>Flow Rate=120 L/H / 30 GPH</p>\r\n<p>Power Consumption=4W</p>\r\n<p>Voltage=AC 110V/230V 50Hz/60Hz</p>\r\n<p>Dimensions=102 x 84 x 116mm</p>\r\n<p>Material=High-quality ABS Plastic</p>\r\n<p>Origin=Designed &amp; Made in Taiwan</p>\r\n<p>Media=Strainer sponge included. Uses replaceable filter cartridges</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Warranty= 1 year</span></strong></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-28 10:06:44', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(97, NULL, 14, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Shiruba PF-1000', 'Shiruba PF-1000 is a reliable hang-on-back power filter designed for aquariums up to 100L. With 720L/H flow and patented auto-restart, it delivers powerful 3-stage filtration while keeping your tank interior open for fish and plants.', 'shiruba-pf-1000', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/Shirubapf-10001.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/Shirubapf-1000.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, '1 year', NULL, NULL, 'Shiruba', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Shiruba PF-1000 </strong>is a reliable hang-on-back power filter designed for aquariums up to 100L. With 720L/H flow and patented auto-restart, it delivers powerful 3-stage filtration while keeping your tank interior open for fish and plants.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>3-Stage Filtration - </strong>Physical, chemical, and biological filtration removes debris, odors, toxins, and impurities. Decolors and deodorizes for crystal-clear water.</p>\r\n<p><strong>High Flow, Quiet Motor -</strong> 720L/H pump output with ultra-quiet 8W motor. Self-priming function with no need for refilling water after power restart.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Flow Control -</strong> Flow control valve lets you reduce current for sensitive species like bettas, shrimp, and fry. Telescopic inlet pipe prevents dirt buildup at tank base.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy to Install &amp; Maintain -</strong> Classic HOB design hangs securely on tank rim. Quick &amp; easy cartridge changes. Replaceable filter cartridges recommended for optimized effect.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Strainer Sponge Included -</strong> Protects fry and shrimp from intake. Made in Taiwan with high-quality ABS plastic for long-term reliability.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Specifications</strong></span>:</p>\r\n<p>Model=Shiruba PF-1000</p>\r\n<p>Tank Size=Up to 100L / 30 Gallons</p>\r\n<p>Flow Rate=720 L/H / 180 GPH</p>\r\n<p>Power Consumption=8W</p>\r\n<p>Voltage=AC 110V/230V 50Hz/60Hz</p>\r\n<p>Dimensions=188 x 132 x 170mm</p>\r\n<p>Material=High-quality ABS Plastic</p>\r\n<p>Origin=Designed &amp; Made in Taiwan</p>\r\n<p>Media=Strainer sponge included. Uses replaceable cartridges.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Warranty= 1 year</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Highlights from Box:</strong><br>Strainer Sponge Included - Safe for fry &amp; shrimp.</p>\r\n<p>No need refilling water against power restarting - Patented auto-restart function.</p>\r\n<p>Quiet 180 GPH motor with adjustable flow rate.</p>\r\n<p>Quick &amp; easy cartridge changes.</p>\r\n<p>Reliable operation for a long life.</p>\r\n<p>Best For: Community tanks, planted aquariums, shrimp colonies, and goldfish setups up to 100L. Perfect for bedrooms or offices due to ultra-quiet operation.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-28 10:13:14', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(98, NULL, 13, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Shiruba XB-310', 'Shiruba XB-310 is a high-performance external canister filter engineered for medium to large aquariums from 200L to 350L. With 3 large media baskets and 960-1080L/H flow, it delivers powerful 3-stage filtration with easy setup and reliable Taiwanese build quality.', 'shiruba-xb-310', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/shirubaXB-310.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/shirubaXB-3101.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, '2 year', NULL, NULL, 'Shiruba', NULL, 4, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Shiruba XB-310 </strong>is a high-performance external canister filter engineered for medium to large aquariums from 200L to 350L. With 3 large media baskets and 960-1080L/H flow, it delivers powerful 3-stage filtration with easy setup and reliable Taiwanese build quality.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>High Flow &amp; Large Capacity </strong>- 1080L/H max flow @60Hz / 960L/H @50Hz with 160cm max lift height. 3 media baskets hold 1.6L each for 4.8L total media volume.</p>\r\n<p><strong>3-Stage Filtration -</strong> Large filter box with multiple media trays for mechanical, chemical &amp; biological filtration. Separate inlet &amp; outlet design prevents bypass for optimized filtering.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Priming &amp; Control - </strong>Vacuum-assisted \"press-to-draw\" primer button for hassle-free startup. Adjustable flow control switch and 360&deg; swivel taps for perfect positioning.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Safe &amp; Efficient - </strong>Energy-saving 13-17.5W motor with overload protection. Superior ABS &amp; PC engineering plastic construction is elegant, firm and prevents breaking.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Complete &amp; Easy Maintenance -</strong> Uses 16/22mm soft tubing. Sophisticated structure with complete accessories for easy assembly and maintenance.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Specifications</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Model=Shiruba XB-310</p>\r\n<p>Tank Size=200-350L / 40-60 Gallon / Up to 120cm</p>\r\n<p>Max Flow Rate=1080 L/H @60Hz / 960 L/H @50Hz</p>\r\n<p>Power Consumption=13-17.5W</p>\r\n<p>Max Lift Height=160cm</p>\r\n<p>Media Volume=1.6L x 3 baskets = 4.8L total</p>\r\n<p>Chamber Capacity=8.5L</p>\r\n<p>Dimensions245 x 221 x 366mm</p>\r\n<p>Hose Size=16/22mm</p>\r\n<p>Voltage=AC220-240V/50Hz</p>\r\n<p>Origin=Designed &amp; Made in Taiwan</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Warranty= 2 year</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Best For:</strong></span><br>Planted tanks, aquascaping, community aquariums, cichlid tanks, and saltwater systems 200L to 350L. Perfect for medium to heavily stocked tanks needing strong biological filtration.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> Original filter media included. Quick-start primer button makes installation simple. Clean mechanical media in tank water to preserve beneficial bacteria</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-28 10:39:41', 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `product_identity`, `category_id`, `tax`, `row_order`, `type`, `stock_type`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `asin`, `indicator`, `cod_allowed`, `download_allowed`, `download_type`, `download_link`, `minimum_order_quantity`, `quantity_step_size`, `total_allowed_quantity`, `is_prices_inclusive_tax`, `is_returnable`, `is_cancelable`, `cancelable_till`, `is_attachment_required`, `image`, `other_images`, `video_type`, `video`, `tags`, `warranty_period`, `guarantee_period`, `made_in`, `brand`, `sku`, `stock`, `availability`, `rating`, `no_of_ratings`, `description`, `deliverable_type`, `deliverable_zipcodes`, `deliverable_city_type`, `deliverable_cities`, `shipping_method`, `pickup_location`, `status`, `date_added`, `is_on_sale`, `sale_discount`, `sale_start_date`, `sale_end_date`) VALUES
(99, NULL, 13, '18%', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Shiruba XB-305', 'Shiruba XB-305 is a compact yet powerful external canister filter designed for aquariums up to 100L. Perfect for nano tanks and medium aquascapes, it offers 3-stage filtration with versatile installation - hang it on the tank rim or place it beside your aquarium.', 'shiruba-xb-305', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/shirubaxb-305.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/shirubaxb-3052.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/shirubaxb-3051.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, '2 year', NULL, NULL, 'Shiruba', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Shiruba XB-305</strong> is a compact yet powerful external canister filter designed for aquariums up to 100L. Perfect for nano tanks and medium aquascapes, it offers 3-stage filtration with versatile installation - hang it on the tank rim or place it beside your aquarium.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>All-in-One Power Filter -</strong> Complete 3-stage filtration system with mechanical, chemical &amp; biological media included. Comes with bio-mat, carbon pack, bio-rings &amp; hoses.</p>\r\n<p><strong>High Flow, Low Power -</strong> Energy-saving 7W motor delivers up to 440L/H flow with 110cm max lift height. Quiet operation ideal for home aquariums.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Versatile Installation - </strong>Use as Hang-On-Back (HOB) or external canister on tabletop. U-type &amp; L-type soft tubes included for flexible setup.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Optimized Flow Design - </strong>Separate inlet &amp; outlet design forces water through media trays with no bypass. Maximizes filtering effect and efficiency.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Compact &amp; Durable -</strong> 2.5L chamber with 1.5L media basket capacity. Made from high-quality ABS plastic. Tough, reliable, and easy to maintain.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Specifications:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Dimensions=18.2x12.2x26cm(height)<br>Capacity=2.5 liter<br>Diameter Of hose=012mmX016mm</p>\r\n<p>For aquarium up to=100 liter (27usg)<br>Voltage=&nbsp;AC220V-240V<br>Wattage=7.5W&nbsp;7W<br>Max Flow=440 LIH (116 gph)</p>\r\n<p>Lift=110cm (44 in)</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Warranty= 2 year</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Includes:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Bio-mat, Carbon pack, 2x Bio-ring packs, 2x rubber hoses, all pipes &amp; connectors, outlet nozzle &amp; rain bar options.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Best For: </strong>Freshwater &amp; saltwater nano tanks, planted aquariums, aquascaping, shrimp tanks, and community tanks 40L to 100L.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Note: </strong>Filter media and hoses included. Easy to prime, simple to clean. Rinse media in tank water during maintenance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-28 10:41:56', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(100, NULL, 9, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'WRG Rainforest light', 'WebsiteWRG Rainforest Light is a premium 30W full-spectrum WRGB LED track spotlight engineered to simulate natural rainforest daylight. Combining white, red, green, and blue spectrums at 13000K, it showcases vivid colors while supporting healthy plant growth in aquariums, paludariums, vivariums, and terrariums.', 'wrg-rainforest-light', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/06/wrgrainforestlight.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/06/wrgrainforestlight2.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/06/wrgrainforestlight1.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>WebsiteWRG Rainforest </strong>Light is a premium 30W full-spectrum WRGB LED track spotlight engineered to simulate natural rainforest daylight. Combining white, red, green, and blue spectrums at 13000K, it showcases vivid colors while supporting healthy plant growth in aquariums, paludariums, vivariums, and terrariums.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Advanced WRGB Spectrum - Expertly engineered blend of White, Red, Green &amp; Blue LEDs at 13000K color temperature. Highlights natural colors of fish, plants, and reptiles while promoting photosynthesis.</p>\r\n<p><strong>High-Output Performance -</strong> 35W power with 2400 lumens brightness. Provides optimal illumination for vibrant aquatic and terrestrial displays.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Natural Rainforest Simulation - </strong>Balanced spectrum mimics a rainforest ecosystem, creating a peaceful, visually stunning environment that supports healthy growth.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Sleek Track Light Design -</strong> Modern spotlight with adjustable arm and track mount. Available in Black and White finish to complement any setup.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Energy Efficient &amp; Durable - </strong>Lightweight yet sturdy construction with energy-efficient LEDs. Long-lasting durability for aquascaping, reptile setups, or paludariums.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Best For:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Aquascaping, planted aquariums, paludariums, rainforest vivariums, reptile enclosures, terrariums, and landscape displays where natural color rendering and plant growth are essential.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-28 10:44:50', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(101, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life Aayu Blood Worm Pellets', 'Life Aayu Blood Worm Pellets: High-Quality Blood Worm Pellets 45g\r\nGive your fish the best Premium Ayurvedic Fish Food for Color, Health & Activity. Life AAYU Blood Worm Fish Food, a handmade, parasite-free, ayurvedic-based pellet that mimics natural bloodworms-without the risks. Crafted with high-quality ingredients like shrimp meal, spirulina, astaxanthin, and vitamin-rich herbs, this premium food enhances your fish\'s color, boosts immunity, and supports active, stress-free behavior. Ideal for daily feeding and suitable for both tropical and cold water species.', 'life-aayu-blood-worm-pellets', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/Bloodwormpallet_.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/07/3.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/2.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 8, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>Life Aayu Blood Worm Pellets: High-Quality Blood Worm Pellets 45g</strong><br>Give your fish the best Premium Ayurvedic Fish Food for Color, Health &amp; Activity. Life AAYU Blood Worm Fish Food, a handmade, parasite-free, ayurvedic-based pellet that mimics natural bloodworms-without the risks. Crafted with high-quality ingredients like shrimp meal, spirulina, astaxanthin, and vitamin-rich herbs, this premium food enhances your fish\'s color, boosts immunity, and supports active, stress-free behavior. Ideal for daily feeding and suitable for both tropical and cold water species.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Benefits:&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Boosts Color &amp; Activity:</strong> Rich in astaxanthin and spirulina for natural color enhancement and vibrant fish behavior.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Handmade &amp; Parasite-Free:</strong> Safe, clinically tested, and free from harmful live culture pathogens.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ayurvedic Immunity Support:</strong> Includes garlic, paprika, and vitamin-rich herbs that support fish digestion, vitality, and disease resistance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Water Safe Formula:</strong> Won&rsquo;t cloud your tank or disrupt water parameters.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Ingredients</strong></span>:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Shrimp Meal, Fish Meal, Spirulina, Astaxanthin, Beta-Carotene, Garlic Powder, Paprika Extract, Soy Protein Isolate, Fish Oil, Wheat Gluten, Natural Vitamins A, E, B-Complex, Stabilized Vitamin C, Vitamin D, and Herbal Extracts.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Feeding Instructions: </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Use the 1,2 ka 4 Formula<br>Feed 1 fish, 2 times a day, approx. 4 pellets per feed. Ensure consumption within 2&ndash;3 minutes. Remove uneaten food to maintain water quality.&nbsp;<br>Adjust quantity based on fish size and appetite.</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW53774394 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW53774394 BCX0\">Suitable for:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW53774394 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW53774394 BCX0\">all goldfish, all gupies, all tetras, all bettas, all Cichlids, all Angles, all Barbs(Genus Puntius, Pethia, Barbodes, etc), all Kois, Angelfish(freshwater), Molly, Dwarf Gourami, Swordtail, Catfish, Firemouth Cichlid, Rasbora, Parrot fish, Redtail Shark and Rainbow Shark, Loaches, Zebra Danios, Plecostomus.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-07-05 09:31:02', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(102, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'LIFE AAYU BUG POWER FISH FOOD', 'LIFE AAYU BUG POWER FISH FOOD – INSECT-BASED AYURVEDIC PELLETS FOR VIBRANT COLOUR GROWTH & IMMUNITY \r\nA high-protein, handmade insect-based fish food with Ayurvedic herbs that enhances color, improves digestion, and boosts immunity in all freshwater and marine fish.', 'life-aayu-bug-power-fish-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/BugPower.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/07/Bugbites200g.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/bugbites100gback.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\">\r\n<h1 class=\"Paragraph SCXW246234896 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">LIFE AAYU BUG POWER FISH FOOD &ndash; INSECT-BASED AYURVEDIC PELLETS FOR VIBRANT&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">COLOUR</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">&nbsp;GROWTH &amp; IMMUNITY</span></span><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW246234896 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">A high-protein, handmade insect-based fish food with Ayurvedic herbs that enhances&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">, improves digestion, and boosts immunity in all freshwater and marine fish.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW246234896 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW246234896 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">Are your fish ignoring commercial pellets or looking dull despite regular feeding? Most mass-produced foods fail to excite fish or support their natural immunity and&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">. Life AAYU Bug Power changes that.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW246234896 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW246234896 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">Crafted with insect meal, mealworm powder, and Ayurvedic herbs like garlic and spirulina, Life AAYU Bug Power is a digestion-friendly, high-acceptance pellet food that supports vibrant&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246234896 BCX0\">, faster growth, and better immunity&mdash;all while keeping your tank crystal clear.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW246234896 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">KEY FEATURES &amp; BENEFITS</span></h2>\r\n<p><strong>Insect-Based Nutrition &ndash;</strong> Packed with insect meal, super worms, and mealworm protein for natural, sustainable growth.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Worm-Shaped Pellets &ndash;</strong> Designed for visual appeal and easy feeding, even for picky fish.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ayurvedic &amp; Herbal Support &ndash; </strong>Includes garlic, spirulina, yeast extract, and more for improved digestion and immunity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Color &amp; Growth Enhancer &ndash; </strong>Astaxanthin and vitamin E naturally enhance pigmentation and body development.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Water Safe Formula &ndash;</strong> Handmade with clean ingredients that reduce water clouding and tank maintenance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>For All Aquarium Fish &ndash;</strong> Perfect for goldfish, cichlids, guppies, tetras, bettas, gouramis, marine omnivores, and more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">INGREDIENTS</span></h2>\r\n<p>Insect meal, mealworm powder, super worms, blood worm, anchovies, shrimp meal, garlic, spirulina, astaxanthin, choline chloride, wheat flour, yeast extract, soy protein isolate, stabilized vitamin C, vitamin A, vitamin E, vitamin D, antioxidants.</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">WHAT\'S IN THE BOX</span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\">It includes 100g or 200g pack of Life Aayu Bug Power, Insect based ayurvedic pellets for vibrant color growth &amp; immunity.</div>\r\n<h2 class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">DIRECTION FOR USE</span></h2>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\">Feed 1&ndash;2 times daily. Offer approximately 4 pellets per fish or as much as they can consume within 2&ndash;3 minutes. Remove uneaten food. Best used with Life AAYU Nutro Fit Plus once a week for added immunity.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\"><strong>CAN BE FED TO FRESHWATER FISHES:</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\">Perfect for all goldfish, Guppies, All tetras, all Cichlid, Angelfish, Discus, all Betta, all Barbs, all Minnows and Danios.</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW246234896 BCX0\">&nbsp;</div>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-07-05 10:28:58', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(103, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life AAYU Flowerhorn Food', 'Life AAYU Flowerhorn Food – Ayurvedic Growth & Color Boost Formula for Juvenile And Adult Flowerhorns | With Papaya, Red Paprika & Tulsi (100g) \r\nHandmade Ayurvedic fish food for small Flowerhorns, formulated with papaya leaf, gooseberry, tulsi, and red paprika to boost immunity, color, growth, and water clarity.', 'life-aayu-flowerhorn-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 3, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/flowerhorn.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 6, 1, 0, 0, '<div class=\"SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<h1 class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">Life AAYU Flowerhorn Food &ndash; Ayurvedic Growth &amp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW100084688 BCX0\">Color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">&nbsp;Boost Formula for Juvenile And Adult Flowerhorns | With Papaya, Red Paprika &amp; Tulsi (100g)</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW100084688 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></span></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">Handmade Ayurvedic fish food for small Flowerhorns, formulated with papaya leaf, gooseberry,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW100084688 BCX0\">tulsi</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">, and red paprika to boost immunity,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW100084688