/span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW100084688 BCX0\">tulsi</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">&nbsp;for immunity and longevity,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">it&rsquo;s</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">&nbsp;a complete dietary solution that also keeps your tank clean.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW100084688 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">KEY FEATURES &amp; BENEFITS</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW100084688 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><strong>Natural Growth Support &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Papaya leaf and gooseberry promote digestion, muscle gain, and vitality.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW100084688 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><strong><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW100084688 BCX0\">Color</span></strong><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><strong>&nbsp;Enhancement Formula &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Red paprika and astaxanthin enhance deep red and copper hues.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW100084688 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><strong>Immunity Booster with Tulsi &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Strengthens resistance to stress and illness for long life.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><strong>Handmade &amp; Ayurvedic &ndash; </strong>Crafted in India using clinically tested, holistic ingredients.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW100084688 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><strong>Clean Water Support &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Soft-sinking, digestion-friendly pellets reduce tank waste and keep water stable.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW100084688 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><strong>Tailored for Juvenile Flowerhorns &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Ideal for small Flowerhorns aged 1&ndash;3 inches.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW100084688 BCX0\" da