t;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">1 x 100g&nbsp; of Ayurvedic Flowerhorn pellets&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">DIRECTIONS FOR USE &ndash;&nbsp;</span></span><strong><span class=\"EOP SCXW100084688 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">Feed 1 fish, 2 times a day,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW100084688 BCX0\">approx</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">&nbsp;4 pellets per feed.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW100084688 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW100084688 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">Let fish consume in 2&ndash;3 minutes. Remove uneaten food.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW100084688 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW100084688 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">Adjust quantity based on size and tank load.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW100084688 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW100084688 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">Pair with Life AAYU&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">Nutro</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">&nbsp;Fit Plus weekly for best results.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW100084688 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">SUITABILITY:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><strong>All Flowerhorn Variants</strong>: Kamfa Flowerhorn, Zhen Zhu Flowerhorn, Golden Base Flowerhorn, Golden Monkey (Kong) Flowerhorn, Thai Silk Flowerhorn (Titanium), Red Dragon Flowerhorn, King Kamfa Flowerhorn, Faders Flowerhorn, Super Red Monkey Flowerhorn (SRM), Kamalau Flowerhorn, Blue Diamond Flowerhorn, Red Texas Flowerhorn, Purple Rose Queen Flowerhorn, and Inferno Flowerhorn.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">Use in&nbsp;<strong>Breeder Tanks, Planted Setups, or Solo Flowerhorn Tanks</strong></span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW100084688 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW100084688 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW100084688 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW100084688 BCX0\">Compatible with&nbsp;<strong>Filters and Power Heads</strong></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-07-05 10:43:40', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(104, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life AAYU Goldfish Food', 'Life AAYU Goldfish Food – Ayurvedic Soft-Sinking Pellets with Tulsi, Papaya & Red Paprika for Color, Digestion & Immunity \r\nIndia’s first Ayurvedic fish food made for all goldfish varieties. Enhances color, supports gut health, and prevents bloating with handmade, clinically-tested ingredients.', 'life-aayu-goldfish-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/GOLDFISH.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/07/Goldfish100g3Sizes.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 6, 1, 0, 0, '<h1 class=\"Polaris-Header-Title\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 18pt;\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">Life AAYU Goldfish Food &ndash; Ayurvedic Soft-Sinking Pellets with Tulsi, Papaya &amp; Red Paprika for&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW22218114 BCX0\">Color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">, Digestion &amp; Immunity&nbsp;</span></span></h1>\r\n<div class=\"SCXW248020238 BCX0\">\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW248020238 BCX0\">\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">India&rsquo;s first Ayurvedic fish food made for all goldfish varieties. Enhances&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW22218114 BCX0\">color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">, supports gut health, and prevents bloating with handmade,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW22218114 BCX0\">clinically-tested</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">&nbsp;ingredients.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">Your goldfish looks beautiful&hellip; but is it&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">truly healthy</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">&nbsp;inside? Most floating pellets cause bloating and swim bladder issues. Life AAYU is different.&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">It\'s</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">&nbsp;handmade, herbal, and tailored to the real needs of your goldfish&mdash;inside and out.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">Life AAYU Goldfish Food combines modern nutrition with time-tested Indian Ayurveda. With Tulsi for immunity, Papaya Leaf for digestion, and Red Paprika for stunning&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW22218114 BCX0\">color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">, this soft-sinking pellet is perfect for Fancy and Community Goldfish. Made in India, tested by aquarists, and trusted by thousands.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">KEY FEATURES &amp; BENEFITS</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\"> :</span></span></strong></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">&nbsp;<strong>Reduces Bloat &amp; Swim Bladder Issues &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Soft-sinking Ayurvedic pellets reduce air gulping and floating risks.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><strong>Ayurvedic Immunity Boost &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Tulsi and Papaya Leaf Extracts improve metabolism, disease resistance, and longevity.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><strong><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW22218114 BCX0\">Color</span></strong><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><strong>&nbsp;Enhancement &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Red Paprika naturally intensifies gold, orange, and red tones.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><strong>Digestive Enzymes + Fiber Blend &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Prevents constipation, aids digestion, keeps fish active and stress-free.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><strong>Balanced Nutrition for All Sizes &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Suitable for small, medium, and large goldfish in tanks or bowls.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><strong>Made in India | Clinically Approved | No Artificial&nbsp;</strong></span><strong><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW22218114 BCX0\">Colors</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">&nbsp;&ndash; 100% natural and safe.</span></strong></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&q