llets</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">DIRECTIONS FOR USE &ndash; &ldquo;1,2 ka 4&rdquo; Formula</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">Feed one fish, two times a day, four pellets per feed.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW22218114 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW22218114 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">Feed only as much as the fish consumes in 2&ndash;3 minutes.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW22218114 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW22218114 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\">Remove uneaten food. Adjust based on size, water temperature, and tank bio-load.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW22218114 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW22218114 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW22218114 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW22218114 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span clas