egular Fish Food (Floating Pellets)</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW245698886 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245698886 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW245698886 BCX0\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW245698886 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245698886 BCX0\">SUITABILITY</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW245698886 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245698886 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW245698886 BCX0\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW245698886 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245698886 BCX0\">Best for:</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW245698886 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW245698886 BCX0\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW245698886 BCX0\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245698886 BCX0\" role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"122\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW245698886 BCX0\">Kohaku Koi, Sanke Koi, Showa Koi, Shiro Utsuri Koi, Hi Utsuri Koi, Ki Utsuri Koi, Shiro Bekko Koi, Aka Bekko Koi, Ki Bekko Koi, Asagi Koi, Shusui Koi, Aigoromo Koi, Sumigoromo Koi, Budogor