(106, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life AAYU Neutral Fish Food', 'Life AAYU Neutral Fish Food is India’s first handmade Ayurvedic fish food formulated for tanks with mixed fish sizes. Designed for easy digestion, neutral buoyancy, and no bloating, it works equally well for guppies, goldfish, cichlids, bettas, and even shrimp. Made using anchovy meal, shrimp meal, whole eggs, and Ayurvedic herbs, it supports immunity, tissue repair, vibrant color, and clean feeding, without dirtying the water.', 'life-aayu-neutral-fish-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/NeuralSmall.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<div class=\"SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<h1 class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">Life AAYU Neutral Fish Food &ndash; Ayurvedic Daily Diet for All Fish Sizes&nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">A gentle, Ayurvedic daily fish food suitable for fish of all sizes and types. Supports digestion,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW124994572 BCX0\">color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">, growth, and clean water in both freshwater and marine tanks.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">Too many foods are either too rich for small fish or too bland for large ones. With Life AAYU Neutral, you&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">don&rsquo;t</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">&nbsp;have to choose&mdash;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">it&rsquo;s</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">&nbsp;the one food that fits all. Clean, balanced, and&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">made with ancient Indian wisdom,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">it\'s</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">&nbsp;fishkeeping made simple.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">Life AAYU Neutral Fish Food is India&rsquo;s first handmade Ayurvedic fish food formulated for tanks with mixed fish sizes. Designed for easy digestion, neutral buoyancy, and no bloating, it works equally well for guppies, goldfish, cichlids, bettas, and even shrimp. Made using anchovy meal, shrimp meal, whole eggs, and Ayurvedic herbs, it supports immunity, tissue repair, vibrant&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW124994572 BCX0\">color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">, and clean feeding, without dirtying the water.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">SIZE:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">SMALL=0.5 TO 1.5MM</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">MEDIUM=1.5 TO 2.5MM</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">LARGE=3.5 TO 4.5MM</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">KEY FEATURES &amp; BENEFITS</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><strong>All-Age, All-Size Balanced Nutrition &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Perfect for baby, juvenile, and adult fish in community tanks.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContai