28&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><strong>Cleaner Tank Formula &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Reduces waste buildup and minimizes the need for frequent water changes.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><strong>Ayurvedic Support &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Daily nourishment rooted in Indian wellness philosophy for optimal fish vitality and longevity..</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">INGREDIENTS</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\"> :</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">Fish Meal, Anchovy Meal, Shrimp Meal, Yeast Extract, Wheat Extract, Soy Protein Isolate, Fish Oil, Whole Eggs, Vitamin E (1000 IU/kg), Astaxanthin (traces), Vitamin B12 (2000 IU/kg), Vitamin A (15000 IU/kg), Stabilized Vitamin C (950 mg/kg), Cod Liver Oil, Vegetable Oil, Natural Antioxidants, Permitted Preservatives</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">WHAT&rsquo;S IN THE BOX</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">1 x 100g of Life AAYU Neutral Fish Food</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">DIRECTIONS FOR USE &ndash;&nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW124994572 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">Feed 1 fish, twice daily,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW124994572 BCX0\">approx</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">&nbsp;4 pellets per session.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW124994572 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW124994572 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">Only feed what they consume in 2&ndash;3 minutes.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW124994572 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW124994572 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">Remove uneaten food. Adjust quantity for baby or large fish. Use with Life AAYU&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">Nutro</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW124994572 BCX0\">&nbsp;Fit Plus weekly for best results.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">SUITABILITY:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">All Goldfish Variants, All Gupies Variants, All Tetras Variants, All Bettas Variants, All Cichlids, All Barbs.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW124994572 BCX0\"><span class=\"EOP SCXW124994572 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\"><strong>Also safe for:</strong> Shrimp tanks, Planted tanks, marine tanks</span></p>\r\n</div>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-07-05 11:39:49', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(107, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life AAYU Red Fish Food', 'Life AAYU Red Fish Food is a high-protein, color-boosting pellet feed handmade for ornamental fish in Indian water conditions. Fortified with anchovy, shrimp meal, paprika, and astaxanthin, it enhances hues while supporting immunity, digestion, and water purity. Perfect for Discus, Cichlids, Flowerhorns, and other color-intensive species.', 'life-aayu-red-fish-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/07/mix.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW148867344 BCX0\">\r\n<h1 class=\"Paragraph SCXW148867344 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">Life AAYU Red Fish Food &ndash; Ayurvedic&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW148867344 BCX0\">Color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">&nbsp;Booster Pellets with Anchovy &amp; Paprika | For All Fish Sizes (100g)</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW148867344 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW148867344 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW148867344 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">A handmade Ayurvedic fish food powered by anchovy protein, red paprika, and astaxanthin for vibrant&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW148867344 BCX0\">color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">, strong immunity, and clean digestion in all types of aquarium fish.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW148867344 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW148867344 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW148867344 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">Want fish that&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">glow with health and&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW148867344 BCX0\">color</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">? Stop settling for synthetic pellets. Life AAYU Red Fish Food brings Ayurvedic care to your aquarium, naturally enhancing growth,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW148867344 BCX0\">color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">, and water clarity.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW148867344 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW148867344 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW148867344 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">PRODUCT PROMISE</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW148867344 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW148867344 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW148867344 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">Life AAYU Red Fish Food is a high-protein,&nbsp;</sp