>1 x 100g of Life AAYU Red Fish Food&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW148867344 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW148867344 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">DIRECTIONS FOR USE :</span></span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW148867344 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW148867344 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">Feed ONE fish, TWO times a day,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW148867344 BCX0\">approx</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">&nbsp;FOUR pellets each time.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW148867344 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW148867344 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW148867344 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">Only feed what your fish can eat in 2&ndash;3 minutes. Remove uneaten food.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW148867344 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW148867344 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW148867344 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">Adjust quantity based on tank size and fish activity. Use with Life AAYU&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">Nutro</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW148867344 BCX0\">&nbsp;Fit Plus weekly for full immunity support.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW148867344 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW1488