(108, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life Aayu Shrimp Regular Food', 'Life AAYU Shrimp Regular Food is crafted for the unique needs of Neocaridina shrimp. With a blend of shrimp meal, spirulina, wheat gluten, natural salts, and Ayurvedic herbs, it supports healthy molting, faster breeding, better shell development, and overall shrimp resilience—without clouding your tank water.', 'life-aayu-shrimp-regular-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 5, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/Shrimp.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/07/ShrimpRegBack.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/ShrimpRegwithFood.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 5, 1, 0, 0, '<div class=\"SCXW1610153 BCX0\">\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW1610153 BCX0\">\r\n<h1 class=\"Paragraph SCXW1610153 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\">Life AAYU Shrimp Regular Food &ndash; Ayurvedic Soft Pellets&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\">| Boosts Breeding,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW1610153 BCX0\">Molting</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\">&nbsp;&amp; Immunity&nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW1610153 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW1610153 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\">A handmade, digestion-friendly shrimp food enriched with Ayurvedic herbs and high protein, designed to improve breeding,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW1610153 BCX0\">molting</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\">, growth, and shrimp vitality.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW1610153 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW1610153 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW1610153 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\">Healthy shrimp = a vibrant tank. But&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW1610153 BCX0\">molting</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\">&nbsp;issues, slow growth, and low survival rates are common. Life AAYU Shrimp Food fixes that the Ayurvedic way&mdash;gently, naturally, and effectively.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW1610153 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW1610153 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW1610153 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\">Life AAYU Shrimp Regular Food is crafted for the unique needs of&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW1610153 BCX0\">Neocaridina</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\">&nbsp;shrimp. With a blend of shrimp meal, spirulina, wheat gluten, natural salts, and Ayurvedic herbs, it supports healthy&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW1610153 BCX0\">molting</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\">, faster breeding, better shell development, and overall shrimp resilience&mdash;without clouding your tank water.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW1610153 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW1610153 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW1610153 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW1610153 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span 