(109, '', 10, '', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life Aayu Shrimp Exotic Food', 'Exotic shrimp like CRS and CBS are sensitive-one wrong food can ruin the colony. Life AAYU Shrimp Exotic Food delivers targeted Ayurvedic care to keep your shrimp colony thriving, breeding, and molting the way nature intended. ', 'life-aayu-shrimp-exotic-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/07/ShrimpExoticFront.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/07/ShrimpExoticBack.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/ShrimpExoticWithFood.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<h1 class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW134455802 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\">Life AAYU Shrimp Exotic Food &ndash; Ayurvedic Handmade Feed for Crystal Red &amp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW134455802 BCX0\">Caridina</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\">&nbsp;Shrimp | Boosts Breeding,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW134455802 BCX0\">Molting</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\">&nbsp;&amp; Immunity (30g)</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW134455802 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h1>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW134455802 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW134455802 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\">A handmade Ayurvedic pellet feed crafted for exotic shrimp like CRS and CBS, designed to support breeding,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW134455802 BCX0\">molting</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\">, growth, and long-term vit