span class=\"SCXW134455802 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW134455802 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\">Remove any uneaten food. Adjust based on tank size, colony growth, and water flow.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW134455802 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW134455802 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW134455802 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\">SUITABILITY</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW134455802 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW134455802 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW134455802 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\"><strong>Best for:</strong>&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134455802 BCX0\">Crystal Red Shrimp, Crystal Black Shrimp, Golden Bee Shrimp, Black King Kong Shrimp, Red King Kong Shrimp, Panda Shrimp, Shadow Panda Shrimp, Blue Bolt Shrimp, Red Wine Shrimp, Extreme Red King Kong Shrimp, Extreme Black King Kong Shrimp, Shadow Mosura Shrimp, Blue Panda Shrimp, Red Ruby Shrimp, Fancy Red Tiger Shrimp, Fancy Black Tiger Shrimp, Aura Blue Shrimp, Tangerine Tiger Shrimp, Zebra Pinto Shrimp, Red Pinto Shrimp, Black Pinto Shrimp, Snow White Shrimp, Taiwan Bee Shrimp, Pure Red Line Shrimp, Pure Black Line Shrimp, Mischling Shrimp, Galaxy Pinto Shrimp, Fishbone Pinto Shrimp, Blue Steel Shrimp, Red Steel Shrimp, Orange Eye Blue Tiger Shrimp, Super Crystal Red Shrimp, Super Crystal Black Shrimp.</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-07-05 12:16:44', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(110, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life Aayu Algae Wafer Fish Food', 'Life AAYU Algae Wafer Fish Food – Zucchini & Dandelion Formula for Plecos and Algae Eaters | Improves Digestion & Water Clarity.\r\nA handmade, digestion-friendly algae wafer for plecos and bottom-feeders, enriched with zucchini, dandelion root, spirulina, and shrimp meal to support clean water and healthy gut function.', 'life-aayu-algae-wafer-fish-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 5, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/Algae Wafers.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/07/AlgaeWaferBack.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/AlgaeWaferLoose.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 5, 1, 0, 0, '<h1><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Life Aayu Algae Wafer Fish Food 45g</strong></span></h1>\r\n<div class=\"SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">Life AAYU Algae Wafer Fish Food &ndash; Zucchini &amp; Dandelion Formula for Plecos and Algae Eaters | Improves Digestion &amp; Water Clarity.</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">A handmade, digestion-friendly algae wafer for plecos and bottom-feeders, enriched with zucchini, dandelion root, spirulina, and shrimp meal to support clean water and healthy gut function.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">Is your pleco or bottom feeder eating less or producing too much waste? Most algae wafers are filler-heavy and poor in&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW181835642 BCX0\">fiber</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">. Your&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">algae eaters need&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">real plant-based</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">&nbsp;nutrition that supports digestion, not just surface grazing.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">Life AAYU Algae Wafer Fish Food is carefully formulated with high-</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW181835642 BCX0\">fiber</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">&nbsp;zucchini and dandelion extract to support gut health in plecos,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW181835642 BCX0\">otocinclus</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">, and other algae-eaters. Combined with spirulina, chlorella, and shrimp meal, it promotes vitality while keeping your water&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">crystal clear</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">KEY FEATURES &amp; BENEFITS</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><strong>Supports Gut Health Naturally</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Zucchini and dandelion root extract aid&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW181835642 BCX0\">fiber</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">&nbsp;digestion and reduce bloating.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><strong>Perfect for Plecos &amp; Algae Eaters</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Specifically designed for bottom feeders like&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW181835642 BCX0\">Bristlenose</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">, Clown Plecos, and Otos.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><strong>Clean Water Formula</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Made to reduce uneaten food waste and&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">maintain</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">&nbsp;a healthy tank.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><strong>Ayurvedic &amp; Handmade</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Made in India using natural ingredients and Ayurvedic principles.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><strong>Fortified with Spirulina &amp; Vitamins</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Boosts immunity and overall well-being.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW181835642 BCX0\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">INGREDIENTS</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">Zucchini, dandelion root extract, carrageenan, spirulina, fish meal, wheat flour, shrimp meal, yeast extract, soybean meal, garlic, chlorella, astaxanthin, choline chloride, fish oil, vitamin E, stabilized vitamin C, vitamin A, vitamin D, antioxidants</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">WHAT&rsquo;S IN THE BOX</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">1 x 45g of algae wafers</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">DIRECTIONS FOR USE</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">Follow the 1,2 ka 4 formula:</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW181835642 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW181835642 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">Feed one fish, twice a day,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW181835642 BCX0\">approx</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">&nbsp;four wafers per feed. Ensure consumption within 2&ndash;3 minutes. Remove uneaten food to prevent ammonia buildup.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">SUITABILITY</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"744\" data-start=\"714\"><strong data-end=\"742\" data-start=\"721\">Algae-Eating Fish</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1021\" data-start=\"745\">Siamese Algae Eater, Otocinclus Catfish, Chinese Algae Eater, Flying Fox, Twig Catfish, Hillstream Loach, American Flagfish, Molly Fish, Rosy Barb, Bristlenose Pleco, Clown Pleco, Reticulated Hillstream Loach, Red Algae Eater, False Siamese Algae Eater, Algae-Eating Corydoras.</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"451\" data-start=\"431\"><strong data-end=\"449\" data-start=\"438\">Shrimps</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"707\" data-start=\"452\">Amano Shrimp, Red Cherry Shrimp, Crystal Red Shrimp, Ghost Shrimp, Bamboo Shrimp, Bee Shrimp, Blue Tiger Shrimp, Snowball Shrimp, Yellow Shrimp, Green Lace Shrimp, Sulawesi Cardinal Shrimp, Pinocchio Shrimp, Tiger Shrimp, Blue Pearl Shrimp, Sunkist Shrimp.</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"179\" data-start=\"160\">&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"177\" data-start=\"167\">Plecos</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"424\" data-start=\"180\">Common Pleco, Bristlenose Pleco, Clown Pleco, Royal Pleco, Zebra Pleco, Blue-Eyed Pleco, Gold Nugget Pleco, Butterfly Pleco, Snowball Pleco, Peppermint Pleco, Sunshine Pleco, Titanic Pleco, Vampire Pleco, King Tiger Pleco, Queen Arabesque Pleco.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"424\" data-start=\"180\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">Perfect for plecos,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW181835642 BCX0\">otocinclus</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW181835642 BCX0\">, whiptails, loaches, corydoras, and other bottom-feeders in freshwater tanks. Also suitable for mixed community aquariums and planted tanks.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW181835642 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW181835642 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW181835642 BCX0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-07-05 12:34:35', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(111, '', 10, '', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life Aayu Tropical Loaches Fish Food', 'Specially formulated for tropical Loaches, this premium feed is enriched with organic humic substances and natural protein sources like blood worm paste, mealworm paste, and superworm paste. These high-quality ingredients are designed to boost metabolism, enhance immunity, and promote overall health in Loaches, ensuring a vibrant and thriving aquatic life.', 'life-aayu-tropical-loaches-fish-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/07/LoachesFront.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/07/LoachesBack.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/Loacheswithfood.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<h1><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Life Aayu Tropical Loaches Fish Food &ndash; 45g &nbsp;| Immunity Boost, High Protein, Humic-Enriched Diet</strong></span></h1>\r\n<p>Give your Loaches the nutrition they deserve with <strong>Life Aayu Tropical Loaches 45g.</strong>&nbsp;Specially formulated for tropical Loaches, this premium feed is enriched with organic humic substances and natural protein sources like blood worm paste, mealworm paste, and superworm paste. These high-quality ingredients are designed to boost metabolism, enhance immunity, and promote overall health in Loaches, ensuring a vibrant and thriving aquatic life.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Tailored for Loaches</strong>:<br>Crafted specifically to meet the dietary needs of tropical Loaches, ensuring optimal growth and health.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Organic Humic Substances</strong>:<br>Supports improved digestion and nutrient absorption while maintaining water quality for a balanced aquatic environment.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Protein-Rich Formula</strong>:<br>Infused with blood worm paste, mealworm paste, superworm paste, and black soldier larvae paste to deliver essential proteins and nutrients for enhanced vitality.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Boosts Immunity and Metabolism</strong>:<br>The unique blend of ingredients strengthens immunity, improves metabolic function, and supports long-term health.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Free Stay Calm Plus</strong>:<br>Comes with a free Stay Calm Plus, offering added benefits to help maintain a stress-free environment for your Loaches.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Natural and Safe</strong>:<br>Made with safe, natural ingredients to ensure the health and happiness of your fish.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Ingredients:</strong></span><br>Organic humic substances, blood worm paste, mealworm paste, superworm paste, black soldier larvae paste.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Lifestyle Benefits</strong>:</span><br>With&nbsp;<strong>Life Aayu Tropical Loaches 45g</strong>, your Loaches receive a nutrient-packed diet that supports their unique needs. Combined with Stay Calm Plus, this product helps maintain a stress-free, healthy aquatic environment for your tropical fish.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-07-05 12:40:02', 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
