(112, '', 10, '', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life Aayu Tropical Corydoras Fish Food', 'Life Aayu Tropical Corydoras Fish Food is a premium, daily fish food enriched with organic humic substances, natural protein sources, and Ayurvedic herbs. Designed for Corydoras and tropical bottom dwellers, it improves metabolism, boosts immunity, and promotes active, stress-free behavior. Crafted for Indian water conditions and backed by 30+ years of fishkeeping expertise. ', 'life-aayu-tropical-corydoras-fish-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/07/CorydorasFront.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/07/Corydoraswithfood.jpg\",\"/uploads/media/2026/07/CorydoraBack.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, '<div class=\"SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<h1 class=\"Paragraph SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">Life Aayu Tropical Corydoras Fish Food &ndash; 45g | Immunity &amp; Metabolism Booster | Ayurvedic Handmade Feed</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW229551230 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">An Ayurvedic, handmade fish food crafted to enhance immunity, digestion, and growth in Corydoras and tropical bottom-feeding fish.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW229551230 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r