62&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">INGREDIENT HIGHLIGHTS</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW229551230 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">Fish meal, shrimp meal, fish oil, garlic, spirulina, chlorella, beta carotene, soy protein isolate, organic humic substances, bloodworm paste, wheat flour, vitamins A, C, E, B-complex, and stabilised vitamin D.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW229551230 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">WHAT&rsquo;S IN THE BOX</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW229551230 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">1 x 45g pack of&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">Life Aayu Tropical Corydoras Fish Food</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW229551230 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">FEEDING &amp; USAGE INSTRUCTIONS</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW229551230 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">1️</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">Feed&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">ONE fish</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW229551230 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW229551230 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">2️</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">TWO times a day</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW229551230 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW229551230 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">3️</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">&nbsp;Approximately&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">FOUR pellets per feeding</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW229551230 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">&nbsp;Feed only what the fish can consume in&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">2&ndash;3 minutes</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><br class=\"SCXW229551230 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">&nbsp;Remove uneaten food to maintain water clarity</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW229551230 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW229551230 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">Adjust based on tank size and Corydoras school size</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW229551230 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">SUITABILITY</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW229551230 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW229551230 BCX0\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW229551230 BCX0\">Best for:</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW229551230 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW229551230 BCX0\">\r\n<p data-end=\"523\" data-start=\"187\"><strong data-end=\"209\" data-start=\"187\">Corydoras variants</strong>&nbsp;include Bronze Corydoras, Albino Corydoras, Panda Corydoras, Peppered Corydoras, Sterbai Corydoras, Skunk Corydoras, Julii Corydoras, Bandit Corydoras, Elegant Corydoras, Adolfoi Corydoras, Pygmy Corydoras, Knight Corydoras, Three Stripe Corydoras, Gold Laser Corydoras, Sands Corydoras, Haraldschultzi Corydoras.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"874\" data-start=\"525\"><strong data-end=\"558\" data-start=\"525\">Other tropical bottom-feeders</strong> include Clown Loach, Kuhli Loach, Giant Kuhli Loach, Yoyo Loach, Zebra Loach, Dwarf Chain Loach, Horsehead Loach, Weather Loach, Upside-Down Catfish, Pictus Catfish, Bristlenose Pleco, Common Pleco, Vampire Pleco, Albino Sailfin Pleco, Zebra Pleco, Yellow Phantom Pleco, Peppermint Pleco, Rubber Pleco, Royal Pleco.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-07-05 12:49:31', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(113, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life AAYU Tropical Treats Fish Food', 'Life AAYU Tropical Treats Fish Food is formulated for small-size tropical species that require easy digestion, immunity support, and vibrant coloration. Enriched with spirulina, garlic, paprika, and Ayurvedic herbs like moringa, this feed enhances energy, gut health, and water quality. Handmade in India for sensitive species in high-TDS, hard water, and varying temperature conditions.', 'life-aayu-tropical-treats-fish-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/TTM.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/08/TTS.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 5, 1, 0, 0, '<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<h1 class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">Life AAYU Tropical Treats Fish Food &ndash; Ayurvedic Immunity Boost Pellets for Tropical Fish | Spirulina, Moringa, Garlic &amp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW189567155 BCX0\">Color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">&nbsp;Enhancers (70g)</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h1>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">A handmade, ayurvedic pellet feed for small tropical fish enriched with spirulina, moringa, and garlic to boost immunity, improve&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW189567155 BCX0\">color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">, and support clean digestion.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">Small fish are delicate, yet most food is made for the big guys. Life AAYU Tropical Treats is thoughtfully created for your little fishy friends: soft, handmade, immunity-rich, and gentle on their tiny systems.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">Life AAYU Tropical Treats Fish Food is formulated for small-size tropical species that require easy digestion, immunity support, and vibrant coloration. Enriched with spirulina, garlic, paprika, and Ayurvedic herbs like moringa, this feed enhances energy, gut health, and water quality. Handmade in India for sensitive species in high-TDS, hard water, and varying temperature conditions.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"TextRun