ot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><strong>Soft Micro-Pellets &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Easy to consume for guppies, tetras, rasboras, barbs, and other small fish.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><strong>Water Clarity Protection &ndash;&nbsp;</strong>Clean-burning ingredients reduce ammonia and&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">maintain</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">&nbsp;aquarium hygiene.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><strong>Ideal for Community Tanks &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Works well in nano setups and multi-species aquariums.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">INGREDIENTS</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\"> :</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">Fish meal, anchovy meal, shrimp meal, yeast extract, wheat extract, soy protein isolate, fish oil, whole eggs, vitamin supplements, B12 complex, vitamin A, stabilized vitamin C, cod liver oil, vegetable oil, astaxanthin, paprika, lutein, spirulina, garlic extract, seaweed extract, moringa, permitted antioxidants and preservatives</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">WHAT&rsquo;S IN THE BOX</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">1 x 70g resealable pouch of Tropical Treats pellets + feeding card</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">DIRECTIONS FOR USE&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">Feed one fish, two times a day, four pellets per feed.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW189567155 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW189567155 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">Only feed what can be consumed in 2&ndash;3 minutes. Remove uneaten food.</span></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW189567155 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW189567155 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">Adjust based on fish size and population. Pair with Life AAYU&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">Nutro</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">&nbsp;Fit Plus weekly for enhanced immunity.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">SUITABILITY</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW189567155 BCX0\">\r\n<h3 class=\"Paragraph SCXW189567155 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW189567155 BCX0\">Best for:</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></h3>\r\n<p><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">All Gupies Variants ,</span><span class=\"EOP SCXW189567155 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">All Tetras Variants, </span></span>All Rasbora Variants, All Danios&nbsp;Variants, All Endler\'s Livebearers&nbsp;Variants, All Small Barbs&nbsp;Variants, All Juvenile Mollies&nbsp;Variants, All Dwarf Gourami Variants.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-07-05 13:00:26', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(114, '', 10, '', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life AAYU Baby Turtle Food', 'Life AAYU Baby Turtle Food is India’s first Ayurvedic feed made specifically for young turtles. With natural calcium, omega-3 oils, spirulina, and protein-rich ingredients, it supports hard shell development, boosts metabolism, and keeps your pet healthy without polluting the water. No synthetic dyes—just pure, handmade nutrition.', 'life-aayu-baby-turtle-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/07/BabyTurtle70g.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/07/BabyTurtle70gwithfood.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<h1><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Life AAYU Baby Turtle Food &ndash; Ayurvedic Handmade Pellets for Shell Growth, Calcium &amp; Vitality | For 2&rdquo;&ndash;4&rdquo; Baby Turtles (70g)</strong></span></h1>\r\n<p>A handmade, Ayurvedic pellet food designed for baby turtles, supporting strong shell growth, immunity, and overall health with natural spirulina, omega-3s, and calcium.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Your baby turtle deserves more than just food&mdash;it needs natural protection, strength, and steady shell growth. Life AAYU Baby Turtle Food gives your turtle a strong start for a longer, healthier life.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>PRODUCT PROMISE&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p>Life AAYU Baby Turtle Food is India&rsquo;s first Ayurvedic feed made specifically for young turtles. With natural calcium, omega-3 oils, spirulina, and protein-rich ingredients, it supports hard shell development, boosts metabolism, and keeps your pet healthy without polluting the water. No synthetic dyes&mdash;just pure, handmade nutrition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>KEY FEATURES &amp; BENEFITS&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><strong>Promotes Uniform Shell Growth &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Fortified with natural calcium and trace minerals.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Soft Handmade Pellets &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Safe and easily digestible for baby turtles (2&rdquo;&ndash;4&rdquo;).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Natural Color Only &ndash; </strong>No synthetic colors; green hue comes from spirulina.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ayurvedic &amp; Clinically Proven Formula &ndash; </strong>Designed to protect and nurture growing turtles.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Supports Vitality &amp; Immunity &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Omega-3, stabilized Vitamin C, and D3 promote energy and natural defense.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>INGREDIENTS&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p>Fishmeal, shrimp meal, insect larva meal, spirulina, wheat flour, vegetable protein extract, vitamin C (stabilized), vitamin D3, minerals, trace elements, omega-3 fatty acids, antioxidants, permitted natural preservatives, natural calcium source&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>WHAT&rsquo;S IN THE BOX&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p>1 x 70g resealable pouch of Life AAYU Baby Turtle Food + usage guide&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>DIRECTIONS FOR USE&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p>Feed 1 baby turtle, twice a day, approx 4 pellets per feed.&nbsp;<br>Let the turtle consume in 2&ndash;3 minutes. Remove uneaten food.&nbsp;<br>Adjust quantity based on turtle size and appetite.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SUITABILITY&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><strong>Designed for:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Baby turtles measuring 2 to 4 inches&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>Aquatic turtle species like Red-Eared Slider Turtle, Yellow-Bellied Slider Turtle, Cumberland Slider Turtle, Mississippi Map Turtle, African Sideneck Turtle, Albino Red-Eared Slider, Pink Belly Sideneck Turtle, Mata Mata Turtle, and Spotted Turtle.</p>\r\n<p>Compatible with indoor turtle tubs, tanks, and basking setups&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-07-05 13:08:54', 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
