(115, NULL, 10, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life Aayu Cichlid Regular Fish Food', 'Life AAYU Cichlid Regular Fish Food is a thoughtfully formulated, handmade, and immunity-boosting daily pellet food crafted specifically for all types of freshwater and African Cichlids. Enriched with powerful natural color enhancers like astaxanthin, spirulina, and beta-carotene, along with Ayurvedic herbs that improve digestion and fish immunity, this food supports healthy growth, vibrant colors, and long-term wellness, without clouding water.', 'life-aayu-cichlid-regular-fish-food', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/CICHLIDREG.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/07/Cichlidregwithfood.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 6, 1, 0, 0, '<h1><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Life Aayu Cichlid Regular Fish Food&nbsp;</strong></span></h1>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW202575146 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW202575146 BCX0\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\">Life AAYU Cichlid Regular Fish Food</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\">&nbsp;is a thoughtfully formulated, handmade, and immunity-boosting daily pellet food crafted specifically for&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\">all types of freshwater and African Cichlids</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\">. Enriched with powerful natural&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202575146 BCX0\">color</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\">&nbsp;enhancers like&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\">astaxanthin, spirulina, and beta-carotene</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\">, along with&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\">Ayurvedic herbs</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\">&nbsp;that improve digestion and fish immunity, this food supports healthy growth, vibrant&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202575146 BCX0\">colors</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\">, and long-term wellness, without clouding water.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW202575146 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW202575146 BCX0\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW202575146 BCX0\"><strong><span class=\"SCXW202575146 BCX0\"><span class=\"WACImageContainer NoPadding DragDrop BlobObject SCXW202575146 BCX0\" role=\"presentation\"><img class=\"WACImage SCXW202575146 BCX0\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAAAXNSR0IArs4c6QAAAARnQU1BAACxjwv8YQUAAAAJcEhZcwAADsMAAA7DAcdvqGQAAAANSURBVBhXY2BgYGAAAAAFAAGKM+MAAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC\" alt=\"Shape\"></span></span> <span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-IN\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202575146 BCX0\">Key Benefits:</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW202575146 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;469777462&quot;:[1202],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListCo