(134, '', 19, '', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Red Starfish Aquarium Feeding Tube RF-70', 'Keep your tank clean with the RF-70 Feeding Tube. This universal clamp fits both bracing and rimless tanks and holds floating food in one spot. Easily adjust the height for surface or mid-water feeding. The clear acrylic design blends in while preventing food waste and filter clogging. Perfect for freshwater, marine, and planted aquariums.', 'red-starfish-aquarium-feeding-tube-rf-70', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/redstarfish feeding tube RF-70.png', '[]', 'None', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', 'Red Starfish', NULL, 20, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Keep your aquarium clean and feeding mess-free with the <strong>Red Starfish RF-70 Aquarium Feeding Tube.</strong> This universal feeding station is designed to contain floating food in one spot, so your fish can eat easily without food scattering across the tank or getting sucked into the filter.</p>\r\n<p>The RF-70 features a clear acrylic tube with an adjustable clamp that fits both bracing tanks and rimless tanks. The height is easily adjustable, so you can set it at the perfect level for surface feeders, mid-water fish, or shy species. Its transparent design blends into your aquarium while giving you full visibility during feeding time.</p>\r\n<p>Perfect for flakes, pellets, and frozen food, this feeding tube helps reduce waste, prevent water clouding, and makes feeding multiple fish much easier. A must-have tool for planted tanks, community tanks, and reef setups.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Universal Fit:</strong> Clamp design works on both bracing tanks and rimless tanks</p>\r\n<p><strong>Effective Food Fixation: </strong>Keeps floating food in one area to prevent waste and filter clogging</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easily Adjustable Height</strong>: Screw clamp lets you set the perfect feeding height</p>\r\n<p><strong>Clear Acrylic Design: </strong>Transparent tube for a clean, minimal look in your tank</p>\r\n<p><strong>Reduce Waste:</strong> Prevents food from spreading and keeps water cleaner for longer</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy to Install &amp; Clean:</strong> Simply clamp on the tank rim and rinse after use</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Model: RF-70</p>\r\n<p>Type: Aquarium Feeding Tube / Feeding Ring</p>\r\n<p>Brand: Red Starfish</p>\r\n<p>Material: Clear Acrylic + Plastic Clamp</p>\r\n<p>Compatibility: Bracing Tank &amp; Rimless Tank</p>\r\n<p>Use: Freshwater, Marine, Reef, Planted Aquariums</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-14 11:26:06', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(135, NULL, 19, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'QANVEE ADJUSTABLE ALGAE SCRAPER', 'The QANVEE X-3 Adjustable Algae Scraper is designed for effortless cleaning of both freshwater and marine aquariums. It features a lightweight aluminum alloy handle with 3 extendable rod lengths and an adjustable angle head to reach every corner of your tank with ease.', 'qanvee-adjustable-algae-scraper', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/QANVEEADJUSTABLEALGAESCRAPER_.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/08/QANVEEADJUSTABLEALGAESCRAPER.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6, 1, 0, 0, '<p>The <strong>QANVEE X-3 Adjustable Algae Scraper</strong> is designed for effortless cleaning of both freshwater and marine aquariums. It features a lightweight aluminum alloy handle with 3 extendable rod lengths and an adjustable angle head to reach every corner of your tank with ease.</p>\r\n<p>The 64mm wide precision stainless steel blade easily removes algae from glass without scratching. Comes with 10 replacement blades and a mini wrench for quick blade changes. Perfect for tanks up to 66cm standard length. Keep your aquarium glass crystal clear with the QANVEE X-3.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Angle Head: </strong>Clean corners and tight spots easily</p>\r\n<p><strong>Extendable Handle:</strong> 3 rod lengths, max 66cm for deep tanks</p>\r\n<p><strong>64mm Stainless Blade:</strong> Sharp, corrosion-resistant, safe for glass</p>\r\n<p><strong>For Fresh &amp; Marine:</strong> Works on algae and sand leveling</p>\r\n<p><strong>10 Blades Included:</strong> Long-lasting use with easy blade replacement</p>\r\n<p><strong>Multi-Section Handle:</strong> Extendable rods for different tank heights</p>\r\n<p><strong>Wide Scraper Head:</strong> Covers more area for faster cleaning</p>\r\n<p><strong>Scratch-Free Design:</strong> Safe for glass aquariums</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ergonomic Grip: </strong>Non-slip handle for better control</p>\r\n<p><strong>Premium Build:</strong> Durable and corrosion-resistant</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-14 13:04:39', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(136, '', 19, '', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'HOUPI 100 Aquascape Adhesive', 'The HOUPI 100 Aquascape Adhesive is a high-strength, aquarium-safe glue designed for aquascaping and coral fragging. With 100g net weight, it provides a strong and fast bond to attach rocks, driftwood, mosses, and coral frags directly in freshwater and marine tanks.', 'houpi-100-aquascape-adhesive', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/glue.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, 15, 1, 0, 0, '<p><strong>The HOUPI 100 Aquascape Adhesive</strong> is a high-strength, aquarium-safe glue designed for aquascaping and coral fragging. With 100g net weight, it provides a strong and fast bond to attach rocks, driftwood, mosses, and coral frags directly in freshwater and marine tanks.</p>\r\n<p>The precision nozzle allows for easy and mess-free application. Non-toxic and safe for fish, shrimp, and plants once cured. Dries clear and creates a durable bond that lasts underwater. Perfect for aquascapers who want a clean, professional setup without disturbing their tank.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Aquarium Safe:</strong> Non-toxic formula safe for fish, shrimp, and corals</p>\r\n<p><strong>100g Capacity:</strong> Large bottle for big aquascaping projects</p>\r\n<p><strong>Fast &amp; Strong Bond</strong>: Bonds rock, wood, moss, and coral instantly</p>\r\n<p><strong>Precision Nozzle</strong>: Accurate application with no waste</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dries Clear:</strong> Invisible bond for a natural aquascape look</p>\r\n<p>Perfect For:=Aquascaping, attaching Moss/Java Fern/Anubias, Coral Fragging, Rockscape Building, Freshwater &amp; Marine Tanks</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-14 13:30:32', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(137, '', 19, '', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'HOUYI MOSS GLUE', 'The HOUYI Moss Glue Spray is a professional aquascape adhesive designed for easy moss and plant attachment in aquariums, terrariums, and paludariums. This 750ml spray can instantly bonds moss, grass, and small plants to rocks, driftwood, and mesh without making a mess.', 'houyi-moss-glue', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/mossglue.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, 8, 1, 0, 0, '<p>The HOUYI Moss Glue Spray is a professional aquascape adhesive designed for easy moss and plant attachment in aquariums, terrariums, and paludariums. This 750ml spray can instantly bonds moss, grass, and small plants to rocks, driftwood, and mesh without making a mess.</p>\r\n<p>Unlike liquid glue, the spray form gives even coverage and allows you to create large moss walls, carpets, and tree effects in minutes. Aquarium safe and non-toxic once cured, it&rsquo;s perfect for aquascapers who want a natural look with strong adhesion. Ideal for freshwater aquariums, rainforest tanks, and water-land scapes.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Spray Application:</strong> Even coverage for large areas. Perfect for moss walls and carpets</p>\r\n<p><strong>750ml Large Capacity:</strong> Covers more area for big aquascape projects</p>\r\n<p><strong>Fast Bonding:</strong> Instantly attaches moss, grass, and small plants to any surface</p>\r\n<p><strong>Aquarium Safe:</strong> Non-toxic formula safe for fish, shrimp, and plants after curing</p>\r\n<p><strong>Multi-Use:</strong> Works for aquariums, terrariums, paludariums, and rainforest tanks</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-14 13:37:37', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(138, '', 19, '', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'INSTANT GEL', 'Instant Gel is a professional aquarium-safe adhesive made for aquascaping and attaching aquatic plants. Each jar contains 25pcs of 5g single-use packets, perfect for mess-free application.', 'instant-gel', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/gel1.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, 5, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Instant Gel is a professional aquarium-safe adhesive made for aquascaping and attaching aquatic plants. Each jar contains 25pcs of 5g single-use packets, perfect for mess-free application.This thick gel formula bonds instantly to rocks, driftwood, and mesh, even underwater.</p>\r\n<p>No need for tying with thread or fishing line. It&rsquo;s non-toxic and safe for fish, shrimp, and plants. Ideal for fixing moss, Anubias, Bucephalandra, and other aquarium plants to create a natural, professional aquascape.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>25 Single-Use Packets:</strong> 5g x 25pcs. Hygienic and easy to store</p>\r\n<p><strong>Works Underwater:</strong> Bonds plants directly in your tank without draining</p>\r\n<p><strong>Strong &amp; Fast Bonding: </strong>Thick gel does not flow. Sticks to rock, wood, and moss instantly</p>\r\n<p><strong>Aquarium Safe: </strong>Will not harm fish, shrimp, or plants</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy to Use:</strong> No thread needed. Perfect for moss, Anubias, and Buce attachment</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-14 13:41:55', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(139, NULL, 14, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'JINGYE FISH AQUARIUM FILTER', 'The JINGYE Fish Toilet Filter is a powerful HOB back filter designed for crystal clear freshwater and marine aquariums. It combines a \"Fish Toilet\" pre-filter box with a large 4-layer filter chamber for superior mechanical, chemical, and biological filtration.', 'jingye-fish-aquarium-filter', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/9E371A89-295F-4EC0-BFD3-6C8F9D9D7F50.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/08/CF37DBC9-CAA0-44E9-8A74-B9FE1DDB708C.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, 1, 0, 0, '<p>The<strong> JINGYE Fish Toilet Filter</strong> is a powerful HOB back filter designed for crystal clear freshwater and marine aquariums. It combines a \"Fish Toilet\" pre-filter box with a large 4-layer filter chamber for superior mechanical, chemical, and biological filtration.</p>\r\n<p>With adjustable flow rate and surface skimmer to remove oil film, it keeps your tank water clean and oxygenated. Available in JY-X600 9W 600L/H model. Easy to install, easy to clean, and perfect for tanks that need high-capacity filtration without taking up internal space.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Fish Toilet Design:</strong> Separate pre-filter chamber collects waste before it enters main filter</p>\r\n<p><strong>4-Layer Filtration:</strong> Mechanical, chemical, biological system with black, yellow, blue filter sponges</p>\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Flow Rate:</strong> Control water flow for fish and tank needs</p>\r\n<p><strong>Surface Skimmer: </strong>Removes surface oil film for better oxygen exchange</p>\r\n<p><strong>Model Available:</strong>&nbsp; JY-X600 600L/H 9W. Voltage: AC 220-240V</p>\r\n<p><strong>Perfect For:</strong><br>Freshwater Aquariums, Marine Tanks, Large Tanks, Tanks Needing High Filtration, Aquascapes.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Specifications:</strong></span></p>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; height: 61px; width: 56.7769%; border: medium none currentcolor;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 20.8pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.943%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.8pt; text-align: right;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"150\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong>MODEL</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 17.9481%; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.8pt; text-align: right;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"150\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong>POWER</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.9481%; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.8pt; text-align: right;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"150\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong>MAX FLOW</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.289%; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.8pt; text-align: right;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"150\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong>FILTER SIZE</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 21.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.943%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 21.2pt; text-align: right;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"150\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\">JY-X600</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 17.9481%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 21.2pt; text-align: right;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"150\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\">9W</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.9481%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 21.2pt; text-align: right;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"150\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\">600L/H</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 38.289%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 21.2pt; text-align: right;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"150\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\">165X75X240MM</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-16 08:07:07', 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `product_identity`, `category_id`, `tax`, `row_order`, `type`, `stock_type`, `name`, `short_description`, `slug`, `asin`, `indicator`, `cod_allowed`, `download_allowed`, `download_type`, `download_link`, `minimum_order_quantity`, `quantity_step_size`, `total_allowed_quantity`, `is_prices_inclusive_tax`, `is_returnable`, `is_cancelable`, `cancelable_till`, `is_attachment_required`, `image`, `other_images`, `video_type`, `video`, `tags`, `warranty_period`, `guarantee_period`, `made_in`, `brand`, `sku`, `stock`, `availability`, `rating`, `no_of_ratings`, `description`, `deliverable_type`, `deliverable_zipcodes`, `deliverable_city_type`, `deliverable_cities`, `shipping_method`, `pickup_location`, `status`, `date_added`, `is_on_sale`, `sale_discount`, `sale_start_date`, `sale_end_date`) VALUES
(140, NULL, 19, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'HOSE CLEANER', 'Keep your aquarium filter hoses free from algae and debris with this Flexible Hose Cleaning Brush. Designed with a long stainless steel spring handle and dense blue nylon bristles, it easily scrubs the inside of canister filter pipes, CO2 tubing, and water change hoses.', 'hose-cleaner', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/1FAE007C-8686-41F5-A767-66D8A35A2F0A.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Keep your aquarium filter hoses free from algae and debris with this <strong>Flexible Hose Cleaning Brush</strong>. Designed with a long stainless steel spring handle and dense blue nylon bristles, it easily scrubs the inside of canister filter pipes, CO2 tubing, and water change hoses.</p>\r\n<p>The flexible core bends to follow curves and reaches deep into long pipes without disconnecting your entire setup. Regular cleaning prevents clogging, maintains water flow, and keeps your aquarium water healthy. A must-have maintenance tool for every aquarist.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Extra Long Flexible Handle:</strong> Stainless steel spring bends easily to clean long and curved hoses.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dense Blue Bristles:</strong> Thoroughly removes algae, biofilm, and dirt without scratching.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Multi-Use:</strong> Perfect for canister filter tubes, intake/outlet pipes, air hoses, and CO2 lines.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Rust Resistant:</strong> Durable metal core for long-lasting use.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Cleaning:</strong> Insert, twist, and pull to clean the entire pipe length.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Perfect For:&nbsp; </strong>Canister Filter Maintenance, Aquarium Hose Cleaning, CO2 Tubing, Water Change Pipes, Sump Pipes, Freshwater &amp; Marine Tanks.</p>\r\n<p>Long flexible brush for cleaning aquarium filter hoses and pipes. Removes algae and blockages to maintain optimal water flow in freshwater and marine tanks.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-16 09:08:41', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(141, NULL, 17, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Red Starfish  Protein Skimmer RS-N100 PLUS', 'The Red Starfish RS-N100 Plus Protein Skimmer is built for marine and reef aquariums to keep your water clean and stable. It removes organic waste, proteins, and fish waste before they break down into nitrates, helping reduce algae and maintain water clarity.Its advanced bubble diffusion system creates millions of fine bubbles to trap waste efficiently, while also increasing oxygen content for healthier fish and corals. With adjustable air and water flow, a quiet high-efficiency pump, and an easy-to-clean detachable collection cup, the RS-N100 Plus delivers reliable performance with minimal maintenance. Ideal for reef tanks, FOWLR, and saltwater setups.', 'red-starfish-protein-skimmer-rs-n100-plus', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/redstarfish skimmer RS-N100 PLUS.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Keep your marine aquarium pristine and healthy with the<strong> Red Starfish RS-N100 Plus Protein Skimmer.</strong> Designed specifically for reef tanks, FOWLR systems, and saltwater aquariums, this skimmer uses advanced protein separation technology to remove organic waste, fish waste, excess food, and other pollutants before they break down into harmful nitrates and phosphates.</p>\r\n<p>The RS-N100 Plus features a high-efficiency pump with a fine bubble diffusion chamber that creates millions of micro-bubbles. These bubbles attract dissolved organic matter and carry it up into the collection cup, where waste is trapped and easily removed. This process not only cleans your water but also increases dissolved oxygen levels, creating a healthier environment for fish, corals, and invertebrates.</p>\r\n<p>Built with durable acrylic and premium components, the RS-N100 Plus is both quiet and energy efficient. The adjustable water level knob and air intake valve allow you to fine-tune skimming performance based on your bioload. The detachable collection cup makes maintenance quick and mess-free.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Whether you\'re running a small reef tank or a medium-sized marine setup, the RS-N100 Plus delivers stable, consistent performance to improve water clarity, reduce algae growth, and support coral growth and fish health.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Superior Organic Waste Removal:</strong> Separates proteins and organic compounds before they decompose, reducing nitrates and algae</p>\r\n<p><strong>Enhanced Oxygenation: </strong>Micro-bubble technology increases oxygen content for better fish and coral respiration</p>\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Performance:</strong> Water level knob + air valve to dial in wet or dry skimming for your tank&rsquo;s needs</p>\r\n<p><strong>High Efficiency Pump: </strong>Powerful yet quiet operation with low energy consumption</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Maintenance:</strong> Tool-free removable collection cup for quick cleaning</p>\r\n<p><strong>Premium Build:</strong> Clear acrylic body for monitoring performance + corrosion-resistant parts</p>\r\n<p><strong>Improves Water Clarity:</strong> Results in crystal clear water and a more stable reef environment</p>\r\n<p><strong>Perfect For:&nbsp; Marine Aquariums, Reef Tanks, Coral Propagation Systems, FOWLR Tanks, Saltwater Aquascapes</strong></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-16 09:28:39', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(142, NULL, 17, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Red Starfish Protein Skimmer RS-M150 PLUS', 'The Red Starfish RS-M150 Plus Protein Skimmer is a high-efficiency in-sump skimmer made for reef and marine aquariums. It uses advanced bubble technology to separate organic waste, proteins, and excess nutrients before they turn into nitrates, keeping your water crystal clear.It also increases dissolved oxygen levels for healthier fish and corals while reducing algae and water yellowing. With an adjustable water level, quiet pump, and easy-remove collection cup, the RS-M150 Plus delivers powerful filtration with simple maintenance. Ideal for medium to large saltwater and reef tank setups.', 'red-starfish-protein-skimmer-rs-m150-plus', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/redstarfish skimmer RS-M150 PLUS.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Red Starfish', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Maintain a pristine and healthy marine aquarium with the <strong>Red Starfish RS-M150 Plus Protein Skimmer</strong>. Engineered for reef tanks, and medium to large saltwater aquariums, this in-sump protein skimmer uses advanced foam fractionation technology to remove dissolved organic waste, proteins, and excess nutrients before they can break down into harmful nitrates and phosphates.</p>\r\n<p>The RS-M150 Plus features a powerful pump and precision bubble diffuser that generates millions of fine micro-bubbles. These bubbles attract organic compounds, fish waste, and uneaten food, carrying them up into the large collection cup for easy removal. By removing waste at the source, this skimmer helps prevent algae blooms, reduces yellowing of water, and creates a more stable environment for sensitive corals and marine fish.</p>\r\n<p>Beyond waste removal, the RS-M150 Plus significantly increases oxygen content in your tank. The high volume of fine bubbles improves gas exchange, supporting better respiration for fish, corals, and beneficial bacteria. The adjustable water level knob and air intake allow you to fine-tune skimming for wet or dry foam based on your tank&rsquo;s bioload.</p>\r\n<p>Built with premium clear acrylic, corrosion-resistant components, and a quiet energy-efficient pump, the RS-M150 Plus is designed for long-term reliability. The tool-free detachable collection cup makes daily maintenance quick and mess-free.</p>\r\n<p>Upgrade your filtration and give your reef the clean, oxygen-rich water it needs to thrive.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Advanced Organic Waste Removal:</strong> Separates proteins and dissolved organics before they decompose, reducing nitrates and phosphates.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Algae &amp; Yellowing Control: </strong>Cleaner water means less algae and better light penetration for corals.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Enhanced Oxygenation:</strong> Micro-bubble chamber increases dissolved oxygen for healthier fish and coral growth.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Skimming:</strong> Water level + air valve for precise wet or dry skimming performance.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Quiet &amp; Efficient Pump:</strong> Low energy consumption with stable, consistent foam production.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Premium Durable Build: </strong>Clear acrylic body and corrosion-resistant parts for saltwater use.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Maintenance: </strong>Large detachable collection cup for quick, clean waste disposal</p>\r\n<p><strong>Benefits for Your Aquarium:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Healthier Reef Ecosystem: Stable water parameters support coral growth and vibrant colors.</li>\r\n<li>Crystal Clear Water: Removes organic tint for better clarity and lighting.</li>\r\n<li>Reduced Maintenance: Less water changes and less algae scraping needed</li>\r\n<li>Better Fish Health: Higher oxygen levels and lower toxins create a safer environment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Perfect For:</strong><br>Reef Aquariums, Marine Tanks, FOWLR Systems, Coral Tanks, Medium to Large Saltwater Setups</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-16 10:37:48', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(143, NULL, 17, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Red Starfish  Protein Skimmer RS-M120 PLUS', 'The Red Starfish RS-M120 Plus Protein Skimmer is designed for marine, reef aquariums to keep water clean and healthy. It separates organic waste, proteins, and excess nutrients before they break down into nitrates, helping reduce algae and maintain crystal clear water. Its advanced bubble system increases oxygen content while improving overall water quality for fish and corals. Built with durable acrylic, a quiet efficient pump, and a detachable collection cup, the RS-M120 Plus offers powerful performance with easy maintenance. Perfect for medium-sized saltwater and reef tank setups.', 'red-starfish-protein-skimmer-rs-m120-plus', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/redstarfish skimmer RS-M120 PLUS.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Red Starfish', NULL, 4, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Keep your reef and marine aquarium thriving with the <strong>Red Starfish RS-M120 Plus Protein Skimmer</strong>. Designed for in-sump use, this protein skimmer is the key to maintaining crystal clear water and a stable ecosystem in medium-sized saltwater, reef aquariums.</p>\r\n<p>Using advanced foam fractionation technology, the RS-M120 Plus generates millions of fine micro-bubbles that attract and trap dissolved organic waste, proteins, fish waste, and uneaten food. By removing these pollutants before they decompose into nitrates and phosphates, it helps prevent algae blooms, eliminates water yellowing, and reduces the need for frequent water changes.</p>\r\n<p>Beyond waste removal, this skimmer plays a vital role in gas exchange. The high-efficiency pump and bubble diffuser significantly increase dissolved oxygen levels in your tank, supporting better respiration for fish, corals, and beneficial bacteria. This leads to healthier coral growth, brighter colors, and more active fish.</p>\r\n<p>Built for reliability, the RS-M120 Plus features a clear premium acrylic body to easily monitor skimming performance. The quiet, energy-efficient pump ensures stable operation, while the adjustable water level knob and air intake valve let you fine-tune for wet or dry skimming based on your tank&rsquo;s bioload. The large detachable collection cup makes daily maintenance fast and mess-free.</p>\r\n<p>Give your marine tank the professional-grade filtration it deserves. The Red Starfish RS-M120 Plus delivers consistent, powerful performance to keep your water clean, oxygenated, and ready for a vibrant reef.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Superior Organic Waste Removal:</strong> Separates proteins and organics before they break down, reducing nitrates and phosphates.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Algae &amp; Water Yellowing Control: </strong>Results in clearer water and better light penetration for coral growth.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Enhanced Oxygenation:</strong> Micro-bubble system increases oxygen content for healthier fish and corals.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Performance:</strong> Water level + air valve to dial in perfect wet or dry skimming.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Quiet High-Efficiency Pump:</strong> Low power consumption with stable, consistent foam production.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Premium Build Quality:</strong> Durable acrylic construction with corrosion-resistant components.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Maintenance: </strong>Tool-free removable collection cup for quick cleaning.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Benefits for Your Aquarium:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Healthier Reef Environment: Stable water parameters promote coral growth and vibrant colors.</li>\r\n<li>Crystal Clear Water: Removes organic compounds that tint water and reduce clarity.</li>\r\n<li>Lower Maintenance: Less algae and fewer water changes required.</li>\r\n<li>Better Livestock Health: Cleaner water and higher oxygen support fish and invertebrate health</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Perfect For:</strong><br>Reef Aquariums, Marine Tanks, FOWLR Systems, Coral Tanks, Medium Saltwater Setups</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-16 10:49:08', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(144, '', 17, '', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Red Starfish  Protein Skimmer RS-N130 PLUS+', 'The Red Starfish RS-N130 Plus Protein Skimmer is built for marine and reef aquariums to maintain optimal water quality. It uses high-efficiency bubble diffusion to separate organic waste, proteins, and excess nutrients before they convert into nitrates, helping prevent algae and keep water crystal clear.The advanced micro-bubble system also increases dissolved oxygen, supporting healthier fish, corals, and beneficial bacteria. With a quiet pump, durable acrylic body, and easy-to-clean detachable collection cup, the RS-N130 Plus offers powerful filtration with low maintenance. Ideal for medium to large saltwater, reef tanks.', 'red-starfish-protein-skimmer-rs-n130-plus', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/redstarfish skimmer RS-N130 PLUS.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', 'Red Starfish', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Achieve a cleaner, healthier reef with the <strong>Red Starfish RS-N130 Plus Protein Skimmer</strong>. Designed for in-sump use, this skimmer is engineered to handle the demands of medium to large marine, reef aquariums.</p>\r\n<p>Using advanced foam fractionation, the RS-N130 Plus creates millions of fine micro-bubbles that bind to dissolved organic compounds, fish waste, and uneaten food. These are then carried up into the collection cup, removing pollutants before they break down into harmful nitrates and phosphates. This process reduces algae growth, removes water yellowing, and creates a more stable environment for sensitive corals.</p>\r\n<p>The skimmer also boosts gas exchange, significantly increasing oxygen levels in your aquarium. This supports better respiration, stronger coral growth, and more vibrant colors. The quiet, energy-saving pump and adjustable air/water controls let you fine-tune skimming performance for wet or dry foam.</p>\r\n<p>Constructed with clear, corrosion-resistant acrylic and premium components, the RS-N130 Plus is built for long-term reliability in saltwater. The large detachable collection cup makes maintenance quick and hassle-free.</p>\r\n<p>Upgrade your filtration and give your reef the clean, oxygen-rich water it needs to thrive.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>Efficient Waste Removal:</strong> Removes organics before they become nitrates and phosphates</p>\r\n<p><strong>Algae &amp; Clarity Control:</strong> Reduces algae blooms and improves water clarity and light penetration</p>\r\n<p><strong>Increased Oxygenation: </strong>Boosts dissolved oxygen for healthier fish and coral growth</p>\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Skimming: </strong>Fine-tune air and water for wet or dry foam production</p>\r\n<p><strong>Quiet &amp; Durable:</strong> Low-noise pump with premium acrylic, saltwater-safe build</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Maintenance: </strong>Large tool-free collection cup for quick waste removal</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-16 10:54:58', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(145, NULL, 22, '5 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Sunken Garden Medium Tech Aquarium Plant Food-Red', 'Bring out vibrant reds and lush greens in your planted aquarium with Sunken Garden Medium Tech Aquarium Plant Food. This liquid fertilizer is specially formulated for medium-tech planted tanks with low to moderate CO2.It provides all essential macro and micronutrients needed for healthy carpet plants, stem plants, and red plants like Ludwigia and Rotala. The unique formula enhances red coloration while supporting strong growth and reducing algae risk. Safe for fish, shrimp, and plants. 230ml bottle - 200ml + 30ml Extra.', 'sunken-garden-medium-tech-aquarium-plant-food-red', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/4A279231-81C1-4A5E-BB38-E8FA64432E23.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SUNKEN GARDEN', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Transform your planted tank with Sunken Garden Medium Tech Aquarium Plant Food - RED. Designed for aquarists running low-tech to medium-tech aquariums, this all-in-one liquid fertilizer delivers the perfect balance of nutrients for explosive plant growth and stunning color.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Enhances Red &amp; Green Coloration</strong><br>The specialized formula boosts vibrant red hues in carpet plants, stem plants, and Cryptocorynes. Say goodbye to pale, nutrient-deficient plants and hello to a vivid, professional aquascape.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Complete Nutrition for Medium Tech Tanks</strong><br>Provides required macro and micro nutrients including Nitrogen, Potassium, Iron, Zinc, Boron, and Molybdenum. Perfect for tanks that are sufficiently planted and have adequate lighting but don\'t run high CO2 injection.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Supports Healthy Growth, Fights Algae</strong><br>By feeding your plants properly, this fertilizer helps them outcompete algae for nutrients. Promotes strong roots, thicker leaves, and faster growth without triggering algae blooms.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Dosing &amp; Safe</strong><br>Dosing is simple: 1ml per 30 liters daily. Beginners can start with half dose. Also suitable for use in terrariums, paludariums, and as a foliar spray for indoor garden plants. Fish and shrimp safe when used as directed.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Specification:</strong></span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 57.4128%; height: 200.6px; border: medium none currentcolor;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 37.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.9996%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; text-align: center; height: 37.6px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"160\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\">Brand</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.9687%; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; text-align: center; height: 37.6px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"441\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\">Sunken Garden</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 37.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.9996%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; text-align: center; height: 37.6px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"160\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\">Type</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.9687%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; text-align: center; height: 37.6px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"441\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\">Medium Tech Aquarium Plant Food-RED</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 37.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.9996%; border-width