(147, NULL, 22, '5 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Sunken Garden Low Tech Aquarium Plant Food - GREEN', 'Keep your beginner and low-tech planted tank lush and healthy with Sunken Garden Low Tech Aquarium Plant Food - GREEN. This all-in-one liquid fertilizer is perfect for aquariums with low light, no CO2, and easy plants like Anubias, Java Fern, and Bucephalandra.It provides the right balance of macro and micronutrients to promote strong green growth without triggering algae. The easy dosing formula works great for tanks with less plants, no soil, and natural setups. Safe for fish, shrimp, and snails. 230ml bottle - 200ml + 30ml Extra.', 'sunken-garden-low-tech-aquarium-plant-food-green', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/DD9FB45D-8B6C-4ED3-88F7-0B274A3DC9B4.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SUNKEN GARDEN', NULL, 3, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Grow a beautiful planted aquarium the easy way with Sunken Garden Low Tech Aquarium Plant Food - GREEN. Designed specifically for low-tech, low light, and no-CO2 tanks, this fertilizer makes plant care simple for beginners and busy aquarists.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Perfect for Easy Plants</strong><br>Formulated to support Anubias, Java Fern, Cryptocoryne, Mosses, and other low CO2 plants. It gives them the essential nutrients they need to stay green, grow steadily, and thrive even without high light or injected CO2.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Balanced Nutrition, No Algae</strong><br>Contains the right mix of Nitrogen, Potassium, Iron, Zinc, Boron, and Molybdenum. The low-dose formula feeds your plants without excess nutrients that cause algae, keeping your water clear and your tank balanced.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Works in Any Setup</strong><br>Ideal for tanks with less plant mass, aquariums with no soil, natural aquariums, terrariums, and paludariums. Can also be used as a foliar spray for indoor garden plants.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Beginner Friendly &amp; Safe</strong><br>Dosing is super easy: 1ml per 30 liters daily. You can also do alternate day or weekly doses. Fish, shrimp, and snail safe when used as directed.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Specifications:</strong></span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.25pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"160\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\">Brand</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 330.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"441\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\">Sunken Garden</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.25pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"160\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\">Type</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 330.55pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"441\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\">Low Tech Aquarium Plant Food-RED</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.25