(149, NULL, 15, '5 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Sunken Garden Tropical Fish Water Conditioner - TIGER BARB', 'Create the perfect water for your Tiger Barbs with Sunken Garden Tropical Fish Water Conditioner. This advanced formula instantly removes chlorine, chloramine, and heavy metals from tap water to make it safe for fish.It also helps reduce stress, supports slime coat formation, and provides ideal water parameters for active tropical fish like Tiger Barbs. Use during water changes, new tank setup, or when adding new fish. 100ml bottle.', 'sunken-garden-tropical-fish-water-conditioner-tiger-barb', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/file_000000003e848211ae7d92d7e50339e6 (1).jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SUNKEN GARDEN', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Give your Tiger Barbs and other tropical fish the healthiest water with Sunken Garden Tropical Fish Water Conditioner. Tap water often contains chlorine, chloramine, and heavy metals that are toxic to fish. This conditioner instantly neutralizes them to make water safe.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Provides Ideal Water Conditions</strong><br>Specifically formulated to support the needs of active tropical fish like Tiger Barbs. Helps maintain stable pH and water quality while reducing stress during water changes and tank transfers.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Promotes Fish Health</strong><br>Supports natural slime coat production which protects fish from infections and improves overall immunity. Reduces stress and helps fish adapt faster to new environments.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Safe for All Tropical Tanks</strong><br>Safe for freshwater community tanks, planted aquariums, and all tropical species. Does not affect beneficial bacteria in your filter.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Instant Detox: Removes chlorine, chloramine, and heavy metals from tap water</p>\r\n<p>Stress Reduction: Helps fish cope during water changes and new introductions</p>\r\n<p>Slime Coat Support: Protects fish from disease and injury</p>\r\n<p>Tiger Barb Optimized: Provides ideal water for active tropical species</p>\r\n<p>Easy to Use: Add during water changes and new tank setupsSpecifications:</p>\r\n<p><strong>How to Use:</strong><br>Add recommended dosage to new tap water before adding to aquarium. Also use when setting up a new tank or adding new fish.</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-19 10:20:41', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(150, NULL, 16, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Sunken Garden Vitilized Aquarium Rock Salt', 'Boost your fish health naturally with Sunken Garden Vitilized Aquarium Rock Salt. This premium, sodium-free aquarium salt is enriched with 15 Vitamins and incorporated sea salt to support immunity, stress reduction, and overall fish wellness.It helps prevent common diseases, promotes slime coat production, and improves gill function without harming plants. Ideal for freshwater aquariums, quarantine tanks, and during water changes.', 'sunken-garden-vitilized-aquarium-rock-salt', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/2A20B99D-1134-4D06-AA08-6824A078E648 (1).jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/08/RockSalt1kg (1).jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SUNKEN GARDEN', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Give your aquarium fish the therapeutic benefits of natural minerals with <strong>Sunken Garden Vitilized Aquarium Rock Salt.</strong> Unlike regular table salt, this is a sodium-free, vitamin-enriched formula made specifically for freshwater aquariums.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Enriched with 15 Vitamins</strong><br>The added vitamin complex helps strengthen fish immunity, improve metabolism, and support faster healing. It&rsquo;s perfect during stressful times like water changes, transport, or disease treatment.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Natural Health &amp; Disease Prevention</strong><br>Rock salt helps reduce stress, promotes a healthy slime coat, and aids in gill function and electrolyte balance. It also creates an environment that discourages many common freshwater parasites and fungal infections.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Aquarium Safe Formula</strong><br>Made with incorporated sea salt and zero sodium additives that harm plants. Safe for most freshwater fish when dosed correctly. Use in community tanks, hospital tanks, and breeding setups.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Sodium Free: Plant-safe formula unlike regular aquarium salt</li>\r\n<li>15 Vitamins Added: Supports immunity, growth, and recovery</li>\r\n<li>Stress Relief: Calms fish during water changes, transport, and illness</li>\r\n<li>Slime Coat Support: Helps protect fish from infections and parasites</li>\r\n<li>Improves Gill Function: Aids breathing and electrolyte balance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-20 07:49:21', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(151, NULL, 15, '5 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Sunken Garden STOP WORMS - De-Wormer', 'Protect your fish from internal parasites with Sunken Garden STOP WORMS De-Wormer. This aquarium-safe treatment is specially formulated to eliminate worms and internal parasites from fish stomach and gut.Effective against common internal worms that cause weight loss, stringy white poop, and poor appetite. Gentle on fish, plants, and beneficial bacteria. Helps improve digestion, growth, and overall fish health. 230ml bottle - 200ml + 30ml Extra.', 'sunken-garden-stop-worms-de-wormer', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/file_00000000d75c8208a85936992114f6bd (1).jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SUNKEN GARDEN', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Keep your aquarium fish healthy and parasite-free with <strong>Sunken Garden STOP WORMS De-Wormer.</strong> Internal worms are one of the most common causes of fish health problems like bloating, weight loss despite eating, lethargy, and white stringy feces.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Targets Internal Parasites</strong></p>\r\n<p>STOP WORMS is designed to remove worms from the fish stomach and digestive tract. It works effectively against nematodes and other internal parasites that affect tropical fish, goldfish, bettas, and community tank fish.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Safe &amp; Effective Formula</strong></p>\r\n<p>The aquarium-safe formula treats your fish without harming plants, shrimp, snails, or beneficial filter bacteria when used as directed. It helps restore appetite, improve nutrient absorption, and support healthy growth.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Treatment</strong></p>\r\n<p>Can be dosed directly into the aquarium water or mixed with food. Regular de-worming every 2-3 months helps prevent re-infestation and keeps your fish active and vibrant.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Removes Internal Worms: Eliminates parasites from fish stomach and gut.</p>\r\n<p>Improves Fish Health: Better appetite, weight gain, and energy levels.</p>\r\n<p>Reduces Symptoms: Helps with white stringy poop, bloating, and wasting disease.</p>\r\n<p>Aquarium Safe: Safe for plants, shrimp, snails, and bio-filter.</p>\r\n<p>Easy to Use: Dose directly in tank or mix with feed</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-22 09:34:27', 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
