(152, '', 22, '5 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Sunken Garden High Tech Aquarium Plant Food - VIBRANCE', 'Maximize color and growth in your CO2 injected planted tank with Sunken Garden High Tech Aquarium Plant Food - Vibrance. This premium all-in-one liquid fertilizer is formulated for high-tech, heavily planted aquariums with strong lighting and CO2.It delivers a complete blend of macro and micro nutrients to bring out vivid shades of green, red, brown, and purple in Dutch style and aquascaped tanks. Promotes dense growth, enhances plant coloration, and helps outcompete algae. Safe for fish and shrimp. 230ml bottle - 200ml + 30ml Extra.', 'sunken-garden-high-tech-aquarium-plant-food-vibrance', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/4A279231-81C1-4A5E-BB38-E8FA64432E23.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, '', 'SUNKEN GARDEN', NULL, 2, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Unlock the full potential of your aquascape with <strong>Sunken Garden High Tech Aquarium Plant Food - Vibrance.</strong> Crafted exclusively for high-tech setups, this professional-grade fertilizer is the secret to vibrant, dense, and competition-level planted aquariums.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Vivid Colors in Every Leaf</strong><br>Vibrance unleashes captivating shades of green, red, brown, and purple. The specialized nutrient ratio intensifies pigmentation in carpet plants, stem plants, and colorful species like Rotala, Ludwigia, and Bucephalandra.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Complete Estimative Index Nutrition</strong><br>Provides everything your plants need under high light and CO2: Nitrogen, Potassium, Phosphorus, Iron, Zinc, Boron, Molybdenum and more. Works on the EI method to ensure no nutrient deficiencies, even in densely planted Dutch style tanks.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dense Growth &amp; Algae Control</strong><br>By giving plants all required nutrients, Vibrance helps them grow faster and healthier, so they outcompete algae naturally. Expect stronger stems, bigger leaves, and pearling within days.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Professional Results, Easy Dosing</strong><br>Simple daily dosing: 1ml per 30 liters. Best results when dosed daily with CO2 and strong lighting. Also works in terrariums, paludariums, and as a foliar spray for indoor plants. Fish and shrimp safe.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 91.9pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\">Brand</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 290.6pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"387\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\">Sunken Garden Sg</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 91.9pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\">Type</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 290.6pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"387\">\r\n