8-22 10:02:50', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(153, NULL, 15, '5 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life Aayu STAY CALM PLUS - Stress Free & Calm Fish', 'Keep your fish and shrimp stress-free with Life Aayu Stay Calm Plus. This 100% natural formula uses Advanced Nano Technology to calm fish, reduce aggression, and help them adjust to new water conditions.Perfect for use during transport, water changes, new fish addition, and breeding. It helps prevent stress-related diseases and keeps fish active, healthy, and peaceful. Safe for fish, shrimp, and plants. 100ml bottle.', 'life-aayu-stay-calm-plus-stress-free-and-calm-fish', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/file_00000000ca0c8211b04d22f61777e705 (1) (2).jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Stress is the 1 cause of disease and death in aquariums. <strong>Life Aayu Stay Calm Plus</strong> is a natural, nano-tech solution to keep your aquatic pets calm, happy, and healthy.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stress Free &amp; Calm Fish</strong><br>This 100% natural formula works on a cellular level to reduce stress hormones in fish and shrimp. Ideal for sensitive species, new imports, and aggressive fish like cichlids, bettas, and tiger barbs.</p>\r\n<p><strong>When to Use:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>During transport and acclimation</li>\r\n<li>After water changes</li>\r\n<li>When adding new fish/shrimp to the tank</li>\r\n<li>During breeding and spawning</li>\r\n<li>When fish show signs of stress, hiding, or aggression</li>\r\n<li>After disease treatment or tank cleaning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Advanced Nano Technology</strong><br>The nano-based natural extracts get absorbed quickly, helping fish adapt faster to changes in pH, temperature, and water chemistry. Promotes better appetite, coloration, and immunity by keeping stress low.</p>\r\n<p>Safe for All Aquariums<br>Safe for freshwater community tanks, planted tanks, shrimp tanks, and betta tanks. Does not harm beneficial bacteria, plants, or invertebrates.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Reduces Stress &amp; Aggression: Keeps fish calm and peaceful</li>\r\n<li>100% Natural Formula: No harmful chemicals</li>\r\n<li>Advanced Nano Tech: Faster action and better absorption</li>\r\n<li>Helps Acclimation: Ideal for new fish, transport, and water changes</li>\r\n<li>Prevents Disease: Low stress means higher immunity</li>\r\n<li>Shrimp &amp; Plant Safe: Suitable for all freshwater setups</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-08-22 10:16:27', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(154, NULL, 15, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Life Aayu NUTRO FIT PLUS - THH Health and Fitness', 'Improve your fish and shrimp health naturally with Life Aayu Nutro Fit Plus. This 100% natural formula with Advanced Nano Technology is made for THH - Total Health & Fitness of your aquatic pets.It boosts immunity, improves digestion, enhances growth, and increases fitness levels in fish and shrimp. Ideal for daily use to keep your aquarium inhabitants active, healthy, and disease-free. 60ml bottle.', 'life-aayu-nutro-fit-plus-thh-health-and-fitness', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/file_00000000aa688211911e66ea8f0bafb2 (1).jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LIFE AAYU', NULL, 6, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Total health is more than just feeding. <strong>Life Aayu Nutro Fit Plus</strong> is a complete health and fitness supplement for your fish and shrimp, made with a 100% natural, nano-tech formula.</p>\r\n<p>THH - Total Health &amp; Fitness<br>This advanced supplement works from within to improve digestion, nutrient absorption, immunity, and energy levels. Regular use helps fish grow faster, show better colors, and stay active throughout the day.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Why Your Fish Need Nutro Fit Plus:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Weak immunity &amp; frequent illness</li>\r\n<li>Poor growth despite good food</li>\r\n<li>Lethargy and less activity</li>\r\n<li>Poor digestion and white poop</li>\r\n<li>Dull coloration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Nutro Fit Plus solves all these by providing essential natural nutrients in nano form for faster and better results.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Advanced Nano Technology</strong><br>Nano particles ensure quick absorption and higher bioavailability. So even a small dose gives big results in health, fitness, and vitality.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Safe for All Tanks</strong><br>Suitable for all freshwater fish, shrimp, betta, guppy, goldfish, and planted community tanks. Does not affect water parameters or beneficial bacteria.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Boosts Immunity: Helps fish fight diseases naturally</p>\r\n<p>Improves Digestion: Better nutrient absorption and healthy poop</p>\r\n<p>Enhances Growth &amp; Fitness: Active, energetic fish</p>\r\n<p>Better Coloration: Healthy fish show brighter colors</p>\r\n<p>100% Natural: No chemicals, safe for shrimp and plants</p>\r\n<p>Nano Tech: Fast action with small dosage</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-22 10:22:54', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(155, NULL, 2, '5 %', 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'JUN Gokujyou Sango Natural Coral Sand - Aquarium Substrate', 'Create a natural ocean-floor look with JUN Gokujyou Sango Natural Coral Sand. Made with 100% all-natural coral material from Japan, this premium substrate is perfect for marine, cichlid, and brackish water aquariums.It naturally buffers pH to neutral to slightly alkaline and releases beneficial minerals to stabilize water quality. Ideal for fish that love hard, alkaline water. No.1 size - fine sand. 5kg pack.', 'jun-gokujyou-sango-natural-coral-sand-aquarium-substrate', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/B4A599DD-5D29-4865-AB0F-D2E0FFD8A22D.jpg', '[]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Bring the beauty of a natural coral beach into your aquarium with JUN Company Limited Gokujyou Sango - Premium Natural Coral Sand. This is Japan\'s top-quality coral substrate, trusted by hobbyists worldwide.</p>\r\n<p><strong>100% All Natural Material</strong><br>Made from 100% natural coral sand, thoroughly washed and graded. No dyes, no chemicals, no artificial coating. It gives your tank a bright, clean, natural white beach look while being completely safe for ornamental fish.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stabilizes Water Quality Naturally</strong><br>Gokujyou Sango is rich in calcium and essential minerals. It naturally helps maintain neutral to slightly alkaline pH (7.5 - 8.2), which is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>African Cichlids</li>\r\n<li>Marine &amp; Reef Tanks</li>\r\n<li>Brackish Water Fish (Puffer, Archer, Scat)</li>\r\n<li>Goldfish &amp; Livebearers</li>\r\n<li>Turtle Tanks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The mineral content helps keep water parameters stable, reducing pH swings.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Perfect Grain Size - No.1</strong><br>No.1 is the finest grain size, ideal for a smooth sandy bottom. Perfect for bottom dwellers, burrowing fish, and for creating a natural reef or cichlid scape. Also great as a filter media in sumps for pH buffering.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>100% Natural Coral: Pure, uncoated, fish-safe</p>\r\n<p>pH Buffering: Maintains neutral to alkaline water naturally</p>\r\n<p>Mineral Rich: Releases calcium and minerals for stable water</p>\r\n<p>Beautiful Aesthetic: Bright white natural beach look</p>\r\n<p>Versatile Use: Substrate + Biological Filter Media</p>\r\n<p>Japanese Quality: From JUN Company Limited</p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-22 10:48:00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(156, NULL, 19, NULL, 0, 'Physical Product', NULL, 'Hardscape Binding Media', 'Create strong, natural-looking aquascapes with Hardscape Binding Media. This specialized aquarium-safe binding powder is designed to securely bond rocks, driftwood, and hardscape materials in freshwater and marine tanks.\r\n\r\nAvailable in Natural Red and Black colors to blend perfectly with your substrate and rocks. It cures underwater, is non-toxic to fish, shrimp, and plants, and creates a durable bond that won\'t break down over time. Perfect for aquarists who want stable, custom hardscape layouts without visible glue lines.', 'hardscape-binding-media', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0, '/uploads/media/2026/08/42179629-708E-4327-A2B0-70D00870A97A.jpg', '[\"/uploads/media/2026/08/E5F6C3C9-F49B-4866-9BDF-804729EC0D2E.jpg\"]', 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6, 1, 0, 0, '<p>Take your aquascape to the next level with Hardscape Binding Media &ndash; the professional solution for building stable, seamless hardscape structures.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Traditional super glues and epoxy can look unnatural and may not hold heavy rocks securely. This aquarium-safe binding media solves both problems. Simply mix with water to form a moldable paste, apply between rocks and driftwood, and it cures into a rock-hard, natural bond even underwater.</p>\r\n<p>It comes in 2 natural colors - Red and Black so you can choose the one that best matches your substrate, dragon stone, lava rock, or Seiryu stone. The texture blends in for an invisible finish, making your aquascape look like one solid formation.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong><br>Strong &amp; Durable Bond: Locks rocks and wood together permanently, even in high flow tanks<br>Aquarium Safe: 100% non-toxic. Safe for fish, shrimp, snails, and live plants once cured<br>Cures Underwater: No need to drain your tank. Apply and shape directly in the aquarium<br>Natural Appearance: Red and Black options blend with most aquascaping materials<br>Easy to Use: Mix with tank water, apply, and shape. Sets quickly for instant results</p>\r\n<p><strong>Perfect For:</strong><br>Iwagumi layouts, mountain scapes, cave building, securing driftwood, repairing rocks, planted tanks, reef tanks</p>\r\n<p><strong>How to Use:</strong><br>Take required amount of powder and mix with aquarium water to form a paste<br>Apply between hardscape pieces and press firmly<br>Hold for 1-2 minutes. Fully cures in 24 hours<br>Excess can be scraped off and blends into substrate</p>\r\n<p><strong>Available Colors: Grey, Brown</strong><br><br></p>', 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-22 11:02:27', 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
