(2130, 'about_heritage_p1', '<p>At Aqua Machine, we believe an aquarium is more than just a tank &mdash; it&rsquo;s a living piece of art. Founded with a passion for aquascaping and aquatic life, we specialize in creating bespoke freshwater and marine aquariums designed to transform spaces.</p>'),
(2131, 'about_heritage_p2', '<p>From concept and custom design to installation and ongoing aquarium solutions, we bring together creativity, craftsmanship, and expertise to create beautiful aquatic environments that thrive.</p>'),
