(1, 'Kalki Fashion Hub | Premium Apparel & Clothing', 'Kalki Fashion Hub', '+91 98765 43210', 'support@kalkifashionhub.com', '+91 98765 43210', 'support@kalkifashionhub.com', '© 2026 Kalki Fashion Hub. All Rights Reserved.', 'Kalki Digital Plaza, MG Road, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India', 'Discover Kalki Fashion Hub, your ultimate destination for premium clothing. Explore men\'s shirts, women\'s dresses, stylish denim, and modern kids\' wear crafted from premium fabrics with precision tailoring.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Our Passion for Fashion', 'At Kalki Fashion Hub, we believe that clothing is more than just fabric—it is an expression of identity, confidence, and elegance. We source premium-grade cotton, linen, silk, and denim to deliver outfits that feel custom-tailored for your life\'s best moments.', 'Connect with Our Fashion Consultants', 'Need assistance with sizing, bulk orders, or custom designs? Speak to our fashion experts today.', '', '', NULL, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Subscribe for Style Updates', 'Join our fashion newsletter to receive styling guides, exclusive seasonal discounts, and early access to new collection drops.', 'Subscribe', '', '', '', '');
